window.TRX.hr = {"(models {0}–{1})":"(modeli {0}–{1})","next day":"sljedećeg dana","single waves up to {0}":"pojedinačni do {0}","{0}, single waves up to {1}":"{0}, pojedinačni do {1}","Install the app on your iPhone":"Instalirajte aplikaciju na iPhone","The site works as an app: an icon on your screen, full screen and the forecast offline. Free, takes a few seconds.":"Stranica radi kao aplikacija: ikona na zaslonu, cijeli zaslon i prognoza bez veze. Besplatno, traje nekoliko sekundi.","The site is not open in Safari right now. Open it in Safari: the ··· menu or the compass icon → “Open in Safari”.":"Stranica sada nije otvorena u Safariju. Otvorite je u Safariju: izbornik ··· ili ikona kompasa → „Otvori u Safariju“.","Tap “Share” in Safari":"Dodirnite „Dijeli“ u Safariju","Choose “Add to Home Screen”. If you cannot see it, scroll the list down.":"Odaberite „Dodaj na početni zaslon“. Ako se ne vidi, pomaknite popis prema dolje.","Tap “Add” and open the app from the new icon.":"Dodirnite „Dodaj“ i otvarajte aplikaciju s nove ikone.","The diary in the icon and in Safari is stored separately, so keep it in the icon.":"Dnevnik u ikoni i u Safariju čuva se odvojeno, pa ga vodite u ikoni.","Later":"Kasnije","Got it":"Razumijem","Tomorrow {0}":"Sutra {0}","Forecast for {0}, the best hour in {1} · updated at {2}":"Prognoza za {0}, najbolji sat u razdoblju {1} · ažurirano u {2}","{0} ({1} km) is not sending reports right now, so the next nearest station is shown.":"{0} ({1} km) trenutno ne šalje izvješće, pa je prikazana sljedeća najbliža postaja.","About":"O aplikaciji","Collapse ▲":"Skupi ▲","Show ▼":"Prikaži ▼","Sea fishing":"Morski ribolov","Safety":"Sigurnost","The bite and weather forecast is calculated from a model and open data. It is a guide, not a guarantee. Conditions at sea can change faster than the forecast. Before going out, check the official marine forecast, tell someone where you are going, and take a life jacket and a phone. The decision to go on the water is yours.":"Prognoza ulova i vremena računa se po modelu i otvorenim podacima. To je orijentir, a ne jamstvo. Uvjeti na moru mogu se promijeniti brže od prognoze. Prije izlaska na more provjerite službenu pomorsku prognozu, javite bliskima kuda idete, ponesite prsluk za spašavanje i telefon. Odluku o izlasku na vodu donosite sami.","Rules":"Pravila","The fishing rules information is collected from public sources and may be out of date. It is not legal advice. Check current rules with a fishing club or the authority of the country you are in.":"Podaci o pravilima ribolova prikupljeni su iz javnih izvora i mogu biti zastarjeli. To nije pravni savjet. Važeća pravila provjerite u ribolovačkom klubu ili kod nadležne službe države u kojoj se nalazite.","Data sources":"Izvori podataka","Privacy":"Privatnost","Wind":"Vjetar","{0} km/h, gusts {1}":"{0} km/h, udari {1}","Waves":"Valovi","Rain":"Kiša","{0} mm in 3 h":"{0} mm za 3 h","{0} mm per day":"{0} mm za dan","Thunderstorm":"Grmljavina","possible":"moguća","Snow":"Snijeg","Cold":"Hladnoća","Heat":"Vrućina","feels like {0} °C":"osjeća se {0} °C","Comfortable":"Udobno","Tolerable":"Podnošljivo","Unpleasant":"Neugodno","Dangerous":"Opasno","Season and water":"Sezona i voda","All calm":"Sve mirno","Minimum size":"Minimalna veličina","Closed season":"Lovostaj","The app language follows the country and can be changed in settings. Fishing rules, cities and weather adapt to the chosen country.":"Jezik aplikacije prati državu i može se promijeniti u postavkama. Pravila ribolova, gradovi i vrijeme prilagođavaju se odabranoj državi.","Nearest weather station":"Najbliža meteorološka postaja","{0} ({1}), {2} km from the point":"{0} ({1}), {2} km od točke","observed at {0}":"mjereno u {0}","Air temperature":"Temperatura zraka","Gusts":"Udari","Pressure":"Tlak","Visibility":"Vidljivost","km":"km","This is a real airport observation (METAR), not a forecast. The station can be tens of kilometres from your point, and wind on the shore often differs.":"Ovo je stvarno mjerenje zračne luke (METAR), a ne prognoza. Postaja može biti desecima kilometara od vaše točke, a na obali se vjetar često razlikuje.","heavy rain, downpours possible":"jaka kiša, mogući pljuskovi","rain":"kiša","light rain":"slaba kiša","up to":"do","h":"h","⛈ thunderstorm":"⛈ grmljavina","No entries yet.":"Još nema zapisa.","Trips: {0}, with catch: {1}, without catch: {2}":"Izlazaka: {0}, s ulovom: {1}, bez ulova: {2}","Total fish: {0} pcs, weight in entries: {1} kg":"Ukupno ribe: {0} kom, težina u zapisima: {1} kg","Most often caught: {0} ({1} pcs)":"Najčešće se lovi: {0} ({1} kom)","Average conditions (successful trips / no catch):":"Prosječni uvjeti (uspješni izlasci / bez ulova):","Bite forecast":"Prognoza ulova","Water temperature":"Temperatura vode","These are just averages of your entries; the more entries, the more useful they are.":"Ovo su samo prosjeci iz tvojih zapisa; što ih je više, to su korisniji.","To compare conditions you need at least 3 trips with a catch and 3 without.":"Za usporedbu uvjeta potrebna su najmanje 3 izlaska s ulovom i 3 bez ulova.","boat":"čamac","shore":"obala","rising":"raste","falling":"opada","Catch diary":"Dnevnik ulova","Point":"Točka","Comment":"Komentar","Trip with no catch":"Izlazak bez ulova","from boat":"s čamca","from shore":"s obale","Change time":"Promijeni vrijeme","On map":"Na karti","Change point":"Promijeni točku","Remove point":"Ukloni točku","📍 No point attached":"📍 Točka nije priložena","Conditions that day":"Uvjeti tog dana","Water":"Voda","Pressure trend":"Trend tlaka","Sea level":"Razina mora","Conditions for this time are not loaded yet. They will be filled in when you are online.":"Uvjeti za ovo vrijeme još nisu učitani. Bit će dopunjeni kada budeš na internetu.","Conditions and the bite score are calculated from weather-model data for this time. They are not on-site measurements or the forecast shown that day.":"Uvjeti i ocjena ribolova izračunati su iz podataka vremenskog modela za ovo vrijeme. To nisu mjerenja na licu mjesta niti prognoza prikazana tog dana.","Moon":"Mjesec","Add comment":"Dodaj komentar","Edit comment":"Izmijeni komentar","Delete entry":"Obriši zapis","Could not read the backup file":"Datoteku kopije nije moguće pročitati","Save":"Spremi","Cancel":"Odustani","New entry":"Novi zapis","Entries ({0})":"Zapisi ({0})","Statistics":"Statistika","Mode":"Režim","When caught":"Kada je ulovljeno","Now":"Sada","3 h ago":"Prije 3 h","6 h ago":"Prije 6 h","Yesterday":"Jučer","Other date":"Drugi datum","Conditions: wind {0}, gusts {1}, waves {2}, pressure {3}, water {4}":"Uvjeti: vjetar {0}, udari {1}, valovi {2}, tlak {3}, voda {4}","Loading conditions for this time…":"Učitavam uvjete za ovo vrijeme…","Could not load conditions. The entry will be saved and they will be filled in when you are online.":"Uvjete nije moguće učitati. Zapis će biti spremljen, a uvjeti dopunjeni kada budeš na internetu.","Fish":"Riba","Count":"Komada","Catch location":"Mjesto ulova","Remove":"Ukloni","🗺 On map":"🗺 Na karti","Remove photo":"Ukloni fotografiju","Save catch":"Spremi ulov","No catch":"Bez ulova","Entries":"Zapisi","Backup":"Rezervna kopija","Save backup":"Spremi kopiju","Restore from backup":"Vrati iz kopije","Export diary":"Izvoz dnevnika","Save file (CSV)":"Spremi datoteku (CSV)","Send as text":"Pošalji kao tekst","No":"Ne","Weak":"Slabo","Good":"Dobro","Peak":"Vrhunac","min":"min","servings":"porcija","Ingredients":"Namirnice","Cephalopods":"Glavonošci","Crustaceans":"Rakovi","Main rules and laws":"Osnovna pravila i zakoni","Details ▼":"Detalji ▼","Where":"Gdje","Bait and lures":"Mamci i varalice","Active hours":"Aktivni sati","Season":"Sezona","Habits":"Navike","What to cook":"Što skuhati","Main names come from the EU commercial names database, Montenegro's Order 011-51/15 and Albania's Decision 402/2013; species not listed there use FishBase and Wikidata. The common name is in brackets. Names vary along the coast, so go by the Latin name. Photos are loaded from Wikipedia (free licences, authors are listed on the article pages) on first view and may not match the species. If a photo does not load, tap the grey box. Rules for shellfish and crabs have not been checked, so they are not in the library.":"Glavni nazivi su iz baze trgovačkih naziva EU, crnogorske Naredbe 011-51/15 i albanske Odluke 402/2013; za vrste kojih tamo nema iz FishBase i Wikidata. U zagradi je uobičajeni naziv. Nazivi se razlikuju duž obale, pa se držite latinskog naziva. Fotografije se učitavaju s Wikipedije (slobodne licence, autori su navedeni na stranicama članaka) pri prvom prikazu i mogu se ne podudarati s vrstom. Ako se fotografija ne učita, dodirnite sivu pločicu. Pravila za školjke i rakove nisu provjerena, pa ih nema u biblioteci.","New moon":"Mlad mjesec","Waxing crescent":"Rastući srp","First quarter":"Prva četvrt","Waxing gibbous":"Mjesec raste","Full moon":"Pun mjesec","Waning gibbous":"Mjesec opada","Last quarter":"Posljednja četvrt","Waning crescent":"Opadajući srp","very clear":"vrlo bistra","good":"dobra","average":"srednja","murky":"mutna","falling fast":"brzo pada","falling slowly":"sporo pada","steady":"stabilan","rising slowly":"sporo raste","rising fast":"brzo raste","per 3 h":"za 3 h","Pressure and trend":"Tlak i trend","Cloud cover":"Oblačnost","Rain and thunderstorm":"Oborine i grmljavina","Water temperature change":"Promjena temperature vode","Time of day":"Doba dana","thunderstorm":"grmljavina","downpour":"pljusak","heavy rain":"jaka kiša","strong wind":"jak vjetar","gusty wind":"udarni vjetar","high waves":"visoki valovi","Peak: {0}. Wind {1} km/h, gusts {2} km/h, waves {3} m, rain in 24 h {4} mm (up to {5} mm/h).":"Vrhunac: {0}. Vjetar {1} km/h, udari {2} km/h, valovi {3} m, oborine za 24 h {4} mm (do {5} mm/h).","Daily maximum: wind {0} km/h, gusts {1} km/h, waves {2} m, rain {3} mm (up to {4} mm/h).":"Dnevni maksimum: vjetar {0} km/h, udari {1} km/h, valovi {2} m, oborine {3} mm (do {4} mm/h).","⚠ Dangerous: ":"⚠ Opasno: ","⚠ Caution: ":"⚠ Oprez: ","Dawn":"Zora","Dusk":"Sumrak","Tide change (high tide) around {0}":"Promjena vode (plima) oko {0}","Tide change (low tide) around {0}":"Promjena vode (oseka) oko {0}","From the sea, onto the shore: builds waves and surf":"S mora, prema obali: stvara val i prasak","From the sea, onto the shore: some chop and surf near the shore":"S mora, prema obali: uz obalu može biti mreškanje i prasak","Offshore, towards the sea: a boat can be pushed away from the coast, be careful":"S kopna, prema moru: čamac može nositi od obale, budite oprezni","Offshore, towards the sea: calm near the shore, a boat can drift out":"S kopna, prema moru: uz obalu je mirno, čamac može nositi na pučinu","Along the shore":"Duž obale","How the score is made":"Od čega se sastoji ocjena","Base (season and water for this fish)":"Osnova (sezona i voda za ovu ribu)","Total: base plus adjustments, limited to 1–10. Season and water temperature set the base, the rest moves it up or down.":"Ukupno: osnova plus korekcije, od 1 do 10. Sezona i temperatura vode daju osnovu, ostalo je pomiče gore ili dolje.","Bite by hour today":"Ribolov po satima danas","Bar height is the score for that hour. Past hours are faded. Dawn and dusk add up to +1.2, bright midday down to −0.8.":"Visina stupca je ocjena za taj sat. Prošli sati su blijedi. Zora i sumrak daju do +1.2, jarki podne do −0.8.","no data":"nema podataka","m":"m","hPa":"hPa","km/h":"km/h","cm":"cm","mm":"mm","kg":"kg","Shore":"Obala","3 km":"3 km","15 km":"15 km","My location":"Moja lokacija","Map point":"Točka na karti","Error":"Pogreška","Could not load data. Check your internet connection. Sea data is not available for points on land.":"Nije moguće učitati podatke. Provjerite internet. Za točke na kopnu podaci o moru nisu dostupni.","Retry":"Ponovi","The weather service is not responding right now":"Servis za vremensku prognozu trenutno ne odgovara","Wind, gusts, rain and pressure are unknown right now, so the bite and conditions scores are not shown. Only sea data is shown. Check the weather in another source before going out.":"Vjetar, udari, kiša i tlak trenutno nisu poznati, pa ocjena ribolova i uvjeta nije prikazana. Prikazani su samo podaci o moru. Prije izlaska provjerite vrijeme u drugom izvoru.","Position found, accuracy ±{0} m.":"Pozicija određena, točnost ±{0} m.","Position found, but accuracy is low (±{0} m). Go to an open area and try again.":"Pozicija određena, ali je točnost niska (±{0} m). Izađi na otvoreno i pokušaj ponovno.","← Done":"← Gotovo","Fishing and location":"Ribolov i lokacija","Country":"Država","Language":"Jezik","Fishing":"Ribolov","From shore":"S obale","From boat":"S čamca","Location":"Lokacija","Shore: Zelenika. 3 km: centre of the bay. 15 km: open sea to the south-west of Mamula island. The “3 km” and “15 km” points are available only when fishing from a boat.":"Obala: Zelenika. 3 km: sredina zaljeva. 15 km: otvoreno more jugozapadno od otoka Mamula. Točke „3 km“ i „15 km“ dostupne su samo za ribolov s čamca.","Shore: at the coastline of the area. 3 km and 15 km: sea points roughly south-west of the shore (boat fishing only). For another point, pick it on the map.":"Obala: uz obalu područja. 3 km i 15 km: točke na moru otprilike jugozapadno od obale (samo za ribolov s čamca). Za drugu točku odaberite je na karti.","Locating…":"Određujem poziciju…","Find my location (GPS)":"Odredi moju lokaciju (GPS)","my current location":"moja trenutna lokacija","🗺 Set location on the map manually":"🗺 Ručno odredi lokaciju na karti","My spots":"Moja mjesta","Nothing here yet. Pick a point, enter a name and save it (or save it right on the map).":"Za sada je prazno. Odaberi točku, unesi naziv i spremi je (ili spremi izravno na karti).","Delete":"Obriši","Spot name":"Naziv mjesta","Save current point":"Spremi trenutnu točku","Theme":"Tema","Sea":"More","Light":"Svijetla","Sand":"Pijesak","“Sea”: blue, light or dark following the phone setting. “Light”: white background and dark text. “Sand”: a warm beige background.":"„More“: plava, svijetla ili tamna prema postavci telefona. „Svijetla“: bijela pozadina i tamni tekst. „Pijesak“: topla bež pozadina.","Background":"Pozadina","Video":"Video","Off":"Isključeno","Bite":"Ribolov","Conditions":"Uvjeti","Days":"Dani","Map":"Karta","Diary":"Dnevnik","Bite and conditions now, {0} · updated at {1}":"Ribolov i uvjeti sada, {0} · ažurirano u {1}","Wind, waves, pressure, water, current, sea level and the score are for the selected hour. Air and the weather station stay current.":"Vjetar, valovi, tlak, voda, struja, razina mora i ocjena su za odabrani sat. Zrak i meteo postaja ostaju trenutni.","Details on the “Conditions” tab":"Detalji na kartici „Uvjeti“","Conditions for anglers":"Uvjeti za ribolovca","Rain today":"Oborine danas","Rain tomorrow":"Oborine sutra","{0}, total ≈ {1} mm":"{0}, ukupno ≈ {1} mm","Most of the rain has already passed.":"Najveći dio kiše je već prošao.","No significant rain expected.":"Ne očekuju se značajne oborine.","⛈ Thunderstorm possible.":"⛈ Moguća je grmljavina.","Chance of rain up to {0}%":"Vjerojatnost oborina do {0}%","Air":"Zrak","Best hours today":"Najbolji sati danas","Wave height":"Visina valova","Current":"Struja","heading {0}":"smjer: {0}","High / low tide":"Plima / oseka","Wind and pressure":"Vjetar i tlak","Beaufort scale":"Po Beaufortovoj ljestvici","gusts":"udari","This is forecast-model data for the selected point. On the street, especially between buildings and near slopes, gusts can be stronger.":"Ovo su podaci prognostičkog modela za odabranu točku. Na ulici, posebno između zgrada i uz padine, udari mogu biti jači.","Underwater visibility":"Vidljivost pod vodom","Range {0}–{1} m, water: {2}":"Raspon {0}–{1} m, voda: {2}","Estimated from waves, wind and 3-day rainfall ({0} mm)":"Procjena prema valovima, vjetru i oborinama za 3 dana ({0} mm)","Your estimate: {0} m":"Tvoja procjena: {0} m","Save my estimate":"Spremi moju procjenu","estimate matched":"procjena se podudara","estimate is {0} m too low":"procjena je preniska za {0} m","estimate is {0} m too high":"procjena je previsoka za {0} m","Saved: {0} m ({1})":"Spremljeno: {0} m ({1})","Sky and air":"Nebo i zrak","feels like":"osjeća se","Today":"Danas","Sunrise / sunset":"Izlazak / zalazak","Daily forecast":"Dnevna prognoza","Loading, or no data for this point.":"Učitavanje ili nema podataka za ovu točku.","{0}-day forecast":"Prognoza za {0} dana","⚠ dangerous":"⚠ opasno","waves":"valovi","Morning":"Jutro","Daytime":"Dan","Day":"Dan","Evening":"Večer","The numbers are the average bite score out of 10 for morning (5–10), day (11–16) and evening (17–21). ⚠ means caution or danger for the selected mode (shore or boat): wind, gusts, waves, downpour or thunderstorm. Scores for later days are rougher than for today.":"Brojevi su prosječna ocjena ulova od 10 za jutro (5–10), dan (11–16) i večer (17–21). ⚠ znači oprez ili opasnost za odabrani režim (obala ili čamac): vjetar, udari, valovi, pljusak ili grmljavina. Ocjene za dalje dane su grublje nego za danas.","below normal":"ispod normale","above normal":"iznad normale","normal":"u normali","usually":"obično","Bft":"Bf","Depths":"Dubine","excellent":"odličan","fair":"srednji","poor":"slab","A new version of the app is available.":"Dostupna je nova verzija aplikacije.","Update":"Ažuriraj","The information is collected from public sources and may be out of date. It is not legal advice. Check the rules with the local authority or a fishing club before fishing.":"Podaci su prikupljeni iz javnih izvora i mogu biti zastarjeli. To nije pravni savjet. Prije ribolova provjerite pravila kod lokalne službe ili ribolovnog kluba.","Montenegro":"Crna Gora","Adriatic":"Jadran","the Ministry of Agriculture of Montenegro":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede Crne Gore","Croatia":"Hrvatska","the Croatian Ministry of Agriculture (Directorate of Fisheries)":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede Hrvatske (Uprava ribarstva)","A licence is needed for any sea fishing, from shore or from a boat (age 14 and over). Daily, multi-day and annual types exist. Annual licences are sold from 1 December to 1 March, generally to residents. Daily and multi-day ones can be bought online from the Ministry of Agriculture.":"Za svaki morski ribolov, s obale i s broda, potrebna je dozvola (od 14 godina). Postoji dnevna, višednevna i godišnja. Godišnja se prodaje od 1. prosinca do 1. ožujka, najčešće rezidentima. Dnevne i višednevne mogu se kupiti online na stranici Ministarstva poljoprivrede.","Recreational licence catch: up to 5 kg per day. Big-game fish (bluefin tuna, swordfish, sailfish) need a separate licence: one fish per day, with a report.":"Ulov za rekreacijsku dozvolu: do 5 kg dnevno. Za krupnu ribu (plavoperajna tuna, sabljarka, jedrenjak) potrebna je posebna dozvola: jedan primjerak dnevno, uz obvezno izvješće.","Gear: up to 2 handlines (“odmet”), up to 2 “kančenica”, up to 2 trolling lines, up to 2 cephalopod jigs. Bottom longlines, pots (up to 3) and spear guns (up to 2) need special licences.":"Alat: do 2 ručne panule („odmet“), do 2 „kančenice“, do 2 trolling panule, do 2 varalice za glavonošce. Dugi parangal, vrše (do 3) i podvodne puške (do 2) samo uz posebne dozvole.","Spearfishing: with a sport licence (through the Croatian sport sea fishing association). Breath-hold only, no scuba, daylight only, with a buoy, under your own power.":"Podvodni ribolov: uz sportsku dozvolu (preko hrvatskog saveza za sportski ribolov na moru). Samo na dah, bez autonomnog aparata, danju, s plovkom, vlastitom snagom.","Do not fish in ports, on beaches and bathing areas from 1 May to 1 October, in special reserves or in several river mouths (Dragonja, Mirna, Neretva, Cetina). National parks (Brijuni, Kornati, Mljet) and nature parks have separate rules and permits.":"Zabranjen je ribolov u lukama, na plažama i kupalištima od 1. svibnja do 1. listopada, u posebnim rezervatima i ušćima nekoliko rijeka (Dragonja, Mirna, Neretva, Cetina). U nacionalnim parkovima (Brijuni, Kornati, Mljet) i parkovima prirode vrijede posebna pravila i dozvole.","Selling the catch is forbidden. EU minimum sizes apply (Regulation 2019/1241). Protected animals (seahorses, turtles, dolphins, red coral, noble pen shell) must not be touched.":"Prodaja ulova je zabranjena. Vrijede minimalne veličine prema pravilima EU (uredba 2019/1241). Zaštićene životinje (morski konjici, kornjače, dupini, crveni koralj, plemenita periska) ne smiju se dirati.","Safety: emergency number 112, maritime rescue 195. Take a life jacket and a phone and tell someone where you are going.":"Sigurnost: broj hitnih službi 112, pomorsko spašavanje 195. Ponesite prsluk za spašavanje i telefon i javite bliskima kamo idete.","Sources: gov.hr (Marine recreational and sport fisheries), croatiatraveller.com, Eurofish. Licence fees and limits have changed, so check the Ministry website.":"Izvori: gov.hr (Marine recreational and sport fisheries), croatiatraveller.com, Eurofish. Cijene i ograničenja su se mijenjali, provjerite na stranici Ministarstva.","Italy":"Italija","Mediterranean":"Sredozemno more","the Italian Ministry of Agriculture (MASAF) and the local Harbour Master (Capitaneria di Porto)":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede Italije (MASAF) i lokalna lučka kapetanija","No licence is required for recreational sea fishing, but the Ministry asks for a free online registration (notification for recreational fishers). Selling the catch is forbidden.":"Za rekreacijski morski ribolov nije potrebna dozvola, ali Ministarstvo traži besplatnu online prijavu. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena.","Catch up to 5 kg per person per day. Exception: a single fish heavier than 5 kg. A spearfisher may take only one grouper (cernia) per day.":"Ulov do 5 kg dnevno po osobi. Iznimka: jedna riba teža od 5 kg. Podvodni ribolovac smije uzeti samo jednu kirnju (cernia) dnevno.","Spearfishing: breath-hold only. Scuba and a speargun cannot be combined. From age 16. Banned from sunset to sunrise.":"Podvodni ribolov: samo na dah. Autonomni aparat i puška ne smiju se kombinirati. Od 16 godina. Zabranjen od zalaska do izlaska sunca.","A spearfisher needs a buoy or flag (red with a white diagonal) visible from 300 m. With a support boat the flag is on the boat and you stay within 50 m of it. Boats must keep 100 m away.":"Podvodni ribolovac treba plovak ili zastavicu (crvenu s bijelom dijagonalom) vidljivu s 300 m. Uz pratnju čamca zastava je na čamcu i ne smije se udaljiti više od 50 m. Plovila moraju držati 100 m razmaka.","Distances: 500 m from beaches used by bathers; 100 m from fixed fishing gear and gill nets; 100 m from ships anchored outside ports. No fishing in port channels and anchorages.":"Udaljenosti: 500 m od plaža na kojima se kupaju; 100 m od stalnih ribolovnih naprava i mreža stajaćica; 100 m od brodova na sidru izvan luke. Zabranjen je ribolov u lučkim prolazima i sidrištima.","Do not collect red coral, molluscs and crustaceans (with some exceptions) or sea urchins. EU minimum sizes apply (Regulation 2019/1241). Bluefin tuna: an accidental catch may not be kept without authorisation.":"Ne skupljajte crveni koralj, mekušce i rakove (uz iznimke) ni ježince. Vrijede minimalne veličine EU (uredba 2019/1241). Plavoperajna tuna: slučajni ulov ne smije se zadržati bez dozvole.","Safety: emergency number 112, Coast Guard 1530. Take a life jacket and a phone and tell someone where you are going.":"Sigurnost: broj hitnih službi 112, obalna straža 1530. Ponesite prsluk i telefon i javite bliskima kamo idete.","Sources: studiocataldi.it (rules overview), areasosta.com, spearfishing forums. Rules differ by region and protected areas; check with the Harbour Master.":"Izvori: studiocataldi.it (pregled pravila), areasosta.com, forumi o podvodnom ribolovu. Pravila se razlikuju po regijama i zaštićenim područjima; provjerite kod lučke kapetanije.","Greece":"Grčka","Ionian and Aegean":"Jonsko i Egejsko more","the Hellenic Coast Guard":"Grčka obalna straža (Hellenic Coast Guard)","Individual recreational fishing licences have been abolished, but the restrictions remain. Recreational fishing in Greek waters is allowed only from Greek-flagged vessels.":"Pojedinačne dozvole za rekreacijski ribolov ukinute su, ali ograničenja vrijede. Rekreacijski ribolov u grčkim vodama dopušten je samo s plovila pod grčkom zastavom.","Catch up to 5 kg of fish and cephalopods per 24 hours. Longline: up to 10 kg. A single fish heavier than the limit is allowed. Grouper (Epinephelus): one per day. Octopus: a weight restriction (500 g) applies, check it.":"Ulov do 5 kg ribe i glavonožaca u 24 sata. Parangal: do 10 kg. Jedna riba teža od ograničenja je dopuštena. Kirnja (Epinephelus): jedan primjerak. Hobotnica: vrijedi ograničenje težine (500 g), provjerite.","Sea urchins: 20 per day for everyone on board (30 with a fishing vessel). Live bait (worms, limpets): up to 30 of each species per day.":"Morski ježevi: 20 dnevno za sve na brodu (30 uz ribarsko plovilo). Živi mamac (crvi, priljepci): do 30 komada svake vrste dnevno.","Banned for amateurs: trawls, purse seines and seine nets, boat dredges, longlines from shore, longlines for migratory species. Large pelagics (bluefin tuna, swordfish) may not be fished from recreational boats.":"Zabranjeno amaterima: koće, plivarice i potegače, brodske dredže, parangali s obale i za migratorne vrste. Velike pelagične ribe (plavoperajna tuna, sabljarka) ne smiju se loviti s rekreacijskih brodova.","Spearfishing: from age 16, breath-hold only (scuba and breathing apparatus on board are banned), daylight only, with a yellow buoy with a red diagonal “Y” flag visible from 300 m, stay within 50 m of the buoy or boat. Keep at least 200 m from swimmers, ports, boats and nets. These details come from older sources, so confirm them at the port authority.":"Podvodni ribolov: od 16 godina, samo na dah (autonomni aparat i uređaji za disanje na plovilu zabranjeni), samo danju, sa žutim plovkom s crvenom dijagonalnom zastavom „Y“ vidljivim s 300 m, ostanite u krugu 50 m od plovka ili čamca. Najmanje 200 m od kupača, luka, plovila i mreža. Podaci su iz starijih izvora, pa ih provjerite u lučkoj kapetaniji.","Safety: emergency number 112, Coast Guard 108. Take a life jacket and a phone and tell someone where you are going.":"Sigurnost: broj hitnih službi 112, obalna straža 108. Ponesite prsluk i telefon i javite bliskima kamo idete.","Sources: alieia.hcg.gr (Hellenic Coast Guard FAQ), Presidential Decree 373/85, DeeperBlue forum. Marine parks and reserves have separate bans.":"Izvori: alieia.hcg.gr (FAQ grčke obalne straže), Presidential Decree 373/85, forum DeeperBlue. U morskim parkovima i rezervatima vrijede posebne zabrane.","Albania":"Albanija","Adriatic and Ionian":"Jadran i Jonsko more","the Albanian Ministry of Agriculture (e-Albania)":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede Albanije (e-Albania)","A recreational fishing authorisation is required. From shore: from the municipality (online via e-Albania; short-term, up to 30 days, for foreigners). From a boat or kayak: a tourist fishing authorisation from the Ministry of Agriculture via e-Albania (about 1,000 ALL per day), with boat and skipper documents.":"Potrebna je dozvola za rekreacijski ribolov. S obale: dozvola općine (online preko e-Albania, za strance kratkotrajna do 30 dana). S čamca ili kajaka: turistička dozvola Ministarstva poljoprivrede preko e-Albania (oko 1.000 leka dnevno), uz dokumente čamca i skipera.","Gear: up to 2 rods (up to 3 hooks each), up to 10 handlines with hooks, a small hand net. Catch up to 5 kg per day (more only if a single fish is heavier than 5 kg). Selling the catch is forbidden.":"Alat: do 2 štapa (do 3 udice na svakom), do 10 ručnih panula s udicama, mala mrežica. Ulov do 5 kg dnevno (više samo ako je jedna riba teža od 5 kg). Prodaja ulova je zabranjena.","Breeding fish and spawning females must not be killed. Species under special regimes (eel, bluefin tuna, swordfish) follow separate measures; tuna fishing is seasonal and strictly regulated.":"Ne smiju se ubijati matice i mrijesteće ženke. Za vrste s posebnim režimom (jegulja, plavoperajna tuna, sabljarka) vrijede posebne mjere; lov tune je sezonski i strogo reguliran.","Spearfishing is allowed with restrictions: not at night, not under 16, not in protected areas. All other rules and limits still apply.":"Podvodni ribolov je dopušten uz ograničenja: ne noću, ne mlađima od 16 godina, ne u zaštićenim područjima. Sva ostala pravila i ograničenja i dalje vrijede.","Fishing is banned in the Karaburun-Sazan Marine National Park and other protected zones. Release sharks and rays.":"Ribolov je zabranjen u nacionalnom parku Karaburun-Sazan i drugim zaštićenim zonama. Pustite morske pse i raže.","Safety: emergency number 112. Take a life jacket and a phone and tell someone where you are going.":"Sigurnost: broj hitnih službi 112. Ponesite prsluk i telefon i javite bliskima kamo idete.","Sources: Decision No. 6 of 11 April 2022 (FAOLEX), fishingworldguide.com. The e-Albania procedure has changed over time, so check the site.":"Izvori: Odluka br. 6 od 11. travnja 2022. (FAOLEX), fishingworldguide.com. Postupak na e-Albania se mijenjao, provjerite na stranici.","Slovenia":"Slovenija","the Slovenian Ministry of Agriculture (SPOT portal)":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede Slovenije (portal SPOT)","Fishing from the coast: no permit needed. From a boat (anchored or drifting): a daily or weekly permit (online, at least one hour before you start). No club membership needed. The permit is personal.":"Ribolov s obale: dozvola nije potrebna. S plovila (na sidru ili u plutanju): dnevna ili tjedna dozvola (online, najmanje sat prije početka). Članstvo u klubu nije potrebno. Dozvola je osobna.","Gear: no more than 2 rods or lines, with no more than 3 hooks. Artificial and natural bait are allowed; live vertebrates may not be used. No treble hook on a pulled lure.":"Alat: najviše 2 štapa ili panule, s najviše 3 udice. Dopuštene su umjetne i prirodne varalice, ali ne i živi kralježnjaci. Ne smije se koristiti trokraka udica na povlačenje.","Catch up to 5 kg per day (or one fish heavier than 5 kg). Do not catch immature fish, harvest molluscs, sell the catch or use underwater breathing devices.":"Ulov do 5 kg dnevno (ili jedna riba teža od 5 kg). Zabranjeno je loviti nedorasle ribe, skupljati školjke, prodavati ulov i koristiti uređaje za disanje pod vodom.","Do not fish: within 200 m of marked farms, 50 m of bottom nets and of another boat angler, 300 m of a vessel showing a light or using an encircling net, in ports and at bathing sites from 1 May to 30 October.":"Ne smije se loviti: bliže od 200 m od označenih uzgajališta, 50 m od pridnenih mreža i drugog ribolovca s plovila, 300 m od plovila sa svjetlom ili plivaricom, u lukama i na kupalištima od 1. svibnja do 30. listopada.","Spearfishing: an annual permit, issued only to members of a sea sport fishing society; a catch log is required. Daylight only, breath-hold only, not from a vessel carrying scuba gear, not in protected areas. A signal buoy of at least 10 litres on a rope is mandatory.":"Podvodni ribolov: godišnja dozvola, izdaje se samo članovima društva za morski športski ribolov; obvezan je dnevnik ulova. Samo danju, samo na dah, ne s plovila na kojem je ronilačka oprema, ne u zaštićenim područjima. Obvezan je signalni plovak od najmanje 10 litara na užetu.","Sources: spot.gov.si (Recreational marine fishing; Sea sport fishing with a spear gun). See the SPOT portal for sizes and fees.":"Izvori: spot.gov.si (Recreational marine fishing; Sea sport fishing with a spear gun). Veličine i cijene potražite na portalu SPOT.","Shore, river mouths, rocks, breakwaters, surf. Down to 30 m.":"Obala, ušća, stijene, lukobrani, prasak. Do 30 m.","Live shrimp, worms, live baitfish, minnow plugs, soft lures.":"Živa kozica, crvi, živa ribica, vobleri, silikonske varalice.","Dusk, night, dawn; after a storm in murky water.":"Sumrak, noć, zora; poslije oluje u mutnoj vodi.","October – March.":"Listopad – ožujak.","Minimum size 25 cm (Order 8/2011).":"Minimalna veličina 25 cm (Naredba 8/2011).","Sandy and shell bottoms near rocks, 2–30 m, lagoons.":"Pješčano i školjkasto dno uz stijene, 2–30 m, lagune.","Mussel, shrimp, worms, small crab, shellfish.":"Dagnja, kozica, crvi, mali rak, školjka.","Morning and evening, at the tide change.":"Jutro i večer, na promjeni vode.","April – November, peak in autumn.":"Travanj – studeni, vrhunac u jesen.","Minimum size 20 cm (Order 8/2011).":"Minimalna veličina 20 cm (Naredba 8/2011).","Rocks, caves and drop-offs 15–60 m.":"Stijene, pećine i padovi 15–60 m.","Live squid or cuttlefish, live baitfish, jigs.":"Živa lignja ili sipa, živa ribica, džig.","Dawn and dusk.":"Zora i sumrak.","March – June and October – November.":"Ožujak – lipanj i listopad – studeni.","Minimum size 30 cm (Order 8/2011).":"Minimalna veličina 30 cm (Naredba 8/2011).","Open sea, reefs, seamounts, 20–100 m.":"Otvoreno more, grebeni, podvodne planine, 20–100 m.","Live baitfish (horse mackerel, mackerel), popper, jigs.":"Živa ribica (šnjur, skuša), poper, džig.","Morning and evening, with current.":"Jutro i večer, uz struju.","June – October.":"Lipanj – listopad.","Minimum size 50 cm (Order 8/2011).":"Minimalna veličina 50 cm (Naredba 8/2011).","Open water, capes, baitfish schools near the surface.":"Otvorena voda, rtovi, jata sitne ribe uz površinu.","Spoons, plugs, live baitfish, wire leader (sharp teeth).":"Varalice, vobleri, živa ribica, metalni predvez (oštri zubi).","Dawn, dusk, overcast days.":"Zora, sumrak, oblačan dan.","No minimum size found in the sources I checked. Ask a fishing club.":"Minimalna veličina nije navedena u izvorima koje sam provjerio. Pitajte ribolovački klub.","Over rocks and walls, schools near the surface.":"Iznad stijena i zidova, jata uz površinu.","Plugs, long spoons, live bait. Use a steel leader.":"Vobleri, duge varalice, živa ribica. Treba čelični predvez.","Morning and evening.":"Jutro i večer.","June – September.":"Lipanj – rujan.","Open sea, currents, capes. Schools chase baitfish.":"Otvoreno more, struje, rtovi. Jata love sitnu ribu.","Spoons, plugs, feathers, trolling, light jigs.":"Varalice, vobleri, perje, trolling, laki džig.","Morning and evening, when you see splashes.":"Jutro i večer, kad se vide prskanja.","August – November.":"Kolovoz – studeni.","Open sea, from 100 m deep.":"Otvoreno more, od 100 m dubine.","Trolling, live bait, poppers, heavy jigs.":"Trolling, živa ribica, poper, teški džigovi.","Summer and early autumn.":"Ljeto i rana jesen.","A special daily big-game licence is required, the vessel needs AIS, notify the monitoring centre at least one hour before landing and keep an electronic catch log. Ask your club for size and conditions.":"Potrebna je posebna dnevna dozvola za krupnu ribu (big game), plovilo mora imati AIS, obavijestite centar za praćenje najmanje sat prije povratka i vodite elektronski dnevnik. Veličinu i uvjete provjerite u klubu.","Open sea near floating objects and weed.":"Otvoreno more uz plutajuće predmete i alge.","Trolling, live bait, feathers, poppers.":"Trolling, živa ribica, perje, poperi.","Daytime, sun, calm sea.":"Dnevni sati, sunce, mirno more.","Near the shore, piers and lamps, 2–30 m.":"Uz obalu, mule i svjetla, 2–30 m.","Squid jigs (egi), light tackle. A lamp on the gear must not exceed 400 cd.":"Egi varalice, lak pribor. Lampa na priboru najviše 400 cd.","Night and dusk, calm water.":"Noć i sumrak, mirna voda.","October – January.":"Listopad – siječanj.","Cephalopod gear: no more than two, lamp up to 400 cd.":"Pribor za glavonošce: najviše dva, lampa do 400 cd.","Rocks, weed, piers, 1–20 m.":"Stijene, alge, mule, 1–20 m.","Worms, shrimp, mussel pieces, light tackle.":"Crvi, kozica, komadići dagnje, lak pribor.","Morning and daytime.":"Jutro i dan.","Spring and autumn.":"Proljeće i jesen.","Right at the surface, shoals near the shore in spring.":"Tik uz površinu, jata uz obalu u proljeće.","Float rig with a strip of fish, small spoons.":"Plovak s trakom ribe, sitne varalice.","Daytime, calm water.":"Dan, mirna voda.","March – May.":"Ožujak – svibanj.","Schools in mid-water and near the surface.":"Jata u sredini vode i uz površinu.","Sabiki rigs, small spoons, fish strips.":"Sabiki, sitne varalice, trake ribe.","Autumn – winter, spring in places.":"Jesen – zima, mjestimično proljeće.","Sand and mud near rocks, 20–100 m":"Pijesak i mulj uz stijene, 20–100 m","Shrimp, pieces of fish and squid":"Kozica, komadi ribe i lignje","Morning and evening":"Jutro i večer","Year-round, best in summer":"Cijele godine, najbolje ljeti","No minimum size found in my sources, ask a club":"Minimalna veličina nije nađena u mojim izvorima, pitajte klub","Rocky bottom 30–120 m":"Stjenovito dno 30–120 m","Squid, shrimp, fish pieces":"Lignja, kozica, komadi ribe","Dawn and dusk":"Zora i sumrak","Spring and autumn":"Proljeće i jesen","Sandy bottom near shore, 1–30 m":"Pješčano dno uz obalu, 1–30 m","Worms, small shrimp, mussel pieces":"Crvi, mala kozica, komadići dagnje","Dusk and night":"Sumrak i noć","Summer and autumn":"Ljeto i jesen","Rocks and breakwaters, surf zone":"Stijene i lukobrani, zona praska","Mussel, worms, shellfish, weed":"Dagnja, crvi, školjka, alge","Daytime, especially after rough water":"Dan, posebno poslije valova","Autumn – winter":"Jesen – zima","Rocks and stones, 2–40 m":"Stijene i kamenje, 2–40 m","Worms, shrimp, mussel":"Crvi, kozica, dagnja","Year-round, best in autumn":"Cijele godine, najbolje u jesen","Rocks, piers, surf, 1–30 m":"Stijene, mule, prasak, 1–30 m","Small crab, shrimp, mussel, worms":"Rakovica, kozica, dagnja, crvi","Morning, evening, after rough water":"Jutro, večer, poslije valova","Autumn – spring":"Jesen – proljeće","Weed and rocks, 5–50 m":"Alge i stijene, 5–50 m","Worms, shrimp, squid pieces":"Crvi, kozica, komadi lignje","Weedy rocks, shallow water":"Alge uz stijene, plitko","Bread, green weed, dough":"Kruh, zelene alge, tijesto","Spring – autumn":"Proljeće – jesen","Around piers and rocks, near the surface":"Uz mule i stijene, uz površinu","Bread with chum, mussel pieces, dough":"Kruh s mamcem, komadi dagnje, tijesto","Daytime and dusk":"Dan i sumrak","Summer – autumn":"Ljeto – jesen","Schools at 5–50 m, often below the surface":"Jata na 5–50 m, često ispod površine","Bread, fish pieces, sabiki rig":"Kruh, komadi ribe, sabiki","Harbours, river mouths, lagoons, shallows":"Luke, ušća, lagune, plićak","Bread, dough, chum":"Kruh, tijesto, mamac","Rocks, caves and walls, 5–50 m":"Stijene, pećine i zidovi, 5–50 m","Shrimp, squid, crab":"Kozica, lignja, rak","Sand and mud, 5–80 m":"Pijesak i mulj, 5–80 m","Worms, shrimp, mussel pieces":"Crvi, kozica, komadi dagnje","Rocks and stones, on the bottom":"Stijene i kamenje, uz dno","Shrimp, fish pieces, worms":"Kozica, komadi ribe, crvi","Evening and night":"Večer i noć","Year-round":"Cijele godine","Venomous spines: do not handle bare-handed. After a sting: hot water and a doctor.":"Otrovni šiljci: ne držati golom rukom. Nakon uboda: topla voda i liječnik.","Rocks and hollows, 20–200 m":"Stijene i udubine, 20–200 m","Fish and squid pieces, shrimp":"Komadi ribe i lignje, kozica","Night":"Noć","Sandy bottom, 20–100 m":"Pješčano dno, 20–100 m","Shrimp, fish pieces":"Kozica, komadi ribe","Over sand and mud, 20–150 m":"Iznad pijeska i mulja, 20–150 m","Live baitfish, squid pieces":"Živa ribica, komadi lignje","Sandy bottom near shore, buries itself":"Pješčano dno uz obalu, zaranja","Worms, shrimp, fish pieces":"Crvi, kozica, komadi ribe","Summer":"Ljeto","Very venomous spines on the dorsal fin and gills. Handle only with cloth or pliers. After a sting: hot water and a doctor.":"Vrlo otrovni šiljci na leđnoj peraji i škrgama. Držati samo krpom ili kliještima. Nakon uboda: topla voda i liječnik.","Depths of 100–300 m, sand and mud":"Dubine 100–300 m, pijesak i mulj","Fish and squid pieces, jigs":"Komadi ribe i lignje, džig","Night and dawn":"Noć i zora","Crevices and wrecks, on the bottom, 10–200 m":"Pukotine i olupine, uz dno, 10–200 m","Fish pieces, squid, sardine":"Komadi ribe, lignja, sardina","Strong and bites. Use a heavy leader and be careful when unhooking.":"Jak i grize. Treba jak predvez i oprez pri vađenju udice.","Sand and mud, 30–300 m":"Pijesak i mulj, 30–300 m","Fish pieces, squid":"Komadi ribe, lignja","Worms, small shrimp":"Crvi, mala kozica","Rocks and weed, 1–20 m":"Kamenje i alge, 1–20 m","Rocks and weed, 2–30 m":"Stijene i alge, 2–30 m","Shrimp, worms, fish pieces":"Kozica, crvi, komadi ribe","Schools near the bottom, 10–100 m":"Jata uz dno, 10–100 m","Shrimp, fish pieces, sabiki rig":"Kozica, komadi ribe, sabiki","Spring and summer":"Proljeće i ljeto","Rocks and stones, 5–100 m":"Stijene i kamenje, 5–100 m","Shrimp, worms, small fish":"Kozica, crvi, sitna ribica","Rocks and weed, 1–40 m":"Kamenje i alge, 1–40 m","Worms, shrimp pieces":"Crvi, komadi kozice","Open sea":"Otvoreno more","Sharks and rays are mostly protected in Montenegro: do not keep them, release alive, ask a club for the species list.":"Morski psi i raže u Crnoj Gori uglavnom su zaštićeni: ne zadržavati, žive otpustiti, popis vrsta pitajte klub.","Bottom, 10–400 m":"Dno, 10–400 m","Incidental catch on fish pieces":"Slučajan ulov na komade ribe","Schools in mid-water":"Jata u sredini vode","Sabiki rig, small spoons":"Sabiki, sitne varalice","Schools near the bottom and mid-water, harbour lights at night":"Jata uz dno i u sredini, svjetla luke noću","Sabiki rig, fish pieces":"Sabiki, komadi ribe","Surface schools, often at night under lights":"Jata uz površinu, često noću uz svjetlo","Small sabiki rig. Often wanted as live bait.":"Sitni sabiki. Često treba kao živac.","Surface schools":"Jata uz površinu","Small sabiki rig. Good as live bait and cut bait.":"Sitni sabiki. Dobra kao živac i kao komadi.","Rocks and crevices, 1–50 m":"Kamenje i pukotine, 1–50 m","Crab on a hook, trap, cephalopod gear":"Rak na udici, vrša, pribor za glavonošce","Night and dusk":"Noć i sumrak","Minimum weight 1 kg (Order 8/2011)":"Minimalna težina 1 kg (Naredba 8/2011)","Sand and weed, 2–50 m, near shore in spring":"Pijesak i alge, 2–50 m, u proljeće uz obalu","Egi jigs, live shrimp, lamp up to 400 cd":"Egi, živa kozica, lampa do 400 cd","Minimum size 12 cm (Order 8/2011)":"Minimalna veličina 12 cm (Naredba 8/2011)","Open water, closer to the surface at night":"Otvorena voda, noću bliže površini","Egi jigs, lamp up to 400 cd":"Egi, lampa do 400 cd","Sand and mud, 20–200 m":"Pijesak i mulj, 20–200 m","Usually caught in traps":"Obično upada u vrše","Rocks and caves, 20–100 m":"Stijene i pećine, 20–100 m","Trap (one per person)":"Vrša (jedna po osobi)","Minimum size 28 cm (Order 8/2011). Ask a club about closed periods.":"Minimalna veličina 28 cm (Naredba 8/2011). Lovostaj pitajte klub.","A permit is required (annual, or temporary up to 30 days for foreigners). Issued by municipal fishing clubs.":"Potrebna je dozvola (godišnja ili privremena do 30 dana za strance). Izdaju je ribolovački klubovi općina.","Daily catch: up to 5 kg of fish and other marine organisms plus one specimen over 5 kg (under the 2025 law; the earlier rules said 3 kg). Selling the catch is not allowed.":"Dnevni ulov: do 5 kg ribe i drugih morskih organizama plus jedan primjerak teži od 5 kg (po novom zakonu iz 2025; ranija pravila su imala 3 kg). Prodaja ulova nije dopuštena.","Big game (tuna, swordfish): a special daily licence, AIS on the vessel, notification an hour before landing, an electronic catch log.":"Krupna riba (tunj, sabljarka): posebna dnevna dozvola, AIS na plovilu, obavijest sat prije povratka, elektronski dnevnik ulova.","Gear: handlines and trolling lines, up to 2 rods (up to 3 hooks each), up to 2 cephalopod lines (lamp up to 400 cd), 1 trap. Longlines are banned.":"Pribor: ručni pribor i trolling, do 2 štapa (do 3 udice na svakom), do 2 pribora za glavonošce (lampa do 400 cd), 1 vrša. Parangali su zabranjeni.","Spearfishing: breath-hold only, no scuba, with a marker buoy, daytime only, not for under 18.":"Podvodni ribolov: samo na dah, bez ronilačke opreme, uz plovak, samo danju, ne za mlađe od 18 godina.","No fishing in ports, their approaches and anchorages, and on organised beaches from 1 May to 1 October in daylight.":"Zabranjen ribolov u lukama, prilazima i sidrištima, a na uređenim plažama od 1. svibnja do 1. listopada tijekom dana.","Protected all year: red coral, noble pen shell, seahorses, sea turtles, dolphins, many sharks and rays, ocean sunfish, date mussel. Release them alive.":"Zaštićeni cijele godine: crveni koralj, plemenita periska, morski konjici, morske kornjače, delfini, mnogi morski psi i raže, mjesečina, prstac. Žive otpustiti.","Fines for violations up to €2,000, with possible gear confiscation and a temporary ban.":"Kazne za prekršaje do 2.000 €, uz moguće oduzimanje pribora i privremenu zabranu.","Important: this is a summary from public sources, not legal advice. The marine fisheries law was updated in 2025, and I did not find official closed-season dates or a current size table. Sizes below come from Order 8/2011. Before fishing, check the rules with a club or the Ministry of Agriculture.":"Važno: ovo je sažetak iz javnih izvora, a ne pravni savjet. Zakon o morskom ribarstvu je obnovljen 2025, a nisam našao službene datume lovostaja ni aktualnu tablicu veličina. Veličine ispod su iz Naredbe 8/2011. Prije ribolova provjerite pravila u klubu ili u Ministarstvu poljoprivrede.","Sources: kotorfisherman.com (2025 regulations), adriaticnature.com, FAO AdriaMed (Montenegro).":"Izvori: kotorfisherman.com (propisi 2025), adriaticnature.com, FAO AdriaMed (Crna Gora).","Any fish (general season)":"Bilo koja riba (opća sezona)","Sea bass":"Lubin","Gilthead bream":"Orada","Bluefish":"Lufar","Barracuda":"Barakuda","Bonito":"Palamida","Squid":"Lignja","Annular seabream":"Špar","Garfish":"Iglica","Amberjack (gof)":"Gof","Tuna":"Tunj","Mahi-mahi":"Lampuga","Common dentex":"Zubatac","Mackerel":"Skuša","A predator that holds near rocks, headlands, river mouths and in the surf. It likes oxygen-rich water: current, foam, waves. By day it stays deeper; it feeds at dawn, dusk and at night, especially after a storm. Juveniles enter lagoons and estuaries. Usually 30–60 cm, can exceed a metre.":"Grabljivac, drži se uz stijene, rtove, ušća rijeka i u prasku valova. Voli vodu bogatu kisikom: struju, pjenu, valove. Danju stoji dublje, aktivan je u zoru, sumrak i noću, posebno poslije oluje. Mlađ ulazi u lagune i ušća. Obično 30–60 cm, može preći metar.","Sea bass in a salt crust (Branzino al sale)":"Lubin u soli (Branzino al sale)","1 whole sea bass (800 g), coarse sea salt 1.5 kg, 2 egg whites, lemon, rosemary, bay leaf, olive oil":"1 cijeli lubin (800 g), krupna morska sol 1,5 kg, 2 bjelanjka, limun, ruzmarin, lovorov list, maslinovo ulje","Gut the fish but leave the scales on. Put lemon slices, rosemary and bay inside.":"Očistite ribu od utroba, ljuske ne skidajte. U trbuh stavite kriške limuna, ruzmarin i lovor.","Mix the salt with the egg whites and 3 tbsp of water until it feels like wet sand.":"Pomiješajte sol s bjelanjcima i 3 žlice vode dok ne dobijete masu poput mokrog pijeska.","Spread a layer of salt on a tray, lay the fish on it and cover it completely with the rest.":"Na pekač stavite sloj soli, položite ribu i potpuno je prekrijte ostatkom soli.","Bake at 200 °C for 25–30 minutes. Crack the crust, remove the skin, dress with oil and lemon.":"Pecite na 200 °C 25–30 minuta. Razbijte koru, skinite kožu, prelijte uljem i limunom.","Grilled sea bass with Swiss chard and potatoes (Dalmatia)":"Brancin na gradele s blitvom i krumpirom (Dalmacija)","sea bass 700–800 g, Swiss chard 300 g, potatoes 400 g, 3 garlic cloves, parsley, lemon, olive oil, salt":"brancin 700–800 g, blitva 300 g, krumpir 400 g, 3 režnja češnjaka, peršin, limun, maslinovo ulje, sol","Dice the potatoes and boil for 12 minutes, adding the chard for the last 4.":"Krumpir narežite na kockice i kuhajte 12 minuta, blitvu dodajte u posljednja 4.","Drain, then toss with oil and garlic and salt it.":"Ocijedite, pomiješajte s uljem i češnjakom i posolite.","Salt the fish, brush with oil and grill 6–7 minutes per side.":"Posolite ribu, namažite uljem i pecite na gradelama po 6–7 minuta sa svake strane.","Spoon over a dressing of oil, lemon, garlic and parsley and serve with the side.":"Prelijte umakom od ulja, limuna, češnjaka i peršina i poslužite s prilogom.","It feeds on shellfish and crabs: strong jaws crush mussels. Found on sandy and shelly bottoms near rocks and weed; in summer it comes into shallows and lagoons. Wary, prefers clean water and gentle current. Usually 25–45 cm, rarely up to 70 cm.":"Hrani se školjkama i rakovima: snažne čeljusti drobe dagnje. Drži se pješčano-školjkaškog dna uz stijene i alge, ljeti ulazi u plićake i lagune. Oprezna je, voli čistu vodu i blagu struju. Obično 25–45 cm, rijetko do 70 cm.","Baked gilthead bream with potatoes and tomatoes (Orata al forno)":"Orada iz pećnice s krumpirom i rajčicama (Orata al forno)","gilthead bream 600–700 g, potatoes 400 g, cherry tomatoes 200 g, garlic, olives 50 g, oregano, white wine 80 ml, olive oil":"orada 600–700 g, krumpir 400 g, cherry rajčice 200 g, češnjak, masline 50 g, origano, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje","Slice the potatoes thin, toss with oil, salt and oregano and lay them in a baking dish.":"Krumpir narežite na tanke kolutove, pomiješajte s uljem, soli i origanom i složite u pekač.","Bake the potatoes for 15 minutes at 200 °C.":"Krumpir pecite 15 minuta na 200 °C.","Lay the fish on top, add tomatoes, olives and garlic around it, pour over the wine and oil.":"Na krumpir položite ribu, oko nje rajčice, masline i češnjak, prelijte vinom i uljem.","Bake another 25 minutes until the skin is golden.":"Pecite još 25 minuta dok koža ne porumeni.","Gilthead bream in parchment with lemon and thyme":"Orada u papiru s limunom i timijanom","gilthead bream 500–600 g, lemon, thyme, garlic, olive oil, white wine 50 ml, salt, pepper":"orada 500–600 g, limun, timijan, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 50 ml, sol, papar","Gut the fish, score each side twice, season with salt and pepper.":"Očistite ribu, zarežite svaku stranu dva puta, posolite i popaprite.","Stuff the belly with lemon slices, thyme and garlic.":"U trbuh stavite kolutove limuna, timijan i češnjak.","Wrap in parchment with the oil and wine and twist the edges tight.":"Zamotajte u papir za pečenje s uljem i vinom, rubove čvrsto uvijte.","Bake 20–25 minutes at 200 °C and open at the table.":"Pecite 20–25 minuta na 200 °C i otvorite za stolom.","A strong predator of rocks and drop-offs, 10–100 m, with young fish closer to shore. It ambushes fish and squid and comes to the rock edge at dawn and dusk. Wary; takes live bait and jigs. Usually 40–70 cm, large fish reach 10 kg.":"Snažan grabljivac stijena i padova dubine 10–100 m, mlađ je bliže obali. Lovi iz zasjede ribu i lignje, u zoru i sumrak prilazi rubu stijena. Oprezan je, hvata se na živu ribu i varalice. Obično 40–70 cm, velike ribe do 10 kg.","Dentex in “crazy water” (Dentice all'acqua pazza)":"Zubatac u „ludoj vodi“ (Dentice all'acqua pazza)","dentex fillets or steaks 600 g, cherry tomatoes 250 g, 2 garlic cloves, chilli, parsley, olive oil, water 150 ml":"fileti ili odresci zubaca 600 g, cherry rajčice 250 g, 2 režnja češnjaka, čili, peršin, maslinovo ulje, voda 150 ml","Warm the oil with garlic and chilli in a wide pan for a minute.":"U širokoj tavi zagrijte ulje s češnjakom i čilijem 1 minutu.","Add the halved tomatoes and the water, simmer 5 minutes.":"Dodajte prepolovljene rajčice i vodu, kuhajte 5 minuta.","Lay in the fish, cover and cook 10–12 minutes over low heat.":"Položite ribu, poklopite i kuhajte 10–12 minuta na laganoj vatri.","Sprinkle with parsley and serve with bread.":"Pospite peršinom i poslužite s kruhom.","Grilled dentex with olive oil and lemon":"Zubatac na žaru s maslinovim uljem i limunom","1 whole dentex (700 g), olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, rosemary, salt":"1 cijeli zubatac (700 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, ruzmarin, sol","Gut and dry the fish, salt it inside and out, put rosemary in the belly.":"Očistite i osušite ribu, posolite iznutra i izvana, u trbuh stavite ruzmarin.","Brush with oil and grill 8–10 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite na žaru po 8–10 minuta sa svake strane.","Mix oil, lemon juice, garlic and parsley and pour it over the hot fish.":"Pomiješajte ulje, sok od limuna, češnjak i peršin i prelijte vruću ribu.","A fast pelagic predator that holds around reefs, banks and seamounts, often along surface currents. It hunts alone or in groups for squid and small fish and takes live bait and jigs. Very strong: it dives for the rocks. Usually 5–15 kg, can exceed 30 kg.":"Brz pelagijski grabljivac, drži se uz grebene, plićake i podvodne planine, često uz površinske struje. Lovi sam ili u grupama lignje i sitnu ribu, hvata se na živu ribu i jig. Vrlo je jak: bježi među stijene. Obično 5–15 kg, može preći 30 kg.","Amberjack baked with tomatoes and capers (Ricciola al forno)":"Gof pečen s rajčicama i kaparima (Ricciola al forno)","3 amberjack steaks (200 g each), tomatoes 300 g, capers 2 tbsp, olives 50 g, garlic, oregano, olive oil, white wine 80 ml":"3 odreska gofa (po 200 g), rajčice 300 g, kapari 2 žlice, masline 50 g, češnjak, origano, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 80 ml","Chop the tomatoes and mix with capers, olives, garlic, oregano and oil.":"Narežite rajčice i pomiješajte s kaparima, maslinama, češnjakom, origanom i uljem.","Put half the mixture in a dish, add the steaks, top with the rest and pour in the wine.":"Pola smjese stavite u pekač, odozgo odrezke, zatim ostatak i ulijte vino.","Bake at 190 °C for 20–25 minutes.":"Pecite na 190 °C 20–25 minuta.","Grilled amberjack with lemon gremolata":"Gof na žaru s gremolatom od limuna","2 amberjack steaks (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt, pepper":"2 odreska gofa (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol, papar","Brush the steaks with oil, salt and pepper them.":"Odreske namažite uljem, posolite i popaprite.","Grill over strong heat 3–4 minutes per side; keep the centre slightly moist.":"Pecite na jakoj vatri po 3–4 minute sa svake strane, unutra treba ostati sočno.","Mix finely chopped parsley, garlic and lemon zest and sprinkle over the hot fish.":"Pomiješajte sitno nasjeckani peršin, češnjak i koricu limuna i pospite vruću ribu.","An aggressive schooling predator that chases sardines, anchovies and mullet near the surface. Schools push prey toward shore and the water “boils”. It strikes anything shiny and bites sharply, so use a strong leader. Usually 1–3 kg, up to 8 kg. Chill the meat quickly.":"Agresivan jatni grabljivac, lovi sardine, inćune i cipole uz površinu. Jata tjeraju plijen prema obali i voda „kipi“. Napada sve što sjaji i oštro grize, pa predvez mora biti jak. Obično 1–3 kg, do 8 kg. Meso treba brzo ohladiti.","Dalmatian grilled bluefish (Lufar na žaru)":"Lufar na žaru po dalmatinski","bluefish 700 g, olive oil, 2 garlic cloves, parsley, lemon, salt, rosemary leaves":"lufar 700 g, maslinovo ulje, 2 režnja češnjaka, peršin, limun, sol, listići ruzmarina","Gut the fish, score the flanks, salt it and leave for 10 minutes.":"Očistite ribu, zarežite bokove, posolite i ostavite 10 minuta.","Brush with oil and rosemary and grill 7–8 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem s ruzmarinom i pecite po 7–8 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with a sauce of oil, garlic, parsley and lemon.":"Poslužite s umakom od ulja, češnjaka, peršina i limuna.","Oven-baked bluefish with potatoes and tomatoes":"Lufar iz pećnice s krumpirom i rajčicama","bluefish 900 g, potatoes 500 g, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, parsley, olive oil":"lufar 900 g, krumpir 500 g, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, peršin, maslinovo ulje","Slice the potatoes, onion and tomatoes, toss with oil, garlic and salt and put in a dish.":"Narežite krumpir, luk i rajčice, pomiješajte s uljem, češnjakom i soli i stavite u pekač.","Bake for 20 minutes at 200 °C.":"Pecite 20 minuta na 200 °C.","Add the fish, pour in the wine, bake another 25–30 minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Položite ribu, ulijte vino, pecite još 25–30 minuta i pospite peršinom.","A schooling predator of open water that holds above rocks and along walls, often near the surface. It attacks spoons and plugs at speed, with sharp teeth, so use a steel leader. Active morning and evening in calm water. Usually 40–80 cm, up to 1.2 m.":"Jatna grabljivica otvorenih voda, drži se iznad stijena i uz zidove, često uz površinu. Napada varalice i voblere velikom brzinom, zubi su joj oštri pa treba čelični predvez. Aktivna je ujutro i uvečer po mirnoj vodi. Obično 40–80 cm, do 1,2 m.","Grilled barracuda with herbs":"Barakuda na žaru s travama","2 barracuda steaks (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, oregano, thyme, salt, pepper":"2 odreska barakude (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, origano, timijan, sol, papar","Mix oil, half a lemon's juice, crushed garlic and herbs and marinate the steaks for 20 minutes.":"Pomiješajte ulje, sok pola limuna, zgnječeni češnjak i bilje i marinirajte odreske 20 minuta.","Grill 4–5 minutes per side.":"Pecite na žaru po 4–5 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon wedges.":"Poslužite s kriškama limuna.","Barracuda in tomato sauce with olives":"Barakuda u umaku od rajčice s maslinama","barracuda 600 g, canned tomatoes 400 g, olives 60 g, capers, garlic, onion, olive oil, parsley":"barakuda 600 g, rajčice iz konzerve 400 g, masline 60 g, kapari, češnjak, luk, maslinovo ulje, peršin","Sauté the onion and garlic in oil for 3 minutes.":"Na ulju pirjajte luk i češnjak 3 minute.","Add tomatoes, olives and capers and simmer 10 minutes.":"Dodajte rajčice, masline i kapare i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Add the fish pieces, cover and cook 12–15 minutes, sprinkle with parsley.":"Stavite komade ribe, poklopite i kuhajte 12–15 minuta, pospite peršinom.","A fast schooling fish of the mackerel family that migrates along the coast and hunts sardines and anchovies near the surface, giving itself away by splashes. A hard fighter that loses quality quickly without ice. Usually 1–3 kg, up to 6 kg.":"Brza jatna riba iz obitelji skuša, seli uz obalu i lovi sardine i inćune uz površinu, odaju je prskanja. Jako se bori, bez leda brzo gubi kvalitetu. Obično 1–3 kg, do 6 kg.","Bonito with onions and tomatoes (Palamida sa lukom)":"Palamida s lukom i rajčicama","bonito 700 g, 2 onions, tomatoes 300 g, garlic, white wine 100 ml, bay leaf, olive oil":"palamida 700 g, 2 luka, rajčice 300 g, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, lovorov list, maslinovo ulje","Slice the onions into half-rings and stew in oil with the bay for 10 minutes.":"Luk narežite na polukolutove i pirjajte na ulju s lovorom 10 minuta.","Add garlic, tomatoes and wine and simmer 8 minutes.":"Dodajte češnjak, rajčice i vino i kuhajte 8 minuta.","Add the bonito pieces and cook 10–12 minutes.":"Dodajte komade palamide i kuhajte 10–12 minuta.","Grilled bonito with lemon and oregano":"Palamida na žaru s limunom i origanom","2 bonito steaks (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, oregano, garlic, salt":"2 odreska palamide (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, origano, češnjak, sol","Marinate the steaks in oil, lemon juice, oregano and garlic for 15 minutes.":"Marinirajte odreske u ulju, soku limuna, origanu i češnjaku 15 minuta.","Grill over strong heat 3–4 minutes per side.":"Pecite na jakoj vatri po 3–4 minute sa svake strane.","Salt and serve at once.":"Posolite i odmah poslužite.","A large, fast open-sea fish that travels in schools hunting mackerel, sardines and squid. The strongest opponent in the Adriatic, a fight can last an hour or more. Fishing for tuna in Montenegro is possible only under a special permit. Large fish are 20–200 kg and more.":"Velika brza pelagijska riba, kreće se u jatima otvorenim morem i lovi skuše, sardine i lignje. Najjači protivnik na Jadranu, borba može trajati sat i duže. Lov tune u Crnoj Gori moguć je samo uz posebnu dozvolu. Velike ribe 20–200 kg i više.","Sicilian-style tuna (Tonno alla siciliana)":"Tuna na sicilijanski (Tonno alla siciliana)","2 tuna steaks (200 g each), cherry tomatoes 200 g, capers 1 tbsp, olives 40 g, onion, garlic, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"2 odreska tune (po 200 g), cherry rajčice 200 g, kapari 1 žlica, masline 40 g, luk, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Sauté onion and garlic in oil, add tomatoes, capers, olives and wine, simmer 8 minutes.":"Pirjajte luk i češnjak na ulju, dodajte rajčice, kapare, masline i vino i kuhajte 8 minuta.","Sear the steaks separately in a very hot pan, 1.5–2 minutes per side.":"Odreske posebno ispecite u vrućoj tavi po 1,5–2 minute sa svake strane.","Serve the tuna with the sauce on top; the centre should stay pink.":"Poslužite tunu s umakom odozgo, unutra meso treba ostati ružičasto.","Tuna tartare with a citrus dressing":"Tatar od tune s agrumima","very fresh tuna fillet 250 g, olive oil 2 tbsp, lemon juice, orange zest, capers, red onion, dill, salt":"najsvježiji file tune 250 g, maslinovo ulje 2 žlice, sok limuna, korica naranče, kapari, crveni luk, kopar, sol","Dice the chilled tuna small with a sharp knife.":"Ohlađenu tunu narežite na sitne kockice oštrim nožem.","Mix with oil, lemon juice, zest, capers, onion and dill.":"Pomiješajte s uljem, sokom limuna, koricom, kaparima, lukom i koprom.","Salt and serve at once; do not store raw fish. Use only very fresh fish.":"Posolite i odmah poslužite, sirovu ribu ne čuvajte. Koristite samo vrlo svježu ribu.","A bright, warm-water fish of open sea that arrives in the Adriatic in late summer and autumn. It gathers under floating objects, crates and weed, which are worth checking. Fast, it leaps when hooked. The meat is firm. Usually 2–8 kg.":"Šarena riba toplih mora otvorenog mora, u Jadran dolazi krajem ljeta i u jesen. Drži se uz plutajuće predmete, sanduke i alge, njih vrijedi provjeriti. Brza je, pri zaparu skače. Meso je čvrsto. Obično 2–8 kg.","Sicilian mahi-mahi in sweet-and-sour sauce (Lampuga in agrodolce)":"Lampuga u slatko-kiselom umaku (Lampuga in agrodolce)","mahi-mahi fillet 600 g, flour, 2 onions, vinegar 3 tbsp, sugar 1 tbsp, capers, raisins 2 tbsp, mint, olive oil":"file lampuge 600 g, brašno, 2 luka, ocat 3 žlice, šećer 1 žlica, kapari, grožđice 2 žlice, metvica, maslinovo ulje","Slice the onions thin and stew in oil until soft, adding capers and raisins.":"Luk tanko narežite i pirjajte na ulju dok ne omekša, dodajte kapare i grožđice.","Pour in the vinegar with the sugar and let it reduce by half.":"Ulijte ocat sa šećerom i pustite da se uvari za pola.","Dredge the fish in flour and fry in oil 3 minutes per side.":"Ribu uvaljajte u brašno i pržite na ulju po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Cover with the sauce, sprinkle with mint and serve warm.":"Prelijte umakom, pospite metvicom i poslužite mlako.","Grilled mahi-mahi with capers and lemon":"Lampuga na žaru s kaparima i limunom","2 mahi-mahi steaks (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, capers 1 tbsp, parsley, garlic, salt":"2 odreska lampuge (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, kapari 1 žlica, peršin, češnjak, sol","Brush the steaks with oil, salt them and grill 4 minutes per side.":"Odreske namažite uljem, posolite i pecite po 4 minute sa svake strane.","Mix oil, lemon juice, capers, garlic and parsley.":"Pomiješajte ulje, sok limuna, kapare, češnjak i peršin.","Pour the dressing over the hot fish.":"Prelijte vruću ribu umakom.","A fast cephalopod that moves in shoals near the coast and hunts at night, attracted to light and squid jigs. In autumn and winter it comes close to shore to spawn. It responds to bright jigs in the right colours and light current. Usually 20–40 cm. It squirts ink, so protect your clothes.":"Brz glavonožac, kreće se u jatima uz obalu i lovi noću, privlači ga svjetlo i varalice za lignje. U jesen i zimu prilazi obali na mriješćenje. Reagira na jarke varalice u pravim bojama i uz blagu struju. Obično 20–40 cm. Ispušta tintu, pa čuvajte odjeću.","Grilled squid with garlic and parsley (Lignje na žaru)":"Lignje na žaru s češnjakom i peršinom","squid 500 g, olive oil, 2 garlic cloves, parsley, lemon, salt":"lignje 500 g, maslinovo ulje, 2 režnja češnjaka, peršin, limun, sol","Clean the squid, keep the bodies and tentacles and dry them.":"Očistite lignje, zadržite tijela i krakove i osušite.","Brush with oil, salt and grill on very hot heat 2 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem, posolite i pecite na vrlo jakoj vatri po 2 minute sa svake strane.","Dress with oil, garlic, parsley and lemon. Do not overcook or they turn rubbery.":"Prelijte uljem s češnjakom, peršinom i limunom. Ne pecite predugo jer postaju žilave.","Stuffed squid (Calamari ripieni)":"Punjene lignje (Calamari ripieni)","6 small squid, breadcrumbs 4 tbsp, garlic, parsley, parmesan 2 tbsp, tomatoes 300 g, white wine 80 ml, olive oil":"6 manjih lignji, krušne mrvice 4 žlice, češnjak, peršin, parmezan 2 žlice, rajčice 300 g, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje","Chop the tentacles and mix with breadcrumbs, garlic, parsley and cheese.":"Krakove sitno nasjeckajte i pomiješajte s mrvicama, češnjakom, peršinom i sirom.","Fill the bodies two thirds full and close with a toothpick.":"Napunite tijela do dvije trećine i zatvorite čačkalicom.","Brown the squid in oil for 2 minutes, then add tomatoes and wine.":"Lignje popecite na ulju 2 minute, dodajte rajčice i vino.","Cover and cook 30–35 minutes until tender.":"Poklopite i kuhajte 30–35 minuta dok meso ne omekša.","A small sea bream that lives in shoals over sand and seagrass and near rocks at 5–30 m. It eats worms, small crustaceans and molluscs, so it takes small pieces of live bait. In spring and autumn the shoals come closer to shore. Usually 12–18 cm, rarely up to 25 cm.":"Mala šparida, živi u jatima na pješčano-travnatom dnu i uz stijene na 5–30 m. Hrani se crvima, račićima i mekušcima, pa se hvata na sitne komade žive mamce. U proljeće i jesen jata prilaze obali. Obično 12–18 cm, rijetko do 25 cm.","Fried annular seabream with lemon (Špari)":"Pohani špari s limunom","8 annular seabream, flour 4 tbsp, olive oil for frying, salt, lemon, parsley":"8 šparova, brašno 4 žlice, maslinovo ulje za prženje, sol, limun, peršin","Scale, gut and rinse the fish, dry and salt them.":"Očistite ribice, operite, osušite i posolite.","Dredge in flour and fry in hot oil 2–3 minutes per side.":"Uvaljajte u brašno i pržite u vrućem ulju po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Drain on paper and serve with lemon and parsley.":"Ocijedite na papiru i poslužite s limunom i peršinom.","Baked annular seabream with potatoes and garlic":"Špari iz pećnice s krumpirom i češnjakom","6–8 annular seabream, potatoes 400 g, 3 garlic cloves, parsley, white wine 60 ml, olive oil, salt":"6–8 šparova, krumpir 400 g, 3 režnja češnjaka, peršin, bijelo vino 60 ml, maslinovo ulje, sol","Toss thin potato slices with oil and salt and bake 15 minutes at 200 °C.":"Tanke kriške krumpira pomiješajte s uljem i soli i pecite 15 minuta na 200 °C.","Add the fish, garlic and parsley and pour in the wine.":"Stavite ribice, češnjak i peršin i ulijte vino.","Bake another 15–18 minutes.":"Pecite još 15–18 minuta.","A slender fish with a long beak that comes close to shore in spring to spawn and holds near the surface in schools. It hunts fry and takes small spoons, fish strips and plugs. Green bones after cooking are normal and harmless. Usually 40–70 cm.":"Vitka riba s dugim kljunom, u proljeće prilazi obali na mriješćenje i drži se uz površinu u jatima. Lovi mlađ, hvata se na sitne varalice, trakice ribe i vobler. Zelene kosti pri kuhanju su normalne i bezopasne. Obično 40–70 cm.","Garfish pan-fried with garlic and parsley":"Iglica pržena s češnjakom i peršinom","garfish 500 g, flour 3 tbsp, olive oil, 2 garlic cloves, parsley, lemon, salt":"iglica 500 g, brašno 3 žlice, maslinovo ulje, 2 režnja češnjaka, peršin, limun, sol","Clean the garfish, cut into 5–6 cm pieces, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite iglicu, narežite na komade od 5–6 cm, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in oil 3 minutes per side.":"Pecite na ulju po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Add garlic and parsley for the last minute and serve with lemon.":"Posljednju minutu dodajte češnjak i peršin i poslužite s limunom.","Marinated garfish":"Marinirana iglica","garfish 500 g, flour, olive oil for frying, white wine vinegar 100 ml, onion, garlic, bay leaf, peppercorns, salt":"iglica 500 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, bijeli vinski ocat 100 ml, luk, češnjak, lovor, papar u zrnu, sol","Fry floured garfish pieces until golden and layer them in a jar.":"Pržite uvaljane komade iglice do zlatne boje i složite u staklenku.","Warm the vinegar with bay, peppercorns, sliced onion and garlic, and salt it.":"Zagrijte ocat s lovorom, paprom, narezanim lukom i češnjakom i posolite.","Pour the marinade over the fish and rest in the fridge at least 12 hours.":"Prelijte ribu marinadom i ostavite u hladnjaku najmanje 12 sati.","A schooling pelagic fish that comes close to the coast and into bays in autumn and winter, staying near the surface and down to 100 m. It feeds on plankton and fry and takes feather rigs and small spoons. The oily flesh spoils fast, so chill it at once. Usually 25–40 cm.":"Jatna pelagijska riba, u jesen i zimu prilazi obali i uvalama, drži se uz površinu i do 100 m dubine. Hrani se planktonom i mlađi, hvata se na varalice s perjem i sitne varalice. Masno meso brzo se kvari, pa ga odmah ohladite. Obično 25–40 cm.","Grilled mackerel with lemon and rosemary":"Skuša na žaru s limunom i ruzmarinom","2 mackerel (300 g each), olive oil, lemon, rosemary, garlic, coarse salt":"2 skuše (po 300 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, ruzmarin, češnjak, krupna sol","Gut the fish, score three times each side, season with salt.":"Očistite ribu, zarežite tri puta sa svake strane, posolite.","Put lemon, rosemary and garlic in the belly and brush with oil.":"U trbuh stavite limun, ruzmarin i češnjak i namažite uljem.","Grill 6–7 minutes per side and serve with lemon wedges.":"Pecite po 6–7 minuta sa svake strane i poslužite s kriškama limuna.","Mackerel baked with cherry tomatoes":"Skuša iz pećnice s cherry rajčicama","2 mackerel, cherry tomatoes 250 g, red onion, olives, oregano, olive oil, white wine 50 ml":"2 skuše, cherry rajčice 250 g, crveni luk, masline, origano, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 50 ml","Slice the onion and halve the tomatoes, mix with oil, olives and oregano.":"Narežite luk, prepolovite rajčice i pomiješajte s uljem, maslinama i origanom.","Place in a dish, lay the fish on top and pour in the wine.":"Stavite u pekač, odozgo ribu i ulijte vino.","Bake 20–25 minutes at 200 °C.":"Pecite 20–25 minuta na 200 °C.","A reddish pandora that lives in small shoals on sand and mud near rocks at 20–100 m. It eats worms, crustaceans and small fish and takes shrimp and squid on bottom rigs. Bites best morning and evening; in summer it comes closer to shore. Usually 20–35 cm.":"Crvenkasti arbun živi u manjim jatima na pjeskovitom i muljevitom dnu pokraj stijena na 20–100 m. Hrani se crvima, račićima i sitnom ribom, hvata se na dublju s kozicom i lignjom. Bolje grize ujutro i uvečer, ljeti dolazi bliže obali. Obično 20–35 cm.","Baked pandora with tomatoes and oregano (Pagello al forno)":"Arbun iz pećnice s rajčicama i origanom","2 pandora (350 g each), tomatoes 300 g, garlic, oregano, olives, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"2 arbuna (po 350 g), rajčice 300 g, češnjak, origano, masline, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Chop the tomatoes and mix with garlic, oregano, olives and oil.":"Narežite rajčice i pomiješajte s češnjakom, origanom, maslinama i uljem.","Lay the fish in a dish, cover with the mixture and pour in the wine.":"Stavite ribu u pekač, prekrijte smjesom i ulijte vino.","Bake 25–30 minutes at 190 °C.":"Pecite 25–30 minuta na 190 °C.","Pan-fried pandora with garlic and wine":"Arbun na tavi s češnjakom i vinom","2 pandora, flour, olive oil, 2 garlic cloves, white wine 80 ml, lemon, parsley, salt":"2 arbuna, brašno, maslinovo ulje, 2 režnja češnjaka, bijelo vino 80 ml, limun, peršin, sol","Dredge the fish in flour and fry 4 minutes per side.":"Ribu uvaljajte u brašno i pržite po 4 minute sa svake strane.","Add garlic and wine and let it reduce by half.":"Dodajte češnjak i vino i pustite da se uvari za pola.","Serve with lemon and parsley.":"Poslužite s limunom i peršinom.","A red porgy, a bottom fish of rocks and stones at 20–150 m, with the young closer to shore. It eats crustaceans, molluscs and fish. Wary but takes bottom rigs and live bait, best in spring and autumn. Usually 30–50 cm, up to 70 cm.":"Crvena orada, pridnena riba stijena i kamenja na 20–150 m, mlađ je bliže obali. Hrani se rakovima, mekušcima i ribom. Oprezna je, ali hvata se na dublju i živu ribu, najbolje u proljeće i jesen. Obično 30–50 cm, do 70 cm.","Red porgy baked in salt":"Pagar pečen u soli","red porgy 700 g, sea salt 1 kg, 2 egg whites, lemon, thyme, olive oil":"pagar 700 g, morska sol 1 kg, 2 bjelanjka, limun, timijan, maslinovo ulje","Gut the fish and put lemon and thyme inside.":"Očistite ribu i u trbuh stavite limun i timijan.","Mix the salt with the egg whites and cover the whole fish with it.":"Pomiješajte sol s bjelanjcima i potpuno prekrijte ribu.","Bake 30 minutes at 200 °C, crack the crust and serve with oil and lemon.":"Pecite 30 minuta na 200 °C, razbijte koru i poslužite s uljem i limunom.","Grilled red porgy with vegetables":"Pagar na žaru s povrćem","red porgy 700 g, courgette, aubergine, tomatoes, olive oil, garlic, basil, salt":"pagar 700 g, tikvice, patlidžan, rajčice, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, bosiljak, sol","Slice the vegetables, brush with oil and grill 3 minutes per side.":"Narežite povrće, namažite uljem i ispecite po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Salt and oil the fish and grill 7–8 minutes per side.":"Ribu posolite, namažite uljem i pecite po 7–8 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with the vegetables, garlic and basil.":"Poslužite s povrćem, češnjakom i bosiljkom.","The striped seabream lives on sand and shell bottoms along the shore and in bays at 1–30 m. It digs for worms and molluscs, so it takes worms, shrimp and mussel. Bites at dusk and night, in shoals. Usually 20–30 cm, up to 50 cm.":"Ovčica živi na pijesku i školjkaškom dnu uz obalu i u zaljevima na 1–30 m. Kopa za crvima i mekušcima, pa se hvata na crva, kozicu i dagnju. Grize u sumrak i noću, u jatima. Obično 20–30 cm, do 50 cm.","Grilled striped seabream with lemon and parsley":"Ovčica na žaru s limunom i peršinom","2–3 striped seabream (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt":"2–3 ovčice (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol","Gut, salt and brush with oil.":"Očistite, posolite i namažite uljem.","Dress with oil, lemon, garlic and parsley.":"Prelijte uljem s limunom, češnjakom i peršinom.","Striped seabream in tomato sauce":"Ovčica u umaku od rajčice","3 striped seabream, tomatoes 400 g, garlic, parsley, white wine 60 ml, olive oil, salt":"3 ovčice, rajčice 400 g, češnjak, peršin, bijelo vino 60 ml, maslinovo ulje, sol","Warm oil with garlic, add chopped tomatoes and wine.":"Zagrijte ulje s češnjakom, dodajte narezane rajčice i vino.","Simmer the sauce 10 minutes and lay in the fish.":"Kuhajte umak 10 minuta i stavite ribu.","Cover and cook 10 minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Poklopite i kuhajte 10 minuta, pospite peršinom.","The sharpsnout bream lives at rocks and stony shores at 1–50 m and eats shellfish and weed from the bottom. In autumn and winter after rough weather it comes to the surf zone. It takes crab, mussel and worm and is wary. Usually 25–40 cm, up to 60 cm.":"Pic živi uz stijene i kamenite obale na 1–50 m i hrani se školjkama i algama s dna. U jesen i zimu poslije nemirnog mora dolazi u zonu praska. Hvata se na raka, dagnju i crva, oprezan je. Obično 25–40 cm, do 60 cm.","Grilled sharpsnout bream with garlic and oil":"Pic na žaru s češnjakom i uljem","sharpsnout bream 700 g, olive oil, garlic, lemon, parsley, rosemary, salt":"pic 700 g, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, limun, peršin, ruzmarin, sol","Gut, score the flanks, salt and put rosemary in the belly.":"Očistite, zarežite bokove, posolite i u trbuh stavite ruzmarin.","Brush with oil and grill 8 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 8 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon and a sauce of oil, garlic and parsley.":"Poslužite s limunom i umakom od ulja, češnjaka i peršina.","Oven-baked sharpsnout bream with potatoes":"Pic iz pećnice s krumpirom","sharpsnout bream 700 g, potatoes 500 g, onion, garlic, tomatoes, white wine 80 ml, olive oil, oregano":"pic 700 g, krumpir 500 g, luk, češnjak, rajčice, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje, origano","Slice the potatoes, onion and tomatoes, toss with oil, salt and oregano and bake 15 minutes.":"Narežite krumpir, luk i rajčice, pomiješajte s uljem, soli i origanom i pecite 15 minuta.","Add the fish and pour in the wine.":"Položite ribu i ulijte vino.","Bake another 25 minutes at 200 °C.":"Pecite još 25 minuta na 200 °C.","The common two-banded sea bream stays near rocks, weed and stony bottoms at 1–50 m. It likes mussels, crabs and worms. Takes bottom and float rigs well, active morning and evening, especially in autumn. Usually 15–25 cm, up to 45 cm.":"Fratar se drži uz stijene, alge i kamenito dno na 1–50 m. Voli dagnje, rakove i crve. Dobro se hvata na dublju i plovak, aktivan je ujutro i uvečer, posebno u jesen. Obično 15–25 cm, do 45 cm.","Fried two-banded bream with lemon":"Pržen fratar s limunom","4–5 two-banded bream, flour, olive oil for frying, salt, lemon":"4–5 fratara, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, sol, limun","Scale and gut the fish, dry, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite ribu, osušite, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Clean the fish, dry, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite ribu, osušite, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in hot oil 3 minutes per side.":"Pržite u vrućem ulju po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon.":"Poslužite s limunom.","Grilled two-banded bream with herbs":"Fratar na žaru s travama","2–3 two-banded bream (250 g each), olive oil, garlic, rosemary, thyme, lemon, salt":"2–3 fratra (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, češnjak, ruzmarin, timijan, limun, sol","Salt the fish and put herbs and garlic in the belly.":"Posolite ribu i u trbuh stavite bilje i češnjak.","Brush with oil and grill 5–6 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 5–6 minuta sa svake strane.","Finish with lemon juice.":"Prelijte sokom limuna.","The white seabream stands near rocks and in the surf in foam and current at 1–50 m. It feeds on shellfish, sea urchins and worms. Strong and wary, it bites better in murky water and after rough weather. Usually 20–35 cm, up to 50 cm.":"Sarag stoji uz stijene i u prasku, u pjeni i struji na 1–50 m. Hrani se školjkama, ježincima i crvima. Snažan je i oprezan, bolje grize u mutnoj vodi i poslije nemirnog mora. Obično 20–35 cm, do 50 cm.","Grilled white seabream with olive oil":"Sarag na žaru s maslinovim uljem","2 white seabream (300 g each), olive oil, garlic, parsley, lemon, salt":"2 saraga (po 300 g), maslinovo ulje, češnjak, peršin, limun, sol","Grill 5–6 minutes per side.":"Pecite po 5–6 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with oil, garlic, parsley and lemon.":"Poslužite s uljem, češnjakom, peršinom i limunom.","Stewed white seabream with tomatoes and olives (Sarago in umido)":"Sarag u rajčicama s maslinama (Sarago in umido)","2 white seabream, tomatoes 400 g, olives 50 g, capers, garlic, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"2 saraga, rajčice 400 g, masline 50 g, kapari, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Fry garlic in oil, add tomatoes, wine, olives and capers.":"Popržite češnjak na ulju, dodajte rajčice, vino, masline i kapare.","Simmer 10 minutes and add the fish.":"Kuhajte 10 minuta i dodajte ribu.","Cover and cook 12–15 minutes.":"Poklopite i kuhajte 12–15 minuta.","The black seabream travels in shoals near rocks, weed and on stony-sandy bottoms at 10–100 m. It eats small crustaceans, worms and weed. In spring it comes near shore to spawn. Usually 20–30 cm, up to 50 cm.":"Kantar putuje u jatima uz stijene, alge i na kamenito-pješčanom dnu na 10–100 m. Hrani se sitnim rakovima, crvima i algama. U proljeće prilazi obali na mriješćenje. Obično 20–30 cm, do 50 cm.","Baked black seabream with potatoes and rosemary":"Kantar iz pećnice s krumpirom i ruzmarinom","2 black seabream, potatoes 400 g, rosemary, garlic, lemon, olive oil, salt":"2 kantara, krumpir 400 g, ruzmarin, češnjak, limun, maslinovo ulje, sol","Slice the potatoes, toss with oil, rosemary and salt and bake 15 minutes.":"Narežite krumpir, pomiješajte s uljem, ruzmarinom i soli i pecite 15 minuta.","Add the fish with lemon and garlic in the belly.":"Dodajte ribu s limunom i češnjakom u trbuhu.","Bake another 20–25 minutes at 200 °C.":"Pecite još 20–25 minuta na 200 °C.","Grilled black seabream with lemon":"Kantar na žaru s limunom","2 black seabream, olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt":"2 kantara, maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol","Salt and brush with oil.":"Posolite i namažite uljem.","A plant-eating fish that grazes in shoals on algae and seagrass near rocks at 1–70 m. It takes bread paste, algae and vegetable bait. Bites by day. Usually 20–30 cm, up to 45 cm. The meat can be slightly bitter.":"Biljojed, pase u jatima na algama i u travi uz stijene na 1–70 m. Hvata se na kruh, alge i biljne mamce. Grize danju. Obično 20–30 cm, do 45 cm. Meso može biti pomalo gorko.","Grilled salema with lemon and garlic":"Salpa na žaru s limunom i češnjakom","2 salema (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt":"2 salpe (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol","Clean the fish and remove all the innards thoroughly, then salt it.":"Očistite ribu i pažljivo uklonite sve utrobe, posolite.","Brush with oil and grill 5 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 5 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon, garlic and parsley.":"Poslužite s limunom, češnjakom i peršinom.","Baked salema with tomatoes":"Salpa iz pećnice s rajčicama","2 salema, tomatoes 300 g, garlic, oregano, onion, olive oil, white wine 50 ml":"2 salpe, rajčice 300 g, češnjak, origano, luk, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 50 ml","Chop the tomatoes and onion and mix with oil, garlic and oregano.":"Narežite rajčice i luk i pomiješajte s uljem, češnjakom i origanom.","Lay in the fish, cover with the mixture and add the wine.":"Stavite ribu, prekrijte smjesom i ulijte vino.","Bake 25 minutes at 190 °C.":"Pecite 25 minuta na 190 °C.","Salema meat can occasionally cause poisoning with hallucinations (ichthyoallyeinotoxism), more often in fish that fed on certain algae. Do not eat the head or innards, and avoid very large fish.":"Meso salpe povremeno izaziva trovanje s halucinacijama (ihtioaleinotoksizam), češće kod riba koje su jele određene alge. Ne jedite glavu i utrobu, a velike ribe bolje izbjegavajte.","A schooling fish at rocks, breakwaters and piers, found at 1–30 m near the surface and mid-water. It takes small pieces of fish, mussel, bread and tiny spoons. Bites by day and at dusk. Usually 15–25 cm, up to 35 cm.":"Jatna riba uz stijene, lukobrane i mulove, drži se na 1–30 m uz površinu i u sredini vode. Hvata se na sitne komadiće ribe, dagnju, kruh i male varalice. Grize danju i u sumrak. Obično 15–25 cm, do 35 cm.","Grilled saddled bream with herbs":"Ušata na žaru s travama","4 saddled bream, olive oil, garlic, thyme, lemon, salt":"4 ušate, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, timijan, limun, sol","Clean the fish, salt it and put thyme and garlic inside.":"Očistite ribu, posolite i unutra stavite timijan i češnjak.","Brush with oil and grill 3–4 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 3–4 minute sa svake strane.","Floured fried saddled bream":"Pržena ušata u brašnu","6 saddled bream, flour, olive oil, salt, lemon":"6 ušata, brašno, maslinovo ulje, sol, limun","Clean, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in hot oil 2–3 minutes per side.":"Pržite u vrućem ulju po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Drain and serve with lemon.":"Ocijedite i poslužite s limunom.","A small schooling fish found near the bottom and in mid-water over sand and seagrass at 10–100 m, rising toward the surface at night. It takes small hooks with a bit of shrimp, and feather rigs too. Usually 15–25 cm. Often used by anglers as bait.":"Sitna jatna riba, drži se uz dno i u sredini vode iznad pijeska i trave na 10–100 m, noću se diže bliže površini. Hvata se na sitne udice s komadićem kozice, a i na varalice s perjem. Obično 15–25 cm. Ribolovci je često koriste kao mamac.","Fried bogue (Boops fritti)":"Pržene bugve","10 bogue, flour, olive oil, salt, lemon":"10 bugvi, brašno, maslinovo ulje, sol, limun","Fry in hot oil 2 minutes per side.":"Pržite u vrućem ulju po 2 minute sa svake strane.","Serve hot with lemon.":"Poslužite vruće s limunom.","Marinated bogue with onions (in saor)":"Bugve u marinadi s lukom","8 bogue, flour, 2 onions, white wine vinegar 100 ml, raisins, olive oil, salt":"8 bugvi, brašno, 2 luka, bijeli vinski ocat 100 ml, grožđice, maslinovo ulje, sol","Fry the floured fish until golden.":"Ispržite ribu u brašnu do zlatne boje.","Slice the onions and soften in oil, pour in the vinegar and add raisins.":"Narežite luk, pirjajte na ulju dok ne omekša, ulijte ocat i dodajte grožđice.","Layer the fish with the onions and rest for 12 hours.":"Složite ribu u slojevima s lukom i ostavite 12 sati.","A wary schooling fish of lagoons, estuaries, harbours and shallows that feeds on mud, algae and detritus. It takes dough, bread and pieces of worm on fine tackle. It likes calm water and enters estuaries and channels on the tide. Usually 30–50 cm, up to 80 cm.":"Oprezna jatna riba laguna, ušća, luka i plićaka, hrani se muljem, algama i detritusom. Hvata se na tijesto, kruh i komadiće crva na tanku opremu. Voli mirnu vodu, uz plimu ulazi u ušća i kanale. Obično 30–50 cm, do 80 cm.","Baked mullet with tomatoes and onion":"Cipal iz pećnice s rajčicama i lukom","mullet 700 g, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, parsley, white wine 80 ml, olive oil, salt":"cipal 700 g, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, peršin, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje, sol","Slice the onion and tomatoes and mix with oil, garlic and salt.":"Narežite luk i rajčice i pomiješajte s uljem, češnjakom i soli.","Lay the fish on half of the mixture, top with the rest and add the wine.":"Ribu stavite na pola smjese, prekrijte ostatkom i ulijte vino.","Bake 30 minutes at 190 °C and sprinkle with parsley.":"Pecite 30 minuta na 190 °C i pospite peršinom.","Grilled mullet with lemon and olive oil":"Cipal na žaru s limunom i maslinovim uljem","2 mullet (350 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, oregano, salt":"2 cipla (po 350 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, origano, sol","Clean, score the flanks and salt.":"Očistite, zarežite bokove i posolite.","Brush with oil and grill 7 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 7 minuta sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon, garlic and oregano.":"Poslužite s limunom, češnjakom i origanom.","The brown meagre lives at rocks, caves and crevices at 5–100 m and is a night predator. It comes close to shore in the evening and at night and is caught on live bait near rocks. It makes drumming sounds. Usually 25–40 cm, up to 70 cm. A vulnerable species, release small ones.":"Kavala živi uz stijene, u spiljama i pukotinama na 5–100 m, noćni je grabljivac. Navečer i noću prilazi obali, lovi se na živu mamac uz stijene. Ispušta tupe zvukove. Obično 25–40 cm, do 70 cm. Ranjiva vrsta, sitne ribe pustite.","Baked meagre with tomatoes and olives":"Kavala pečena s rajčicama i maslinama","meagre 700 g, tomatoes 300 g, olives 50 g, garlic, oregano, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"kavala 700 g, rajčice 300 g, masline 50 g, češnjak, origano, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Chop the tomatoes and mix with olives, garlic, oregano and oil.":"Narežite rajčice i pomiješajte s maslinama, češnjakom, origanom i uljem.","Grilled meagre with lemon":"Kavala na žaru s limunom","meagre 700 g, olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt":"kavala 700 g, maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol","Salt the fish and brush with oil.":"Posolite ribu i namažite uljem.","Grill 7–8 minutes per side.":"Pecite po 7–8 minuta sa svake strane.","The red mullet (surmullet) roots in sand and mud with its barbels at 5–90 m looking for worms and crustaceans. It comes in small shoals to small hooks with worm and shrimp, best morning and evening, especially in autumn. Usually 15–25 cm, up to 40 cm. The meat is delicate and prized.":"Trlja bradata riva brkovima po pijesku i mulju na 5–90 m tražeći crve i račiće. Dolazi u manjim jatima na sitne udice s crvom i kozicom, najbolje ujutro i uvečer, posebno u jesen. Obično 15–25 cm, do 40 cm. Meso je nježno i cijenjeno.","Red mullet Livorno style (Triglie alla livornese)":"Trlje po livornski (Triglie alla livornese)","6 red mullet, tomatoes 400 g, 2 garlic cloves, parsley, olive oil, white wine 50 ml, chilli, salt":"6 trlja, rajčice 400 g, 2 režnja češnjaka, peršin, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 50 ml, čili, sol","Warm oil with garlic and chilli, add tomatoes and wine, simmer 10 minutes.":"Zagrijte ulje s češnjakom i čilijem, dodajte rajčice i vino i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Lay the fish in the sauce and cook 6–8 minutes.":"Stavite ribu u umak i kuhajte 6–8 minuta.","Sprinkle with parsley.":"Pospite peršinom.","Fried red mullet with lemon":"Pržene trlje s limunom","6–8 red mullet, flour, olive oil, salt, lemon":"6–8 trlja, brašno, maslinovo ulje, sol, limun","Gut the fish, salt it and dredge in flour; small fish can be cooked with scales on.":"Očistite ribu od utroba, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno; sitne ribe mogu ostati s ljuskama.","A bottom ambush predator of rocks and weed at 1–30 m that blends into its surroundings. It eats crustaceans and small fish, is active in the evening and at night and takes live bait and shrimp near the bottom. The spines are dangerous. Usually 15–25 cm. The base of fish soup.":"Pridneni grabljivac iz zasjede, živi među stijenama i algama na 1–30 m i stapa se s podlogom. Hrani se rakovima i sitnom ribom, aktivan je navečer i noću, hvata se na živu ribu i kozicu uz dno. Bodlje su opasne. Obično 15–25 cm. Osnova za riblju juhu.","Scorpionfish stew (Brodet)":"Brodet od škrpuna","scorpionfish 600–800 g, 2 onions, garlic, tomatoes 300 g, tomato paste 1 tbsp, white wine 100 ml, parsley, olive oil, bay":"škrpun 600–800 g, 2 luka, češnjak, rajčice 300 g, koncentrat rajčice 1 žlica, bijelo vino 100 ml, peršin, maslinovo ulje, lovor","Trim the fins with scissors, gut the fish and cut it into pieces.":"Škarama odrežite peraje, očistite ribu i narežite na komade.","Sauté onion and garlic, add paste, tomatoes, wine, bay and water to cover.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte koncentrat, rajčice, vino, lovor i vodu da prekrije.","Simmer 15 minutes, add the fish and cook another 15 minutes without stirring.":"Kuhajte 15 minuta, dodajte ribu i kuhajte još 15 minuta bez miješanja.","Sprinkle with parsley and serve with bread or polenta.":"Pospite peršinom i poslužite s kruhom ili palentom.","Grilled scorpionfish with olive oil":"Škrpun na žaru s maslinovim uljem","2 scorpionfish (300 g each), olive oil, garlic, parsley, lemon, salt":"2 škrpuna (po 300 g), maslinovo ulje, češnjak, peršin, limun, sol","Cut off the fins and spines, gut and salt the fish.":"Odrežite peraje i bodlje, očistite i posolite.","Brush with oil and grill 6–7 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite po 6–7 minuta sa svake strane.","Venomous spines on the dorsal fin and gill covers. Handle only with a thick glove or cloth. After a sting, soak the area in hot water (40–45 °C) for 30–90 minutes and see a doctor. Once cooked, the meat is safe.":"Otrovni bodlji na leđnoj peraji i škržnim poklopcima. Hvatajte samo debelom rukavicom ili krpom. Poslije uboda uronite mjesto u toplu vodu (40–45 °C) 30–90 minuta i javite se liječniku. Kuhano meso je bezopasno.","The large red scorpionfish lives on rocky bottoms and in crevices at 20–200 m and moves up at night. An ambush predator that takes squid, fish and shrimp near the bottom. Venomous spines. Usually 25–40 cm, up to 50 cm. Firm meat, excellent for fish soup.":"Velika crvena škrpina živi na stjenovitom dnu i u pukotinama na 20–200 m, noću se podiže. Grabljivac iz zasjede, hvata lignje, ribu i kozice uz dno. Otrovni bodlji. Obično 25–40 cm, do 50 cm. Meso je čvrsto, odlično za juhu.","Scorpionfish in “crazy water” with tomatoes (Scorfano all'acqua pazza)":"Škrpina u „ludoj vodi“ s rajčicama (Scorfano all'acqua pazza)","scorpionfish 800 g, cherry tomatoes 250 g, garlic, chilli, parsley, olive oil, water 200 ml":"škrpina 800 g, cherry rajčice 250 g, češnjak, čili, peršin, maslinovo ulje, voda 200 ml","Trim the fins and gut the fish.":"Odrežite peraje i očistite ribu.","Warm oil with garlic and chilli, add tomatoes and water, simmer 5 minutes.":"Zagrijte ulje s češnjakom i čilijem, dodajte rajčice i vodu i kuhajte 5 minuta.","Add the fish, cover and cook 15–18 minutes, sprinkle with parsley.":"Stavite ribu, poklopite i kuhajte 15–18 minuta, pospite peršinom.","Scorpionfish baked with potatoes":"Škrpina pečena s krumpirom","scorpionfish 900 g, potatoes 600 g, onion, garlic, tomatoes, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley":"škrpina 900 g, krumpir 600 g, luk, češnjak, rajčice, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin","Slice the potatoes, onion and tomatoes, toss with oil, salt and garlic and bake 20 minutes.":"Narežite krumpir, luk i rajčice, pomiješajte s uljem, soli i češnjakom i pecite 20 minuta.","Add the fish with spines trimmed and pour in the wine.":"Stavite ribu s odrezanim bodljama i ulijte vino.","Bake another 25 minutes at 200 °C and sprinkle with parsley.":"Pecite još 25 minuta na 200 °C i pospite peršinom.","A bottom fish of sandy and muddy ground at 10–150 m that walks on its pectoral fins like legs, searching for small crustaceans and worms. It takes pieces of shrimp and squid near the bottom. It makes grunting sounds. Usually 20–35 cm. The meat is firm and white.":"Pridnena riba pješčanog i muljevitog dna na 10–150 m, hoda na prsnim perajama kao na nogama i traži račiće i crve. Hvata se na komadiće kozice i lignje uz dno. Ispušta režeće zvukove. Obično 20–35 cm. Meso je čvrsto i bijelo.","Baked gurnard with tomatoes (Gallinella al forno)":"Lastavica iz pećnice s rajčicama","2 gurnard (400 g each), tomatoes 300 g, garlic, oregano, olives, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"2 lastavice (po 400 g), rajčice 300 g, češnjak, origano, masline, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Gut and salt the fish and put garlic and oregano in the belly.":"Očistite, posolite i u trbuh stavite češnjak i origano.","Lay on chopped tomatoes with olives, drizzle with oil and wine.":"Položite na narezane rajčice s maslinama, prelijte uljem i vinom.","Gurnard soup with potatoes and tomatoes":"Juha od lastavice s krumpirom i rajčicama","gurnard 700 g, potatoes 300 g, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, bay, olive oil, parsley":"lastavica 700 g, krumpir 300 g, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, lovor, maslinovo ulje, peršin","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes, bay and water and simmer 10 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice, lovor i vodu i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Add diced potatoes and cook 10 minutes.":"Dodajte krumpir u kockicama i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Add fish pieces, cook 10–12 minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Dodajte komade ribe, kuhajte 10–12 minuta i pospite peršinom.","John Dory, a flat fish with a black spot on its flank, lives near the bottom at 10–150 m over rocks and mixed ground. It ambushes small fish and shoots out its mouth. Wary. Usually 25–40 cm. The meat is white, firm and highly prized.":"Kovač, spljoštena riba s crnom mrljom na boku, živi uz dno na 10–150 m uz stijene i na mješovitom dnu. Iz zasjede lovi sitnu ribu i izbacuje usta. Oprezan je. Obično 25–40 cm. Meso je bijelo, čvrsto i vrlo cijenjeno.","Baked John Dory with cherry tomatoes (Pesce San Pietro al forno)":"Kovač pečen s cherry rajčicama","John Dory 700 g, cherry tomatoes 250 g, garlic, olives, capers, olive oil, white wine 60 ml, thyme":"kovač 700 g, cherry rajčice 250 g, češnjak, masline, kapari, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml, timijan","Gut and salt the fish and put thyme and garlic in the belly.":"Očistite i posolite ribu i u trbuh stavite timijan i češnjak.","Lay in a dish with tomatoes, olives and capers and pour over oil and wine.":"Stavite u pekač s rajčicama, maslinama i kaparima i prelijte uljem i vinom.","Pan-fried John Dory fillets with lemon":"Fileti kovača na tavi s limunom","John Dory fillets 400 g, flour, olive oil, butter 20 g, lemon, parsley, salt":"fileti kovača 400 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje, maslac 20 g, limun, peršin, sol","Salt the fillets and dredge in flour.":"Posolite filete i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in oil 2–3 minutes per side.":"Pecite na ulju po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Add the butter, lemon juice and parsley.":"Dodajte maslac, sok limuna i peršin.","Add butter, lemon juice and parsley.":"Dodajte maslac, sok limuna i peršin.","A venomous bottom fish that buries itself in sand with only its eyes and spines showing, found at 1–150 m. In summer it comes into the shallows where swimmers step on it. It ambushes small fish and shrimp and takes fish pieces near the bottom. Usually 15–30 cm. The venom breaks down when heated.":"Otrovna pridnena riba, zakopava se u pijesak tako da se vide samo oči i bodlje, na 1–150 m. Ljeti ulazi u plićake gdje na nju nagaze kupači. Iz zasjede lovi sitnu ribu i kozice, hvata se na komadić ribe uz dno. Obično 15–30 cm. Otrov se razgrađuje zagrijavanjem.","Weever in tomato sauce (fish soup style)":"Pauk u umaku od rajčice (u juhi)","weever 600 g with spines removed, tomatoes 300 g, garlic, onion, parsley, white wine 60 ml, olive oil":"pauk 600 g bez bodlji, rajčice 300 g, češnjak, luk, peršin, bijelo vino 60 ml, maslinovo ulje","Cut off the dorsal fin and gill spines with scissors and gut the fish.":"Škarama odrežite leđnu peraju, bodlje na škrgama i očistite ribu.","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes, wine and water and simmer 10 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice, vino i vodu i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Add fish pieces, cook 15 minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Dodajte komade ribe, kuhajte 15 minuta i pospite peršinom.","Fried weever with lemon":"Pržen pauk s limunom","2 weever (300 g each), flour, olive oil, lemon, salt, parsley":"2 pauka (po 300 g), brašno, maslinovo ulje, limun, sol, peršin","Trim the spines and fins, gut, salt and dredge in flour.":"Odrežite bodlje i peraje, očistite, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry 4 minutes per side.":"Pržite po 4 minute sa svake strane.","Very venomous spines on the dorsal fin and gill covers, with strong, lasting pain. Handle only with pliers or through cloth. After a sting, soak in 40–45 °C water for 30–90 minutes and see a doctor. Once cooked, the meat is safe.":"Vrlo otrovni bodlji na leđnoj peraji i škrgama, bol je jaka i dugotrajna. Hvatajte samo kliještima ili kroz krpu. Poslije uboda uronite mjesto u vodu od 40–45 °C 30–90 minuta i javite se liječniku. Kuhano meso je bezopasno.","A schooling predator of sandy-muddy bottoms that stays at 70–400 m by day and rises at night. It eats fish, shrimp and squid. For recreational fishing it is usually a deep-water and night catch. Usually 30–50 cm. The meat is tender and spoils fast, so keep it on ice.":"Jatni grabljivac pješčano-muljevitog dna, danju je na 70–400 m, noću se podiže. Hrani se ribom, kozicama i lignjama. Za rekreativni ribolov obično je dubinski i noćni ulov. Obično 30–50 cm. Meso je nježno i brzo se kvari, držite ga na ledu.","Baked hake with tomatoes and capers":"Oslić pečen s rajčicama i kaparima","hake fillets or steaks 500 g, tomatoes 300 g, capers, garlic, parsley, olive oil, white wine 60 ml":"fileti ili odresci oslića 500 g, rajčice 300 g, kapari, češnjak, peršin, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 60 ml","Chop the tomatoes and mix with capers, garlic and oil.":"Narežite rajčice i pomiješajte s kaparima, češnjakom i uljem.","Lay the fish on half, cover with the rest and add the wine.":"Stavite ribu na pola smjese, prekrijte ostatkom i ulijte vino.","Bake 20 minutes at 190 °C and sprinkle with parsley.":"Pecite 20 minuta na 190 °C i pospite peršinom.","Floured fried hake (Merluzzo fritto)":"Pržen oslić u brašnu","hake fillets 500 g, flour, olive oil, salt, lemon":"fileti oslića 500 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje, sol, limun","Cut the fillets into pieces, salt and dredge in flour.":"Narežite filete na komade, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","A night predator of rocks, wrecks and sunken objects that hides in crevices by day at 5–500 m. It eats fish, squid and octopus. Very strong, it coils and bites. It takes pieces of fish or squid near the bottom. Usually 1–2 m and 5–20 kg. The tail section is best for cooking.":"Noćni grabljivac stijena, olupina i potopljenih predmeta, danju se skriva u pukotinama na 5–500 m. Hrani se ribom, lignjama i hobotnicama. Vrlo je jak, obavija se i grize. Hvata se na komad ribe ili lignje uz dno. Obično 1–2 m i 5–20 kg. Za kuhanje je najbolji repni dio.","Conger in tomato sauce (Grongo in umido)":"Ugor u umaku od rajčice","conger 800 g in pieces, tomatoes 400 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olives, bay, olive oil":"ugor 800 g u komadima, rajčice 400 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, masline, lovor, maslinovo ulje","Cut the fish into 4–5 cm pieces and salt them.":"Narežite ribu na komade od 4–5 cm i posolite.","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes, wine, olives and bay and simmer 15 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice, vino, masline i lovor i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Add the conger and cook covered for 30 minutes.":"Dodajte ugora i kuhajte poklopljeno 30 minuta.","Grilled conger with garlic and lemon":"Ugor na žaru s češnjakom i limunom","conger steaks 500 g, olive oil, garlic, lemon, parsley, oregano, salt":"odresci ugora 500 g, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, limun, peršin, origano, sol","Marinate the steaks in oil, garlic and oregano for 20 minutes.":"Marinirajte odreske u ulju, češnjaku i origanu 20 minuta.","Grill 6–7 minutes per side.":"Pecite na žaru po 6–7 minuta sa svake strane.","A strong animal with powerful jaws. Do not grab it by hand; use pliers and a strong leader and take care when unhooking.":"Snažna životinja moćnih čeljusti. Ne hvatajte je rukom, koristite kliješta i jak predvez i budite oprezni pri skidanju s udice.","A bottom predator with a huge mouth that buries itself in sand and lures fish with a “fishing rod” on its head. It lives at 20–1000 m and is rarely caught by amateurs, on deep bottom rigs. Usually 40–80 cm. Mostly the tail is eaten; the head goes into soup.":"Pridneni grabljivac ogromnih usta, zakopava se u pijesak i mami ribu „štapom“ na glavi. Živi na 20–1000 m, u rekreativnom ribolovu rijetko se lovi, na dubokim dubljama. Obično 40–80 cm. Jede se uglavnom rep, a glava ide u juhu.","Mediterranean monkfish tail (Coda di rospo)":"Rep grdobine na mediteranski način","monkfish tail 800 g, cherry tomatoes 250 g, olives 50 g, capers, garlic, olive oil, white wine 80 ml, rosemary":"rep grdobine 800 g, cherry rajčice 250 g, masline 50 g, kapari, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 80 ml, ruzmarin","Remove the thin membrane from the tail and cut into pieces.":"Skinite tanku opnu s repa i narežite na komade.","Brown in oil with garlic 3 minutes, add wine, tomatoes, olives and capers.":"Popecite na ulju s češnjakom 3 minute, dodajte vino, rajčice, masline i kapare.","Cook 15 minutes with the rosemary.":"Kuhajte 15 minuta s ruzmarinom.","Baked monkfish with lemon and herbs":"Grdobina pečena s limunom i travama","monkfish fillet 600 g, lemon, olive oil, garlic, thyme, parsley, salt":"file grdobine 600 g, limun, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, timijan, peršin, sol","Salt the fillet and mix oil, garlic, thyme and lemon zest.":"Posolite file i pomiješajte ulje, češnjak, timijan i koricu limuna.","Rub the fish with the mixture and place it in a dish with lemon slices.":"Natrljajte ribu smjesom i stavite u pekač s kolutovima limuna.","Bake 20–25 minutes at 190 °C.":"Pecite 20–25 minuta na 190 °C.","A flat bottom fish that buries itself in sand and mud at 5–100 m and eats worms and small crustaceans. Active at dusk and at night, it takes worm and shrimp on fine bottom tackle. Usually 25–40 cm. The meat is very delicate, one of the most prized.":"Plosnata pridnena riba, zakopava se u pijesak i mulj na 5–100 m i hrani se crvima i sitnim račićima. Aktivna je u sumrak i noću, hvata se na crva i kozicu na tankoj dublji uz dno. Obično 25–40 cm. Meso je vrlo nježno, jedna od najcjenjenijih vrsta.","Sole meunière (Sogliola alla mugnaia)":"List na mlinarski način (Sogliola alla mugnaia)","2 sole (300 g each), flour, butter 40 g, olive oil 2 tbsp, lemon, parsley, salt":"2 lista (po 300 g), brašno, maslac 40 g, maslinovo ulje 2 žlice, limun, peršin, sol","Skin the dark side, salt and dredge in flour.":"Skinite tamnu stranu, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in oil 3–4 minutes per side.":"Pecite na ulju po 3–4 minute sa svake strane.","Add the butter, lemon juice and parsley and spoon over the fish.":"Dodajte maslac, sok limuna i peršin i prelijte ribu.","Sole with white wine and capers":"List s bijelim vinom i kaparima","2 sole, flour, olive oil, white wine 80 ml, capers 1 tbsp, lemon, parsley, salt":"2 lista, brašno, maslinovo ulje, bijelo vino 80 ml, kapari 1 žlica, limun, peršin, sol","Dredge the fish in flour and fry 3 minutes per side.":"Uvaljajte ribu u brašno i pecite po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Pour in the wine, add capers and reduce by half.":"Ulijte vino, dodajte kapare i uvarite napola.","A wrasse that lives among rocks and weed beds at 1–30 m and eats small crustaceans and molluscs. In spring and summer it comes near shore and takes worm and shrimp on fine tackle. Usually 15–25 cm. The meat is soft and bony and usually goes into fish soup.":"Usnača živi među stijenama i u zaraslinama algi na 1–30 m, hrani se sitnim rakovima i mekušcima. U proljeće i ljeto prilazi obali, hvata se na crva i kozicu na tankoj opremi. Obično 15–25 cm. Meso je mekano i koščato, obično ide u juhu.","Rockfish soup with wrasse (Zuppa di pesce di scoglio)":"Juha od usnača s kamenih riba","wrasse and other small rockfish 700 g, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, white wine 80 ml, parsley, olive oil, bay":"lumbrak i ostala sitna riba 700 g, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 80 ml, peršin, maslinovo ulje, lovor","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes, wine, bay and water and simmer 15 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice, vino, lovor i vodu i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes, wine, bay and water, and simmer 15 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice, vino, lovor i vodu i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Add the fish and cook 15 minutes.":"Dodajte ribu i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Strain through a sieve if bones matter; serve with bread and parsley.":"Procijedite kroz sito ako smetaju kosti; poslužite s kruhom i peršinom.","Fried wrasse with lemon":"Pržen lumbrak s limunom","6 wrasse, flour, olive oil, salt, lemon":"6 lumbraka, brašno, maslinovo ulje, sol, limun","Clean the fish, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite ribu, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","A colourful shallow-water predator at rocks and seagrass at 1–150 m that ambushes small fish and shrimp. Bold, it takes any bait: worm, shrimp, fish strip. Bites by day. Usually 15–25 cm. The meat is tasty but bony.":"Šarena grabljivica plićaka, drži se uz stijene, kamenje i u travi na 1–150 m, iz zasjede lovi sitnu ribu i kozice. Smiona je, hvata se na svaki mamac: crva, kozicu, komadić ribe. Grize danju. Obično 15–25 cm. Meso je ukusno, ali koščato.","Fried painted comber with garlic":"Pržena pirka s češnjakom","5–6 painted comber, flour, olive oil, garlic, parsley, salt, lemon":"5–6 pirki, brašno, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, peršin, sol, limun","Add garlic and parsley for the last minute.":"Posljednju minutu dodajte češnjak i peršin.","Painted comber in tomato fish soup":"Pirke u juhi od rajčice","6–8 painted comber, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, white wine 60 ml, parsley, bay, olive oil":"6–8 pirki, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 60 ml, peršin, lovor, maslinovo ulje","Add the fish and cook 12 minutes.":"Dodajte ribu i kuhajte 12 minuta.","A schooling fish of open water over seagrass and sand at 10–100 m that comes inshore to spawn in spring and summer. It feeds on plankton and small crustaceans and takes small hooks with a bit of shrimp. Males are brightly coloured in spring. Usually 15–20 cm.":"Jatna riba otvorene vode iznad trave i pijeska na 10–100 m, u proljeće i ljeto dolazi prema obali na mriješćenje. Hrani se planktonom i sitnim račićima, hvata se na sitne udice s komadićem kozice. Mužjaci su u proljeće jarko obojeni. Obično 15–20 cm.","Fried picarel with lemon (Zerro fritto)":"Prženi modraci s limunom","10 picarel, flour, olive oil for frying, salt, lemon":"10 modraka, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, sol, limun","Marinated picarel with onion and vinegar":"Modrak u marinadi s lukom i octom","10 picarel, flour, olive oil, 2 onions, white wine vinegar 100 ml, bay, peppercorns, salt":"10 modraka, brašno, maslinovo ulje, 2 luka, bijeli vinski ocat 100 ml, lovor, papar u zrnu, sol","Stew the onions separately, add vinegar, bay and pepper and warm through.":"Posebno pirjajte luk, dodajte ocat, lovor i papar i zagrijte.","Pour the marinade over the fish and leave 12 hours.":"Prelijte ribu marinadom i ostavite 12 sati.","A small comber of rocks and stony bottoms found at 5–100 m, an ambush predator that takes worm, shrimp and fish strips. Often a bycatch when fishing for sea breams. Usually 12–20 cm. The meat goes into soup, or the fish is fried whole.":"Mali kanjac stijena i kamenitog dna, drži se na 5–100 m, grabljivac iz zasjede, hvata se na crva, kozicu i komadić ribe. Često se hvata usputno pri lovu šparida. Obično 12–20 cm. Meso ide u juhu ili se prži cijelo.","Fried comber with garlic and lemon":"Pržen kanjac s češnjakom i limunom","6 comber, flour, olive oil, garlic, lemon, salt, parsley":"6 kanjaca, brašno, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, limun, sol, peršin","Fry 2–3 minutes per side.":"Pržite po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Comber in tomato soup":"Kanjac u juhi od rajčice","8 comber, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, white wine 60 ml, parsley, bay, olive oil":"8 kanjaca, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 60 ml, peršin, lovor, maslinovo ulje","A small colourful wrasse found on rocks and in weed at 1–120 m, eating crustaceans and molluscs. Very curious, it attacks any bait and often strips it from the hook. It buries itself in sand at night. Usually 10–18 cm. Small and bony, it goes into soup.":"Mali šareni usnjak živi na kamenju, stijenama i u travi na 1–120 m, hrani se račićima i mekušcima. Vrlo je znatiželjan, napada svaki mamac i često ga skida s udice. Noću se zakopava u pijesak. Obično 10–18 cm. Sitan je i koščat, pa ide u juhu.","Fried rainbow wrasse with lemon":"Pržen knez s limunom","10–12 rainbow wrasse, flour, olive oil for frying, salt, lemon":"10–12 knezova, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, sol, limun","Rainbow wrasse in tomato soup":"Knezovi u juhi od rajčice","12 rainbow wrasse, tomatoes 300 g, onion, garlic, white wine 60 ml, parsley, bay, olive oil":"12 knezova, rajčice 300 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 60 ml, peršin, lovor, maslinovo ulje","Add the fish and cook 10 minutes.":"Dodajte ribu i kuhajte 10 minuta.","Strain and sprinkle with parsley.":"Procijedite i pospite peršinom.","An oceanic shark that appears in the Adriatic rarely, in summer, in open water. It hunts fish and squid. Fish are segregated by sex and size. A protected species that must not be taken. If caught by accident, release it alive without lifting it out of the water.":"Oceanski morski pas, u Jadranu se pojavljuje rijetko, ljeti, na otvorenom moru. Lovi ribu i lignje. Jedinke se drže odvojeno po spolu i veličini. Zaštićena vrsta koju se ne smije uzimati. Ako je slučajno ulovljena, pustite je živu, ne izvlačeći je iz vode.","This species is protected in Montenegro: it must not be taken, so there are no recipes. Release it alive.":"Ova vrsta je zaštićena u Crnoj Gori: ne smije se uzimati, pa nema recepata. Pustite je živu.","A small bottom shark found on sand and rock at 10–400 m that hunts crustaceans, worms and small fish at night. It lays eggs in horny capsules. Harmless to people. Usually 40–70 cm. In Montenegro sharks and rays are mostly protected.":"Mali pridneni morski pas živi na pijesku i stijenama na 10–400 m, noću lovi račiće, crve i sitnu ribu. Polaže jaja u rožnatim kapsulama. Bezopasan je za čovjeka. Obično 40–70 cm. U Crnoj Gori morski psi i raže uglavnom su zaštićeni.","In Montenegro sharks and rays are mostly protected, so there are no recipes. Release the catch alive and unhook it carefully.":"U Crnoj Gori morski psi i raže uglavnom su zaštićeni, pa nema recepata. Pustite ulov živ i pažljivo ga skinite s udice.","A schooling pelagic fish that hunts sardines, anchovies and crustaceans near the surface and approaches the coast in warm weather. It takes feather rigs, small spoons and strips of fish. Active morning and evening. Usually 25–35 cm. The oily meat spoils quickly, so ice it.":"Jatna pelagijska riba, lovi sardine, inćune i račiće uz površinu i prilazi obali po toplom vremenu. Hvata se na varalice s perjem, sitne varalice i trakice ribe. Aktivna je ujutro i uvečer. Obično 25–35 cm. Masno meso se brzo kvari, stavite je na led.","Grilled chub mackerel with lemon and herbs":"Lokarda na žaru s limunom i travama","2–3 chub mackerel (250 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, rosemary, salt":"2–3 lokarde (po 250 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, ruzmarin, sol","Gut the fish, salt and put rosemary and garlic in the belly.":"Očistite ribu, posolite i u trbuh stavite ruzmarin i češnjak.","Oven-baked chub mackerel with potatoes and tomatoes":"Lokarda iz pećnice s krumpirom i rajčicama","2 chub mackerel, potatoes 400 g, tomatoes 200 g, onion, garlic, olive oil, oregano, white wine 50 ml":"2 lokarde, krumpir 400 g, rajčice 200 g, luk, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, origano, bijelo vino 50 ml","Slice the potatoes, onion and tomatoes, toss with oil, garlic and oregano and bake 15 minutes.":"Narežite krumpir, luk i rajčice, pomiješajte s uljem, češnjakom i origanom i pecite 15 minuta.","A schooling fish found near the bottom and mid-water over sand and rock at 10–500 m that comes to light at night. It eats crustaceans and small fish. Takes feather rigs and strips of fish and is caught by the dozen. Usually 15–25 cm. Good for frying and for preserving.":"Jatna riba uz dno i u sredini vode iznad pijeska i stijena na 10–500 m, noću dolazi na svjetlo. Hrani se račićima i sitnom ribom. Hvata se na varalice s perjem i trakice ribe, ulovi se na desetke. Obično 15–25 cm. Dobra je za prženje i konzerviranje.","Fried horse mackerel with garlic and lemon":"Pržen šarun s češnjakom i limunom","6–8 horse mackerel, flour, olive oil, garlic, lemon, salt, parsley":"6–8 šaruna, brašno, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, limun, sol, peršin","Sprinkle with garlic and parsley and serve with lemon.":"Pospite češnjakom i peršinom i poslužite s limunom.","Grilled horse mackerel with olive oil":"Šarun na žaru s maslinovim uljem","4 horse mackerel (150 g each), olive oil, lemon, garlic, oregano, salt":"4 šaruna (po 150 g), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, origano, sol","Gut, salt and brush with oil, garlic and oregano.":"Očistite, posolite i namažite uljem s češnjakom i origanom.","A small pelagic fish that travels in enormous shoals in the upper water and comes to light at night. It feeds on plankton. Recreational catching uses lift nets with a lamp where allowed. Highly valued in the kitchen, usually 9–15 cm. Freshness is critical, it spoils quickly.":"Mala pelagijska riba, kreće se u golemim jatima u gornjim slojevima vode, noću dolazi na svjetlo. Hrani se planktonom. Rekreativni ulov mrežama s lampom, gdje je dopušteno. Cijenjena u kuhinji, obično 9–15 cm. Svježina je presudna jer se brzo kvari.","Marinated anchovies (Alici marinate)":"Marinirani inćuni","fresh anchovies 400 g, white wine vinegar 150 ml, 2 garlic cloves, parsley, olive oil, salt, chilli":"svježi inćuni 400 g, bijeli vinski ocat 150 ml, 2 režnja češnjaka, peršin, maslinovo ulje, sol, čili","Clean the anchovies, fillet them, rinse and lay in a dish.":"Očistite inćune, razdvojite na filete, isperite i složite u posudu.","Cover with vinegar and leave 2–3 hours until the flesh turns white.":"Prelijte octom i ostavite 2–3 sata dok meso ne pobijeli.","Drain the vinegar, add oil, garlic, parsley and chilli and rest another hour.":"Ocijedite ocat, dodajte ulje, češnjak, peršin i čili i ostavite još sat vremena.","Floured fried anchovies":"Pohani inćuni","anchovies 400 g, flour, olive oil for frying, salt, lemon":"inćuni 400 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, sol, limun","Clean the anchovies, dry, salt and dredge in flour.":"Očistite inćune, osušite, posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","Fry in very hot oil 1–2 minutes.":"Pržite u vrlo vrućem ulju 1–2 minute.","Serve at once with lemon.":"Poslužite odmah s limunom.","A schooling pelagic fish found near the surface and down to 100 m that comes to light at night. It feeds on plankton. Recreationally caught with feather rigs and small hooks where allowed. Usually 12–20 cm. Fattiest and tastiest in autumn. Freshness is everything.":"Jatna pelagijska riba, drži se uz površinu i do 100 m, noću dolazi na svjetlo. Hrani se planktonom. Rekreativno se lovi varalicama s perjem i sitnim udicama, gdje je dopušteno. Obično 12–20 cm. Najmasnija i najukusnija je u jesen. Svježina je sve.","Grilled sardines (Sarde alla griglia)":"Srdele na žaru","8–10 sardines, olive oil, coarse salt, lemon, parsley, garlic":"8–10 srdela, maslinovo ulje, krupna sol, limun, peršin, češnjak","Gut the sardines but leave the scales on, dry and sprinkle with coarse salt.":"Očistite srdele, ljuske ne skidajte, osušite i pospite krupnom soli.","Brush with oil and grill over high heat 2–3 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i pecite na jakoj vatri po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Stuffed sardines “a beccafico” (Sarde a beccafico)":"Punjene srdele „a beccafico“","12 sardines, breadcrumbs 100 g, raisins 2 tbsp, pine nuts 2 tbsp, parsley, orange, bay leaves, olive oil":"12 srdela, krušne mrvice 100 g, grožđice 2 žlice, pinjoli 2 žlice, peršin, naranča, lovorovi listovi, maslinovo ulje","Gut the sardines, open them like a book and remove the backbone.":"Očistite srdele, otvorite ih poput knjige i izvadite kralježnicu.","Toast the breadcrumbs in oil and mix with raisins, nuts, parsley and orange zest.":"Popržite mrvice na ulju i pomiješajte s grožđicama, pinjolima, peršinom i koricom naranče.","Spoon the filling on the fish, roll them up and place in a dish with bay leaves.":"Stavite nadjev na ribice, urolajte i složite u pekač s lovorom.","Bake 15 minutes at 190 °C and splash with orange juice.":"Pecite 15 minuta na 190 °C i pokapajte sokom naranče.","A solitary animal that lives in dens and among rocks at 1–200 m and comes out at night and at dusk. It eats crabs, molluscs and fish. Very clever; it takes a weighted crab or special lures. Usually 1–3 kg, up to 10 kg. The meat needs tenderising before cooking.":"Samotnjak, živi u jazbinama i među stijenama na 1–200 m, izlazi noću i u sumrak. Hrani se rakovima, mekušcima i ribom. Vrlo je pametan, hvata se na raka s utegom i posebne mamce. Obično 1–3 kg, do 10 kg. Meso treba omekšati prije kuhanja.","Octopus and potato salad (Insalata di polpo)":"Salata od hobotnice s krumpirom","octopus 1 kg, potatoes 500 g, olive oil 4 tbsp, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt, bay":"hobotnica 1 kg, krumpir 500 g, maslinovo ulje 4 žlice, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol, lovor","Freeze the octopus for a day and thaw it to make it tender, or tenderise it by beating.":"Smrznite hobotnicu na dan i odmrznite je da omekša, ili je istucite.","Simmer in water with bay for 45–60 minutes until a fork goes in easily. Let it cool in the water.":"Kuhajte u vodi s lovorom 45–60 minuta dok vilica lako ne uđe. Ostavite da se ohladi u vodi.","Boil and slice the potatoes and mix with the sliced octopus.":"Skuhajte krumpir, narežite i pomiješajte s narezanom hobotnicom.","Dress with oil, lemon juice, garlic and parsley.":"Začinite uljem, sokom limuna, češnjakom i peršinom.","Octopus under the bell (Hobotnica ispod peke)":"Hobotnica ispod peke","octopus 1.2 kg, potatoes 800 g, onion, garlic, 2 tomatoes, white wine 150 ml, olive oil, bay, rosemary":"hobotnica 1,2 kg, krumpir 800 g, luk, češnjak, 2 rajčice, bijelo vino 150 ml, maslinovo ulje, lovor, ruzmarin","Thaw the octopus and cut it into large pieces.":"Odmrznite hobotnicu i narežite na veće komade.","Layer in a dish with potatoes, onion, tomatoes, garlic, bay and rosemary.":"Složite u posudu s krumpirom, lukom, rajčicama, češnjakom, lovorom i ruzmarinom.","Pour in wine and oil, cover with a lid or foil and bake 90 minutes at 180 °C.":"Ulijte vino i ulje, poklopite ili pokrijte folijom i pecite 90 minuta na 180 °C.","Uncover for the last 15 minutes for a browned top.":"Skinite poklopac u posljednjih 15 minuta da porumeni.","A cephalopod with an internal chalky cuttlebone, living on sandy and muddy bottoms and in seagrass at 1–200 m. In spring it comes into the shallows to spawn and lays “grapes” of eggs. Caught on squid jigs and on live crab or shrimp. Usually 15–30 cm. It releases ink, which is used in cooking.":"Glavonožac s unutarnjom vapnenačkom pločom, živi na pješčanom i muljevitom dnu i u travi na 1–200 m. U proljeće dolazi u plićake na mriješćenje i polaže „grozdove“ jaja. Lovi se na varalice za lignje i na živog raka i kozicu. Obično 15–30 cm. Ispušta tintu koja se koristi u kuhinji.","Cuttlefish ink risotto (Risotto al nero di seppia)":"Crni rižot (Risotto al nero di seppia)","cuttlefish 500 g with ink, arborio rice 250 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, tomato paste 1 tbsp, fish stock 800 ml, olive oil, parsley":"sipa 500 g s tintom, arborio riža 250 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, koncentrat rajčice 1 žlica, riblji temeljac 800 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin","Clean the cuttlefish, keep the ink sac and cut the flesh into strips.":"Očistite sipu, sačuvajte mjehur s tintom i narežite meso na trakice.","Sauté onion and garlic, add the cuttlefish, paste and wine and stew for 20 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte sipu, koncentrat i vino i pirjajte 20 minuta.","Stir in the rice and add hot stock a ladle at a time for 18 minutes.":"Dodajte rižu i uz miješanje dodavajte vrući temeljac po zalihu 18 minuta.","Stir in the ink and sprinkle with parsley.":"Umiješajte tintu i pospite peršinom.","Cuttlefish stewed with peas (Seppie in umido con piselli)":"Sipa s graškom (Seppie in umido con piselli)","cuttlefish 700 g, green peas 250 g, tomatoes 250 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley":"sipa 700 g, zeleni grašak 250 g, rajčice 250 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin","Cut the cleaned cuttlefish into pieces.":"Očišćenu sipu narežite na komade.","Sauté onion and garlic, add the cuttlefish and wine and stew 20 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte sipu i vino i pirjajte 20 minuta.","Add tomatoes and peas, stew 20 more minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Dodajte rajčice i grašak, pirjajte još 20 minuta i pospite peršinom.","A large open-sea squid that lives in shoals at 50–1000 m and rarely comes into the shallows, in autumn and winter. Caught at night on a lamp and jigs well offshore. Usually 25–45 cm, up to 70 cm. The flesh is denser than ordinary squid.":"Veliki lignjun otvorenog mora, živi u jatima na 50–1000 m i rijetko dolazi u plićake, u jesen i zimu. Lovi se noću na lampu i varalice daleko od obale. Obično 25–45 cm, do 70 cm. Meso je gušće od običnih lignji.","Stuffed flying squid (Totani ripieni)":"Punjeni totani","2 flying squid (300 g each), breadcrumbs 4 tbsp, garlic, parsley, parmesan 2 tbsp, tomatoes 300 g, white wine 80 ml, olive oil":"2 totana (po 300 g), krušne mrvice 4 žlice, češnjak, peršin, parmezan 2 žlice, rajčice 300 g, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje","Fill the bodies two thirds full and close with toothpicks.":"Napunite tijela do dvije trećine i zatvorite čačkalicama.","Brown, add tomatoes and wine and stew covered 35–40 minutes.":"Popecite, dodajte rajčice i vino i pirjajte poklopljeno 35–40 minuta.","Grilled flying squid with garlic":"Totan na žaru s češnjakom","flying squid 500 g, olive oil, garlic, parsley, lemon, salt":"totan 500 g, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, peršin, limun, sol","Clean the squid and score the body in a crosshatch so it does not curl.":"Očistite totana i zarežite tijelo u mrežu da se ne savija.","Grill over strong heat 2–3 minutes per side.":"Pecite na jakoj vatri po 2–3 minute sa svake strane.","Dress with oil, garlic, parsley and lemon.":"Prelijte uljem s češnjakom, peršinom i limunom.","A small octopus with a single row of suckers on its arms that lives on sandy and muddy bottoms at 10–200 m and roams near the bottom. Caught as a bycatch on bottom gear. It smells of musk. Usually 15–30 cm. The flesh is firm but more tender than common octopus.":"Mala hobotnica s jednim redom pipaka na kracima, živi na pješčanom i muljevitom dnu na 10–200 m i kreće se uz dno. Hvata se usputno na pridnenoj opremi. Miriše na mošus. Obično 15–30 cm. Meso je čvrsto, ali nježnije nego kod obične hobotnice.","Musky octopus in tomato sauce (Moscardini in umido)":"Mušun u umaku od rajčice","musky octopus 500 g, tomatoes 400 g, garlic, chilli, parsley, white wine 80 ml, olive oil":"mušuni 500 g, rajčice 400 g, češnjak, čili, peršin, bijelo vino 80 ml, maslinovo ulje","Clean the octopus, remove the beak and innards and rinse.":"Očistite hobotnice, uklonite kljun i utrobu i isperite.","Warm oil with garlic and chilli and add the octopus, wine and tomatoes.":"Zagrijte ulje s češnjakom i čilijem i dodajte hobotnice, vino i rajčice.","Cook covered 35–40 minutes and sprinkle with parsley.":"Kuhajte poklopljeno 35–40 minuta i pospite peršinom.","Grilled musky octopus":"Mušuni na žaru","musky octopus 500 g, olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt, oregano":"mušuni 500 g, maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol, origano","Boil the octopus in water for 20 minutes and let cool.":"Skuhajte hobotnice u vodi 20 minuta i ostavite da se ohlade.","Brush with oil and sear on the grill 2 minutes per side.":"Namažite uljem i ispecite na žaru po 2 minute sa svake strane.","Serve with lemon, garlic, parsley and oregano.":"Poslužite s limunom, češnjakom, peršinom i origanom.","A crustacean of rocks and caves at 5–200 m that comes out at night to feed on crabs, molluscs and worms. By day it hides in crevices in groups. Taken by traps and, where allowed, by hand while spearfishing. Weighs 0.5–3 kg. Strictly regulated: check closed seasons and size limits.":"Rak stijena i spilja na 5–200 m, noću izlazi hraniti se rakovima, mekušcima i crvima. Danju se skriva u pukotinama u skupinama. Lovi se zamkama i, gdje je dopušteno, rukom pri podvodnom ribolovu. Teži 0,5–3 kg. Strogo je regulirano: provjerite zabrane i veličine.","Dalmatian spiny lobster buzara (Jastog na buzaru)":"Jastog na buzaru","spiny lobster 1 kg, tomatoes 300 g, 4 garlic cloves, parsley, white wine 150 ml, breadcrumbs 2 tbsp, olive oil, pepper":"jastog 1 kg, rajčice 300 g, 4 režnja češnjaka, peršin, bijelo vino 150 ml, krušne mrvice 2 žlice, maslinovo ulje, papar","Cut the lobster into pieces with the shell.":"Narežite jastoga na komade zajedno s oklopom.","Warm oil with garlic and add tomatoes, wine, breadcrumbs and pepper.":"Zagrijte ulje s češnjakom i dodajte rajčice, vino, mrvice i papar.","Add the lobster and cook covered 15–20 minutes. Sprinkle with parsley.":"Dodajte jastoga i kuhajte poklopljeno 15–20 minuta. Pospite peršinom.","Grilled spiny lobster with lemon oil":"Jastog na žaru s uljem i limunom","spiny lobster 700 g, olive oil, lemon, garlic, parsley, salt, pepper":"jastog 700 g, maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, peršin, sol, papar","Halve the lobster lengthways and salt it.":"Prepolovite jastoga po dužini i posolite.","Brush with oil and grill cut side down for 5 minutes, then turn for 8 minutes.":"Namažite uljem i pecite prerezom prema dolje 5 minuta, zatim okrenite na 8 minuta.","Serve with oil, garlic, lemon and parsley.":"Poslužite s uljem, češnjakom, limunom i peršinom.","An invasive Indian Ocean species (Pterois miles) first recorded in the Adriatic in 2019 and now increasingly common off Montenegro, Albania and Croatia. It lives on rocks, in caves and around wrecks at 1–50 m, hunting small fish and crustaceans, more active at night. Takes small fish and shrimp. Up to 35–40 cm. The flesh is tasty and delicate. Catching it is encouraged to control the species.":"Invazivna vrsta iz Indijskog oceana (Pterois miles), u Jadranu prvi put zabilježena 2019., sve češća uz obale Crne Gore, Albanije i Hrvatske. Živi na stijenama, u spiljama i oko olupina na 1–50 m, lovi sitnu ribu i račiće, aktivnija je noću. Hvata se na sitnu ribu i kozice. Do 35–40 cm. Meso je ukusno i nježno. Lov je poželjan kao mjera suzbijanja vrste.","Baked lionfish with lemon and herbs":"Pečena ribe-lav s limunom i travama","lionfish 600 g (spines removed), olive oil, lemon, garlic, rosemary, thyme, salt":"riba-lav 600 g (bodlje odrezane), maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, ruzmarin, timijan, sol","Wearing gloves, cut off all fins and spines with scissors, gut and scale.":"U rukavicama škarama odrežite sva peraja i bodlje, očistite utrobu i ljuske.","Salt, put lemon, garlic and herbs in the belly and drizzle with oil.":"Posolite, u trbuh stavite limun, češnjak i bilje i pokapajte uljem.","Pan-fried lionfish fillets":"Fileti ribe-lav na tavi","lionfish fillets 400 g, flour, olive oil, butter 20 g, lemon, parsley, salt":"fileti ribe-lav 400 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje, maslac 20 g, limun, peršin, sol","Cut off the spines in gloves, fillet, salt and dust lightly with flour.":"U rukavicama odrežite bodlje, filetirajte, posolite i lagano uvaljajte u brašno.","DANGER: the spines of the dorsal, anal and pelvic fins are venomous. Never handle bare-handed; use thick gloves and pliers and keep it in a container. A sting causes severe pain, swelling and sometimes nausea. Immerse the wound in hot (40–45 °C, bearable) water for 30–90 minutes and see a doctor. The venom is destroyed by heat; after the spines are cut off the flesh is safe. Report the catch to local scientific services.":"OPASNO: bodlje leđne, analne i trbušnih peraja su otrovne. Nikad ne dirajte golim rukama, koristite debele rukavice i kliješta i držite je u posudi. Ubod uzrokuje jaku bol, oticanje i ponekad mučninu. Uronite ranu u vruću (40–45 °C, podnošljivu) vodu na 30–90 minuta i obratite se liječniku. Otrov se uništava toplinom, a meso je nakon odrezanih bodlji sigurno. Prijavite ulov lokalnim znanstvenim službama.","Rocks, caves, wrecks, 1–50 m.":"Stijene, spilje, olupine, 1–50 m.","Small fish, shrimp. More often taken by spearfishing or net.":"Sitna riba, kozice. Češće se lovi podvodnim ribolovom ili mrežicom.","Dusk and night.":"Sumrak i noć.","All year, more active in summer.":"Cijele godine, aktivnija ljeti.","Invasive species, catching is welcome. Venomous spines, take care.":"Invazivna vrsta, lov je poželjan. Otrovne bodlje, oprez.","Map unavailable":"Karta nije dostupna","Could not load the map. Check your internet connection and open the tab again.":"Nije moguće učitati kartu. Provjerite internet i ponovno otvorite karticu.","📍 Me":"📍 Ja","Tap the map: ":"Dodirnite kartu: ","Could not get your position. Allow location access in the phone settings.":"Nije moguće dobiti poziciju. Dozvolite lokaciju u postavkama telefona.","Depth: loading…":"Dubina: učitavanje…","Use this point":"Odaberi ovu točku","Forecast for this point":"Prognoza za ovu točku","Depth: no data (service unavailable).":"Dubina: nema podataka (servis nije dostupan).","Depth ≈ {0} m":"Dubina ≈ {0} m","Shoreline. Nearby depth reaches {0} m. The EMODnet grid (~100 m) is imprecise at the water's edge.":"Obala. U blizini dubina doseže {0} m. EMODnet mreža (~100 m) je neprecizna uz samu obalu.","Land.":"Kopno.","Best of the rest of the day: {0}:00–{1}:00 (score {2})":"Najbolje do kraja dana: {0}:00–{1}:00 (ocjena {2})","The number next to each day is the bite score out of 10. ⚠ means caution or danger for the selected mode (shore or boat): wind, gusts, waves, downpour or thunderstorm. Scores for later days are rougher than for today.":"Broj uz dan je ocjena ulova od 10. ⚠ znači oprez ili opasnost za odabrani režim (obala ili čamac): vjetar, udari, valovi, pljusak ili grmljavina. Ocjene za dalje dane su grublje nego za danas.","optional":"neobvezno","Weight, kg":"Težina, kg","catch location":"mjesto ulova","Current point":"Trenutna točka","Another photo":"Druga fotografija","📷 Photo of the catch":"📷 Fotografija ulova","The conditions for the selected time (bite forecast, wind, waves, pressure, water temperature, moon, sea level) are attached automatically. The photo is shrunk and stored only in this browser.":"Uvjeti za odabrano vrijeme (prognoza ulova, vjetar, valovi, tlak, temperatura vode, mjesec, razina mora) prilažu se automatski. Fotografija se smanjuje i čuva samo u ovom pregledniku.","Attach point":"Priloži točku","Delete this entry?":"Obrisati ovaj zapis?","Entries restored: {0}":"Vraćeno zapisa: {0}","The diary is stored only in this browser. If you clear the site data or remove the app from the home screen, it is lost. Make a backup from time to time.":"Dnevnik se čuva samo u ovom pregledniku. Ako obrišete podatke stranice ili uklonite aplikaciju s početnog zaslona, nestaje. Povremeno napravite kopiju.","Backup ready":"Kopija je spremna","Copied":"Kopirano","Fishing rules, cities and time zone depend on the country. The language does not change with the country; choose it below.":"Pravila ribolova, gradovi i vremenska zona ovise od države. Jezik se ne mijenja uz državu, odaberite ga ispod.","Use the country’s language":"Uključi jezik države","“Video”: a boat and a tuna under water. “Fish”: a light animation that is easier on the phone. Turn it off if your phone drains quickly. A wide version of the video is used on a computer.":"„Video“: čamac i tunj pod vodom. „Ribe“: lagana animacija, manje opterećuje telefon. Isključite ako se telefon brzo prazni. Na računalu se koristi široka verzija videa.","Could not get your position. Turn on location on your phone, go to an open area and try again. If GPS does not work, tap “Set location on the map manually”.":"Nije moguće dobiti poziciju. Uključi lokaciju na telefonu, izađi na otvoreno i pokušaj ponovno. Ako GPS ne radi, pritisni „Ručno odredi lokaciju na karti“.","Location permission denied. Allow it for this site in the phone settings (Safari → Location).":"Nema dozvole za određivanje lokacije. Dozvolite je za ovu stranicu u postavkama telefona (Safari → Lokacija).","• Weather, waves, water temperature, currents: Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0). Sea temperature and waves are model values, not measurements at your shore.\n• Depths: EMODnet Bathymetry. A grid of about 100–250 m, so near the shore it may under- or overstate the depth.\n• Satellite map and names: Esri World Imagery and Esri Reference.\n• Map: the Leaflet library.\n• Fish photos: Wikipedia and Wikimedia Commons, free licences.":"• Vrijeme, valovi, temperatura vode, struje: Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0). Temperatura mora i valovi su modelske vrijednosti, a ne mjerenja uz vašu obalu.\n• Dubine: EMODnet Bathymetry. Mreža od oko 100–250 m, pa uz samu obalu može podcijeniti ili precijeniti dubinu.\n• Satelitska karta i nazivi: Esri World Imagery i Esri Reference.\n• Karta: biblioteka Leaflet.\n• Fotografije riba: Wikipedia i Wikimedia Commons, slobodne licence.","• Weather stations (METAR): MET Norway, api.met.no (CC BY 4.0).":"• Meteorološke postaje (METAR): MET Norway, api.met.no (CC BY 4.0).","You need a personal permit and must carry it. Prices: daily €5, daily big game €30, daily spearfishing €20, up to 30 days €30, annual €50. Free under 14. Issued by the ministry, sold by authorised clubs. The permit decides your gear: daily covers handlines or rods; up to 30 days covers all regular gear except a speargun; annual covers all regular gear and a speargun. Big game gear only with the daily big game permit.":"Potrebna je osobna dozvola, nosite je sa sobom. Cijene: dnevna 5 €, dnevna big game 30 €, dnevna za podvodni ribolov 20 €, do 30 dana 30 €, godišnja 50 €. Do 14 godina besplatno. Izdaje ministarstvo, prodaju ovlašteni klubovi. Od dozvole ovisi pribor: dnevna vrijedi za povraze ili štapove; do 30 dana za sav običan pribor osim puške; godišnja za sav običan pribor i pušku. Pribor za big game samo uz dnevnu big game dozvolu.","Daily catch: up to 5 kg of fish and other marine organisms; the limit may be exceeded only by the weight of the single specimen that takes you over it. Selling the catch is banned. Mark what you keep at once: cut off the lower part of the tail fin on fish, make a deep cut between the eyes on cephalopods. Record the catch in the ministry's electronic system.":"Dnevni ulov: do 5 kg ribe i drugih morskih organizama; limit se može preći samo za masu jednog primjerka kojim je premašen. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena. Zadržani ulov se odmah označava: ribi se odsijeca donji dio repnog peraja, a glavonošcima se pravi dubok zarez između očiju. Ulov se upisuje u elektronski sustav ministarstva.","Big game (tuna, swordfish): separate daily permit, up to 2 rods with reels, gear rated 30 lb or more, AIS on the boat, notice at least one hour before landing, electronic catch log.":"Krupna riba (tunj, sabljarka): posebna dnevna dozvola, najviše 2 štapa s rolom, nosivost od 30 lb, AIS na plovilu, obavijest najkasnije sat prije iskrcaja, elektronska evidencija ulova.","Gear: up to 2 handlines or trolling lines, up to 3 hooks each (gape from 5 mm), no samolovka; up to 2 cephalopod lines, light up to 400 cd; 2 rods, up to 3 hooks each (from 7 mm); 1 fishing spear from a rowing boat without a see-through bottom; 1 pot with an orange or red float. Gear must show the permit number or QR code. Banned: trawls, purse seines, gill and combined nets, dredges, all longlines, electric gear over 800 W, drones and remote-controlled devices.":"Pribor: najviše 2 povraza ili panule, do 3 udice na svakom (širina luka od 5 mm), bez samolovki; najviše 2 povraza za glavonošce, svjetiljka do 400 kandela; 2 štapa, do 3 udice na svakom (od 7 mm); 1 osti s plovila na vesla bez prozirnog dna; 1 vrša s narančastom ili crvenom plutačom. Na priboru broj dozvole ili QR kod. Zabranjene su povlačne, plivarice, stajaćice i kombinirane mreže, dredže, svi parangali, električna oprema preko 800 W, bespilotne letjelice i naprave na daljinsko upravljanje.","Spearfishing: annual permit or daily spearfishing permit, from age 18. One speargun without an explosive charge, breath-hold only, sunrise to sunset, with a mandatory signal buoy on a line tied to your body. You may not gather organisms by hand, keep a speargun together with scuba gear on a boat or near the shore, or transport a speargun without a permit. The law is contradictory on harpoons under water: check with a club.":"Podvodni ribolov: godišnja dozvola ili dnevna za podvodni ribolov, od 18 godina. Jedna puška bez eksplozivnog punjenja, samo na dah, od izlaska do zalaska sunca, obvezna signalna bova na konopu spojenom za tijelo. Zabranjeno je sakupljati organizme rukama, držati pušku zajedno s ronilačkom opremom na plovilu i uz obalu, prevoziti pušku bez dozvole. Za harpun pod vodom zakon je proturječan: provjerite u klubu.","No fishing within 100 m of fish farm installations, and no approaching them closer than 50 m. The ban in ports, their approaches, anchorages and on organised beaches from 1 May to 1 October in daylight comes from older sources and was not found in the 2025 law: check with a club.":"Zabranjen je ribolov bliže od 100 m od uzgojnih instalacija i približavanje uzgajalištu na manje od 50 m. Zabrana u lukama, prilazima, sidrištima i na uređenim plažama od 1. svibnja do 1. listopada tijekom dana potiče iz ranijih izvora i nije pronađena u zakonu iz 2025: provjerite u klubu.","Fines for individuals: €75–200 for offences such as unmarked gear or an unrecorded catch, €750–2,000 for recreational fishing in breach of the law and for selling the catch. An inspector may temporarily seize gear and catch.":"Kazne za fizička lica: 75–200 € za prekršaje kao što su neobilježen pribor ili neevidentiran ulov, 750–2.000 € za sportsko-rekreativni ribolov suprotno zakonu i prodaju ulova. Inspektor može privremeno oduzeti pribor i ulov.","Important: this is a summary, not legal advice. The ministry is adopting new by-laws gradually; until then the earlier ones apply unless they conflict with the law (Art. 111). We found no new act on sizes, so sizes still follow Order 011-51/15 (2015). Before fishing, check the rules with a club or the ministry.":"Važno: ovo je sažetak, a ne pravni savjet. Ministarstvo postupno donosi nove podzakonske akte; do tada vrijede raniji, ako nisu u suprotnosti sa zakonom (čl. 111). Novi akt o veličinama nismo pronašli, pa su veličine još iz Naredbe 011-51/15 (2015). Prije ribolova provjerite pravila u klubu ili ministarstvu.","Sources: Zakon o morskom ribarstvu (Sl. list CG 69/25), Pravilnik o sportsko-rekreativnom ribolovu na moru (Sl. list CG 83/26, in force since 23.06.2026), Naredba 011-51/15, adriaticnature.me.":"Izvori: Zakon o morskom ribarstvu (Sl. list CG 69/25), Pravilnik o sportsko-rekreativnom ribolovu na moru (Sl. list CG 83/26, na snazi od 23.06.2026), Naredba 011-51/15, adriaticnature.me.","A new rulebook applies from 1 June 2026. You need a personal licence for 1, 3, 7 or 150 days or a year; it is tied to your ID and cannot be transferred. Sport and recreational licences are separate. National and nature parks need a special permit.":"Od 1. lipnja 2026. vrijedi novi pravilnik. Potrebna je osobna dozvola na 1, 3, 7 ili 150 dana ili godišnja; vezana je za dokument i neprenosiva. Sportska i rekreacijska dozvola su odvojene. Za nacionalne parkove i parkove prirode potrebna je posebna dozvola.","The general limit is set by law: 5 kg a day. Species limits: octopus 2, groupers 1 in total, sharks and rays 0. Listed fish you keep must have the lower tail lobe cut, cephalopods a cut on the head. The mRecFish log is mandatory from 1 January 2027 for 1, 3 and 7-day licences and adult annual and 150-day ones; all must log dolphinfish from 15 August 2026.":"Opći limit ulova određen je zakonom: 5 kg dnevno. Po vrsti: hobotnica 2, kirnje ukupno 1, morski psi i raže 0. Zadržanoj ribi s liste odsijeca se donji dio repne peraje, a glavonošcima se pravi rez na glavi. Dnevnik mRecFish je obvezan od 1. siječnja 2027. za dozvole na 1, 3 i 7 dana te odrasle godišnje i 150-dnevne; lampuga se evidentira od 15. kolovoza 2026. za sve.","Gear on a standard licence: 2 each of odmet, kančenica, panula and trapula, up to 2 cephalopod lines (up to 3 lures each). With special permits: a bottom longline up to 100 hooks, up to 3 traps, 1 fish spear, artificial light, 2 big game sets. Electric reels up to 800 W.":"Pribor uz običnu dozvolu: po 2 odmeta, kančenice, panule i trapule, do 2 pribora za glavonošce (do 3 varalice na svakom). Uz posebne dozvole: stajaći parangal do 100 udica, do 3 vrše, 1 osti, umjetno svjetlo, 2 big game kompleta. Električna rola do 800 W.","Spearfishing: only with a sport licence, no breathing apparatus. Towing the diver behind a boat and underwater scooters are banned. The law sets other limits; check them with a club.":"Podvodni ribolov: samo uz sportsku dozvolu, bez ronilačkog aparata. Zabranjeno je vuči ronioca plovilom i koristiti podvodni skuter. Ostala ograničenja određuje zakon, provjerite ih u klubu.","Selling the catch is banned. Sizes and seasons: rulebook on protecting fish (NN 64/23, 134/24). You may not keep sharks and rays, lobster and spiny lobster, eel, bluefin tuna, albacore, swordfish, echinoderms, corals or sponges; turtles, seabirds and dolphins are strictly protected. Closed seasons: brown meagre 15.05–15.07, groupers 01.07–31.08, dolphinfish 01.01–14.08.":"Prodaja ulova je zabranjena. Veličine i lovostaji: pravilnik o zaštiti riba (NN 64/23, 134/24). Ne smiju se zadržati morski psi i raže, hlap i jastog, jegulja, plavoperajna tuna, albakor, iglun, bodljikaši, koralji i spužve; kornjače, ptice i delfini su strogo zaštićeni. Lovostaji: kavala 15.05–15.07, kirnje 01.07–31.08, lampuga 01.01–14.08.","Sources: Pravilnik o sportskom i rekreacijskom ribolovu na moru (NN 48/2026), Pravilnik o zaštiti riba (NN 64/23, 134/24). Check park rules with the parks. The 5 kg figure is set by the law, whose text could not be read directly.":"Izvori: Pravilnik o sportskom i rekreacijskom ribolovu na moru (NN 48/2026), Pravilnik o zaštiti riba (NN 64/23, 134/24). Pravila parkova provjerite u samim parkovima. Brojku od 5 kg određuje zakon, čiji tekst nije bilo moguće izravno pročitati.","No licence is required for recreational sea fishing, but registration is mandatory: the angler's card (tesserino) on the SIAN portal, valid for 1 year. Selling the catch is forbidden.":"Za rekreacijski morski ribolov nije potrebna dozvola, ali je registracija obvezna: ribolovna iskaznica (tesserino) na portalu SIAN, vrijedi 1 godinu. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena.","From age 16, spearfishing and fishing from a boat require the RecFishing app. Bluefin tuna, swordfish, dolphinfish and albacore must be reported before returning ashore and no later than 23:59, including released fish. Reporting of trips (\"sessions\") is suspended until 31.12.2026.":"Od 16 godina za podvodni ribolov i ribolov s plovila potrebna je aplikacija RecFishing. Plavoperajna tuna, sabljarka, lampuga i albakor prijavljuju se prije povratka na obalu i najkasnije do 23:59, uključujući puštene ribe. Prijava izlazaka („sesija“) obustavljena je do 31.12.2026.","Catch up to 5 kg per person per day, including molluscs and crustaceans. Exception: a single fish heavier than 5 kg. Any angler may take only one grouper (cernia) per day.":"Ulov do 5 kg dnevno po osobi, uključujući mekušce i rakove. Iznimka: jedna riba teža od 5 kg. Svaki ribolovac smije uzeti samo jednu kirnju (cernia) dnevno.","Spearfishing: from age 16, breath-hold only, banned from sunset to sunrise. Scuba gear and a speargun may be carried on the same boat, but fishing with scuba is banned.":"Podvodni ribolov: od 16 godina, samo na dah, zabranjen od zalaska do izlaska sunca. Autonomni aparat i puška smiju biti na istom plovilu, ali ribolov s aparatom je zabranjen.","A spearfisher needs a buoy or flag (red with a white diagonal) visible from 300 m. With a support boat the flag is on the boat and you stay within 50 m of it. The 100 m distance for boats was not found in the DPR, so check it with the Capitaneria.":"Podvodni ribolovac treba plovak ili zastavicu (crvenu s bijelom dijagonalom) vidljivu s 300 m. Uz pratnju čamca zastava je na čamcu i ne smije se udaljiti više od 50 m. Razmak plovila od 100 m nije pronađen u DPR-u, pa ga provjerite u Capitaneria.","Spearfishing distances: 500 m from beaches used by bathers; 100 m from fixed fishing gear and gill nets; 100 m from ships anchored outside ports. No spearfishing in port channels and anchorages. All anglers: at least 500 m from working professional fishers.":"Udaljenosti pri podvodnom ribolovu: 500 m od plaža na kojima se kupaju; 100 m od stalnih ribolovnih naprava i mreža stajaćica; 100 m od brodova na sidru izvan luke. Zabranjen je u lučkim prolazima i sidrištima. Svi ribolovci: najmanje 500 m od profesionalnih ribara na poslu.","Gear: up to 5 rods per angler (up to 3 hooks), correntine lines up to 6 hooks, up to 2 traps per boat. Lights are banned except a spearfishing torch and one lamp with a fish spear. Spearfishers may not take corals or molluscs.":"Pribor: do 5 štapova po ribolovcu (do 3 udice), povlačne linije correntine do 6 udica, do 2 vrše po plovilu. Svjetlo je zabranjeno, osim lampe pri podvodnom ribolovu i jedne lampe uz osti. Podvodni ribolovac ne smije uzimati korale i mekušce.","Longline: up to 100 hooks for the whole boat and only with a permit. Electric and motor winches are banned and may not be on board together with a longline. Longlines are banned for highly migratory species.":"Parangal: do 100 udica za cijelo plovilo i samo uz dozvolu. Električna i motorna vitla su zabranjena i ne smiju biti na plovilu zajedno s parangalom. Parangal je zabranjen za izrazito migratorne vrste.","Bluefin tuna and swordfish: a nulla osta permit for the boat, valid for 3 years and not issued to foreign boats. Spiny lobster and lobster are closed from 1 January to 30 April, swordfish from 1 January to 31 March.":"Plavoperajna tuna i sabljarka: dozvola nulla osta za plovilo na 3 godine, ne izdaje se stranim plovilima. Jastog i hlap su zabranjeni od 1. siječnja do 30. travnja, sabljarka od 1. siječnja do 31. ožujka.","Sources: DPR 1639/1968 (05.2022 text, arts. 87–91, 128-bis–132, 137–144), DM 45439/2024 and its amendment of 06.09.2024 (longlines), MASAF D.D. 194803 of 27.04.2026 (RecFishing), MASAF notes 0199994 and 0246328, (EU) 2019/1154 (swordfish, albacore), sizes from Annex IX of (EU) 2019/1241. That regulation does not apply all its articles to anglers, so its sizes serve here as a safe minimum. Rules differ by region and reserve; check with the Capitaneria di Porto.":"Izvori: DPR 1639/1968 (tekst 05.2022, čl. 87–91, 128-bis–132, 137–144), DM 45439/2024 i izmjena od 06.09.2024 (parangal), D.D. MASAF 194803 od 27.04.2026 (RecFishing), note MASAF 0199994 i 0246328, (EU) 2019/1154 (sabljarka, albakor), veličine iz Priloga IX (EU) 2019/1241. Ta uredba ne primjenjuje sve članove na rekreativce, pa njene veličine ovdje služe kao siguran minimum. Pravila se razlikuju po regijama i rezervatima; provjerite u Capitaneria di Porto.","Individual recreational fishing licences have been abolished, but the restrictions remain. Recreational fishing in Greek waters is allowed only from Greek-flagged vessels. Selling the catch is forbidden. Check with the port authority how anglers register under EU rules and whether the €600–3000 fines apply to them.":"Pojedinačne dozvole za rekreacijski ribolov ukinute su, ali ograničenja vrijede. Rekreacijski ribolov u grčkim vodama dopušten je samo s plovila pod grčkom zastavom. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena. Način registracije ribolovaca po pravilima EU i primjenu kazni od 600–3000 € na rekreativce provjerite u lučkoj kapetaniji.","In May, amateur longlines and spearfishing are banned, but rod fishing is allowed. Per 24 hours: up to 5 kg of fish and cephalopods (10 kg with a longline), plus one larger fish above the limit. Grouper: one in total. Species needing a special licence are excluded (bluefin and albacore tuna, swordfish, eel). Octopus: only over 750 g.":"U svibnju su amaterski parangal i podvodni ribolov zabranjeni, a štapom se smije loviti. Za 24 sata: do 5 kg ribe i glavonožaca (s parangalom do 10 kg), iznad limita jedna veća riba. Kirnja: samo jedna. Ne računaju se vrste s posebnom dozvolom (plavoperajna i dugoperajna tuna, sabljarka, jegulja). Hobotnica: samo teža od 750 g.","Sea urchins: up to 20 a day, or 30 in total from a boat, only with a fork or by free diving. Live bait (worms, limpets, hermit crabs): up to 30 of each species a day, 60 from a boat. Bait has seasonal bans and minimum sizes.":"Morski ježevi: do 20 dnevno, s plovila do 30 ukupno, samo vilicom ili ronjenjem na dah. Živi mamac (crvi, priljepci, rakovi samci): do 30 od svake vrste dnevno, s plovila do 60. Za mamce vrijede sezonske zabrane i minimalne veličine.","Banned for amateurs: all nets, trawls, purse seines and seine nets, boat dredges, longlines for migratory species, collecting sponges and corals. Lights are banned except a lamp of up to 500 candles with a hand spear. Large pelagics (bluefin tuna, swordfish) may not be fished from recreational boats.":"Zabranjeno amaterima: sve mreže, koće, plivarice i potegače, brodske dredže, parangali za migratorne vrste, sakupljanje spužvi i koralja. Svjetlo je zabranjeno, osim lampe do 500 svijeća s ručnim ostima. Velike pelagične ribe (plavoperajna tuna, sabljarka) ne smiju se loviti s rekreacijskih brodova.","Gear: longline up to 150 hooks per angler and 300 per boat; up to 2 traps per angler (mesh over 40 mm); one cast net (pezovolos, mesh over 30 mm, diameter up to 10 m), at least 500 m from river mouths and 200 m from fish farm entrances. Gear left at sea must be visible from 300 m.":"Pribor: parangal do 150 udica po ribolovcu i 300 po plovilu; do 2 vrše po ribolovcu (oko veće od 40 mm); jedna bacačka mreža (pezovolos, oko veće od 30 mm, promjer do 10 m), najmanje 500 m od ušća rijeka i 200 m od ulaza u ribogojilišta. Pribor ostavljen u moru mora biti vidljiv s 300 m.","Sources: PD 373/85 (consolidated text), the Hellenic Coast Guard size catalogue and FAQ (alieia.hcg.gr), PD 62/2024 (octopus), Law 5336/2026 (fines), (EU) 2019/1154 (swordfish, albacore), sizes from Annex IX of (EU) 2019/1241. The spiny lobster closed months come from the catalogue table. Marine parks and reserves have their own bans.":"Izvori: PD 373/85 (pročišćeni tekst), katalog veličina i FAQ grčke obalske straže (alieia.hcg.gr), PD 62/2024 (hobotnica), Zakon 5336/2026 (kazne), (EU) 2019/1154 (sabljarka, albakor), veličine iz Priloga IX (EU) 2019/1241. Mjeseci zabrane za jastoga uzeti su iz tablice kataloga. Za morske parkove i rezervate vrijede posebne zabrane.","Sources: Law 64/2012 (arts. 38–45), Instruction No. 6 of 11.04.2022, sizes from Annex III of Decision 402 of 08.05.2013. The e-Albania procedure has changed over time, check the site.":"Izvori: zakon 64/2012 (čl. 38–45), uputa br. 6 od 11.04.2022, veličine iz priloga III odluke 402 od 08.05.2013. Postupak na e-Albania se mijenjao, provjerite na stranici.","No fishing: within 200 m of marked farms, 50 m of set nets and of another angler's boat, 300 m of a vessel with lights or a purse seine, in ports and on beaches from 1 May to 30 October, or in the Portorož and Strunjan reserves.":"Zabranjen ribolov: bliže od 200 m od označenih uzgajališta, 50 m od stajaćih mreža i drugog ribolovca na plovilu, 300 m od plovila sa svjetlom ili plivaricom, u lukama i na plažama od 1. svibnja do 30. listopada, te u rezervatima Portorož i Strunjan.","Sources: Pravilnik o prostočasnem ribolovu na morju (Off. Gazette 64/2008), ZMR-2, spot.gov.si, gov.si. The rulebook refers to separate size rules whose table could not be found, so sizes from Annex IX of (EU) 2019/1241 are shown as a safe minimum.":"Izvori: Pravilnik o prostočasnem ribolovu na morju (Ur. l. RS 64/2008), ZMR-2, spot.gov.si, gov.si. Pravilnik upućuje na posebne mjere čija tablica nije pronađena, pa su prikazane veličine iz Priloga IX (EU) 2019/1241 kao siguran minimum.","Rocks, crevices and wrecks, 1–80 m":"Stijene, pukotine i olupine, 1–80 m","Fish pieces, squid, sardine, octopus":"Komadi ribe, lignja, srdela, hobotnica","Night, dusk":"Noć, sumrak","Year-round, more active in summer":"Cijele godine, ljeti aktivnija","Strong and bites. Use a steel leader. Ask a club about size limits and closures.":"Jaka je i grize. Treba čelični predvez. Veličinu i zabrane provjerite u klubu.","Rocks, caves and crevices, 5–50 m; young fish close to shore.":"Stijene, pećine i pukotine, 5–50 m, mlađ uz samu obalu.","Live baitfish, squid, octopus, heavy bottom rigs.":"Živa ribica, lignja, hobotnica, težak pridneni pribor.","Morning and evening, dusk.":"Jutro i večer, sumrak.","See the rules of the selected country.":"Pogledajte pravila odabrane zemlje.","Sand and rocks, 5–100 m, near beaches in summer. An invader from the Red Sea, most common in Greece and spreading west.":"Pijesak i kamenje, 5–100 m, ljeti uz plaže. Unesena vrsta iz Crvenog mora, najčešća u Grčkoj, širi se na zapad.","Not a target fish: it takes almost any bait and bites through lines and leaders.":"Nije ciljana riba: uzima gotovo svaki mamac i pregriza strune i predveze.","All day.":"Cijeli dan.","All year, more often in summer.":"Cijele godine, češće ljeti.","Sand and mud, 10–100 m, deeper than the striped red mullet.":"Pijesak i mulj, 10–100 m, dublje od barbuna kamenjarke.","Worms, shrimp, small pieces of mussel, a light bottom rig.":"Crvi, kozica, sitni komadi dagnje, lagani pridneni pribor.","Daytime.":"Dan.","All year, best in autumn.":"Cijele godine, najbolje u jesen.","Open sea, deep by day, near the surface at night.":"Otvoreno more, danju duboko, noću uz površinu.","Squid and fish on a drift rig, large mackerel, light sticks.":"Lignja i riba u driftu, velika skuša, svjetleće varalice.","Night.":"Noć.","Summer and early autumn; closed from January to March.":"Ljeto i početak jeseni; od siječnja do ožujka zabrana.","Open sea over deep water, schools near the surface.":"Otvoreno more nad dubinama, jata uz površinu.","Trolling, skirted lures, feathers, plugs, pieces of sardine.":"Trolling, hobotničice, perje, vobleri, komadi srdele.","June – September; closures vary by country.":"Lipanj – rujan; zabrane ovise od zemlje.","Coastal and open water, headlands and banks, schools near the surface.":"Priobalne vode i otvoreno more, rtovi i pličine, jata uz površinu.","Spoons, casting jigs, plugs, feathers, trolling.":"Varalice, kasting džigovi, vobleri, perje, trolling.","July – October.":"Srpanj – listopad.","Coastal and open water, schools near the surface.":"Priobalne vode i otvoreno more, jata uz površinu.","Small spoons, feathers, trolling, sabiki rigs.":"Sitne varalice, perje, trolling, sabiki.","Weedy rocks, 2–50 m, warm waters of the Aegean and southern Italy.":"Stijene s algama, 2–50 m, topla voda Egejskog mora i juga Italije.","Seaweed, bread paste, shrimp, pieces of mussel.":"Alge, tijesto od kruha, kozica, komadi dagnje.","May – September.":"Svibanj – rujan.","Rocks and weed near shore, harbours, 1–30 m. An invader from the Red Sea, mainly in the Aegean and further east.":"Kamenje i alge uz obalu, luke, 1–30 m. Unesena vrsta iz Crvenog mora, uglavnom u Egejskom moru i istočnije.","Seaweed, bread paste, small shrimp.":"Alge, tijesto od kruha, sitna kozica.","Summer and autumn.":"Ljeto i jesen.","Sand and rocks, 30–100 m, sometimes closer to shore.":"Pijesak i kamenje, 30–100 m, ponekad bliže obali.","Worms, squid, sardine, shrimp, bottom rig from a boat.":"Crvi, lignja, srdela, kozica, pridneni pribor s plovila.","Autumn, but it bites all year.":"Jesen, ali grize cijele godine.","Deep water over rocks and drop-offs, 100–400 m; young fish closer to shore.":"Duboka voda nad kamenjem i padinama, 100–400 m, mlađ bliže obali.","Squid, sardine, deep-water rig from a boat.":"Lignja, srdela, dubinski pribor s plovila.","Daytime, better when overcast.":"Dan, po oblačnom vremenu bolje.","Autumn and winter.":"Jesen i zima.","Shore, headlands, river mouths and surf, wherever mullet and sardines school.":"Obala, rtovi, ušća i prasak, uz jata cipla i srdela.","Live mullet or horse mackerel, large plugs, surface lures.":"Živi cipal ili šnjur, veliki vobleri, površinske varalice.","Deep rocks and wrecks, 100–600 m. Young fish shelter under floating objects.":"Duboke stijene i olupine, 100–600 m. Mlađ se drži ispod plutajućih predmeta.","Whole squid, large fish, deep-water rig from a boat.":"Cijela lignja, velika riba, dubinski pribor s plovila.","All year, in calm weather.":"Cijele godine, po mirnom vremenu.","Weed, sand and rocks, 15–100 m, large schools.":"Alge, pijesak i kamenje, 15–100 m, velika jata.","Sabiki with small hooks, worms, pieces of shrimp, groundbait.":"Sabiki sa sitnim udicama, crvi, komadi kozice, primama.","Daytime, best in the morning.":"Dan, najbolje ujutro.","All year, best in spring and autumn.":"Cijele godine, najbolje u proljeće i jesen.","A predator of rocky coasts: by day it hides in crevices, often with only its head showing. At night it comes out to hunt fish, squid and octopus. Divers meet it often, and it regularly takes bottom rigs near rocks. Usually 60–100 cm, up to 1.5 m.":"Grabljivica stjenovitih obala: danju se skriva u pukotinama, a često joj se vidi samo glava. Noću izlazi loviti ribu, lignje i hobotnice. Ronioci je često susreću, a redovito se hvata na pridneni pribor uz stijene. Obično 60–100 cm, do 1,5 m.","Grilled moray with garlic and lemon":"Murina na gradelama s češnjakom i limunom","moray pieces 600 g, olive oil, garlic, lemon, parsley, salt":"komadi murine 600 g, maslinovo ulje, češnjak, limun, peršin, sol","Skin and rinse the fish and cut it into 4–5 cm pieces.":"Skinite kožu, isperite ribu i narežite je na komade od 4–5 cm.","Marinate in oil with garlic and salt for 20 minutes.":"Marinirajte u ulju s češnjakom i solju 20 minuta.","Grill 6–8 minutes per side until cooked right through.":"Pecite na gradelama po 6–8 minuta sa svake strane dok meso potpuno ne bude pečeno.","Moray in tomato sauce (brodet)":"Brodet od murine","moray 800 g in pieces, tomatoes 400 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley, salt":"murina 800 g u komadima, rajčice 400 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin, sol","Skin and rinse the fish, cut it into pieces and salt it.":"Skinite kožu, isperite ribu, narežite je na komade i posolite.","Sauté onion and garlic, add tomatoes and wine and simmer 15 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak, dodajte rajčice i vino i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Add the moray and cook covered for 30 minutes until cooked right through.":"Dodajte murinu i kuhajte poklopljeno 30 minuta dok meso potpuno ne bude kuhano.","Sprinkle with parsley and serve with polenta or bread.":"Pospite peršinom i poslužite s palentom ili kruhom.","Sharp teeth; the bite is deep and often gets infected, so wash the wound and see a doctor. Keep your hands away from the head; unhook with pliers or cut the leader. Raw moray blood is toxic: keep it out of wounds and eyes. Eat the meat only when well cooked.":"Oštri zubi, ugriz je dubok i često se upali: isperite ranu i obratite se liječniku. Ne približavajte ruke glavi, skidajte kliještima ili presijecite predvez. Sirova krv murine je otrovna: pazite da ne dospije u ranu ili oči. Meso jedite samo dobro pripremljeno.","A large, sedentary predator that keeps to its den for years and grows slowly, so it is easily overfished. It hunts fish, octopus and crabs. Usually 3–10 kg, sometimes over a metre. Lift a hooked fish quickly or it will run back into its den.":"Velika stalna grabljivica, godinama živi u svojoj rupi i sporo raste, pa lako strada od prekomjernog izlova. Lovi ribu, hobotnice i rakove. Obično 3–10 kg, ponekad preko metra. Ulovljenu ribu brzo izvucite, inače će se vratiti u rupu.","Baked grouper with potatoes":"Pečena kernja s krumpirom","fish 1.2 kg, potatoes 800 g, 2 tomatoes, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley, salt":"riba 1,2 kg, krumpir 800 g, 2 rajčice, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin, sol","Slice the potatoes, onion and tomatoes, toss with oil and salt and bake for 25 minutes at 200 °C.":"Narežite krumpir, luk i rajčice, pomiješajte s uljem i solju i pecite 25 minuta na 200 °C.","Clean and salt the fish, put garlic and parsley in the belly, lay it on the vegetables and pour in the wine.":"Očistite i posolite ribu, u trbuh stavite češnjak i peršin, položite je na povrće i ulijte vino.","Bake for another 20–25 minutes until the flesh comes away easily from the bone.":"Pecite još 20–25 minuta, dok se meso lako ne odvaja od kosti.","Grouper in tomato sauce (brodet)":"Brodet od kernje","fish 1 kg in pieces, tomatoes 500 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley, salt, polenta or bread":"riba 1 kg u komadima, rajčice 500 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin, sol, palenta ili kruh","Fry the onion and garlic in oil for 5 minutes.":"Popržite luk i češnjak na ulju 5 minuta.","Add the tomatoes and wine and simmer for 15 minutes.":"Dodajte rajčice i vino i kuhajte 15 minuta.","Salt the fish, add it to the sauce and cook covered for 15–20 minutes without stirring. Sprinkle with parsley and serve with polenta or bread.":"Posolite ribu, stavite je u umak i kuhajte poklopljeno 15–20 minuta bez miješanja. Pospite peršinom i poslužite s palentom ili kruhom.","A silver stripe along the side and dark spots on the back. Very strong plate-like teeth: it cuts gear, and swimmers have been bitten in Greece. It is easy to confuse with harmless fish, so do not keep an unknown fish that puffs up. Usually 30–50 cm, up to 85 cm.":"Srebrna pruga na boku i tamne pjege na leđima. Vrlo jaki pločasti zubi: reže pribor, a u Grčkoj je bilo ugriza kupača. Lako se zamijeni s bezopasnim ribama, pa nepoznatu ribu koja se napuhuje ne uzimajte. Obično 30–50 cm, do 85 cm.","A strong bite: do not hold it by hand, unhook with pliers or cut the leader. Release it with care and do not leave it on the shore where animals could eat it.":"Jak ugriz: ne držite ribu rukama, skidajte kliještima ili presijecite predvez. Pustite je oprezno i ne ostavljajte na obali gdje je životinje mogu pojesti.","DO NOT EAT. The flesh and organs contain tetrodotoxin, which cooking does not destroy and which can kill. If your lips go numb or you feel sick or weak after eating, call 112 at once.":"NE JESTI. Meso i utroba sadrže tetrodotoksin, koji se kuhanjem i prženjem ne uništava i može ubiti. Ako nakon jela utrnu usne ili osjetite mučninu ili slabost, odmah zovite 112.","A schooling bottom fish that searches the mud with its barbels. Unlike the striped red mullet it has a steep forehead and no dark stripe on the first dorsal fin. Usually 12–20 cm.":"Jatna pridnena riba, brčićima traži hranu u mulju. Od kamenjarke se razlikuje strmim čelom i time što nema tamnu prugu na prvoj leđnoj peraji. Obično 12–20 cm.","Fried red mullet":"Pržene trlje blatarice","small fish 700 g, flour, olive oil for frying, lemon, salt":"sitna riba 700 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje za prženje, limun, sol","Clean, rinse and dry the fish and salt it.":"Očistite ribu, isperite, osušite i posolite.","Dust with flour and shake off the excess.":"Uvaljajte u brašno i otresite višak.","Fry in hot oil for 2–4 minutes per side and serve with lemon.":"Pržite na vrelom ulju po 2–4 minute sa svake strane i poslužite s limunom.","Red mullet baked with lemon and parsley":"Trlje pečene s limunom i peršinom","fish 800 g, 2 lemons, parsley, garlic, breadcrumbs, olive oil, salt":"riba 800 g, 2 limuna, peršin, češnjak, krušne mrvice, maslinovo ulje, sol","Clean and salt the fish and lay it in an oiled dish on slices of one lemon.":"Očistite i posolite ribu i položite je u nauljenu posudu na kriške jednog limuna.","Mix the breadcrumbs with chopped parsley and garlic, sprinkle over the fish and drizzle with oil and the juice of the second lemon.":"Pomiješajte krušne mrvice sa sjeckanim peršinom i češnjakom, pospite ribu i prelijte uljem i sokom drugog limuna.","Bake for 15–20 minutes at 200 °C until the flesh turns opaque.":"Pecite 15–20 minuta na 200 °C, dok meso ne postane neprozirno.","A fast ocean predator with a long flat bill that rises at night to feed on squid and fish. It takes a seaworthy boat and strong gear. Usually 20–80 kg. The rules are strict and vary by country, so check them before going out.":"Brza oceanska grabljivica s dugim plosnatim mačem, noću se diže za lignjama i ribom. Za ribolov treba pomorski sposoban čamac i jak pribor. Obično 20–80 kg. Pravila su stroga i ovise od zemlje, pa ih provjerite prije izlaska.","Grilled swordfish with lemon and oregano":"Sabljarka na žaru s limunom i origanom","fish 800 g (whole or steaks), olive oil, lemon, oregano, garlic, salt":"riba 800 g (cijela ili odresci), maslinovo ulje, limun, origano, češnjak, sol","Clean the fish and marinate it in oil, lemon juice, garlic and oregano for 15 minutes.":"Očistite ribu i marinirajte je u ulju, soku limuna, češnjaku i origanu 15 minuta.","Grill over high heat until cooked: steaks 3–4 minutes per side, a whole fish 6–8 minutes per side.":"Pecite na vrelom roštilju dok ne bude gotovo: odreske po 3–4 minute sa svake strane, cijelu ribu po 6–8 minuta.","Salt, dress with lemon juice and oil and serve at once.":"Posolite, prelijte sokom limuna s uljem i odmah poslužite.","Swordfish with tomatoes and capers":"Sabljarka s rajčicama i kaparima","fish steaks or fillets 700 g, cherry tomatoes 300 g, 1 tbsp capers, olives, garlic, olive oil, oregano, salt":"odresci ili fileti ribe 700 g, čeri rajčice 300 g, 1 žlica kapara, masline, češnjak, maslinovo ulje, origano, sol","Salt the fish and sear it over high heat for 2 minutes per side, then set it aside on a plate.":"Posolite ribu i pržite na jakoj vatri po 2 minute sa svake strane, pa je izvadite na tanjur.","In the same pan cook the garlic, tomatoes, capers and olives for 8 minutes.":"U istoj tavi pirjajte češnjak, rajčice, kapare i masline 8 minuta.","Return the fish, heat for 3–4 minutes until cooked through and sprinkle with oregano.":"Vratite ribu, zagrijavajte 3–4 minute dok ne bude gotova i pospite origanom.","The bill is dangerous on board too: do not bring a large fish into the boat alive and stay clear of its head.":"Mač je opasan i na plovilu: veliku ribu ne dižite živu u čamac i držite se dalje od glave.","A smaller tuna with very long pectoral fins that keeps to cool water below the thermocline and rises to the surface in schools. It hunts sardines and squid at speed. Usually 3–10 kg. The pale meat is prized, so ice it at once.":"Manja tuna s vrlo dugim prsnim perajama, drži se hladnije vode ispod termokline i u jatima izlazi na površinu. Brzo lovi sardine i lignje. Obično 3–10 kg. Svijetlo meso je cijenjeno, odmah ga stavite na led.","Albacore steak in sesame":"Odrezak albakora u susamu","fish steaks 500 g, salt, black pepper, sesame seeds, lemon, olive oil, green salad":"odresci ribe 500 g, sol, crni papar, susam, limun, maslinovo ulje, zelena salata","Season the steaks with salt and pepper, brush with oil and coat with sesame.":"Posolite i popaprite odreske, premažite uljem i uvaljajte u susam.","Fry in a very hot pan for 3–4 minutes per side until cooked through.":"Pržite na vrlo vreloj tavi po 3–4 minute sa svake strane dok se meso ne ispeče.","Rest for 2 minutes, dress with lemon juice and serve with salad.":"Ostavite 2 minute, prelijte sokom limuna i poslužite sa salatom.","Albacore with tomatoes and capers":"Albakor s rajčicama i kaparima","A fast schooling fish with wavy stripes on the back and dark spots below the pectoral fin. It chases baitfish at the surface and comes close to shore, so it can be caught spinning from rocks. A hard fighter. Usually 2–5 kg. The meat is dark, so bleed it and ice it at once.":"Brza jatna riba s valovitim prugama na leđima i tamnim pjegama ispod prsne peraje. Goni sitnu ribu uz površinu i prilazi obali, pa se lovi i varalicom sa stijena. Jako se bori. Obično 2–5 kg. Meso je tamno, odmah ga iskrvarite i stavite na led.","Grilled little tunny with oregano":"Luc na žaru s origanom","Little tunny with tomatoes and capers":"Luc s rajčicama i kaparima","The smallest of the tunas, with a rounded body and dark oblique bars on the rear of the back. Dense schools chase baitfish and give themselves away by splashes. Usually 25–40 cm. The dark meat spoils quickly.":"Najsitnija od tuna: okruglo tijelo i tamne kose pruge na stražnjem dijelu leđa. Gusta jata gone sitnu ribu i odaju ih prskanja. Obično 25–40 cm. Tamno meso se brzo kvari.","Grilled bullet tuna with lemon":"Trupac na žaru s limunom","Bullet tuna with tomatoes and capers":"Trupac s rajčicama i kaparima","The only parrotfish of the Mediterranean: its teeth form a beak used to scrape algae off rocks. Females are bright red with a yellow spot, males grey. Active by day, it sleeps in crevices at night. Usually 20–35 cm. Prized for the table in Greece.":"Jedina papiga Sredozemlja: zubi su srasli u kljun kojim struže alge s kamenja. Ženke su jarkocrvene sa žutom mrljom, mužjaci sivi. Aktivna je danju, noću spava u pukotinama. Obično 20–35 cm. U Grčkoj je cijenjena na stolu.","Grilled parrotfish with lemon and oil":"Papigača na žaru s limunom i uljem","Parrotfish baked with potatoes":"Papigača pečena s krumpirom","A schooling herbivore that grazes algae off rocks, much like the salema. It has become abundant in the eastern Mediterranean. Usually 15–25 cm. Edible, but handle it with care.":"Jatna biljojeda riba, brsti alge s kamenja, slično salpi. Masovno se namnožila na istoku Sredozemlja. Obično 15–25 cm. Jestiva je, ali s njom postupajte oprezno.","Grilled spinefoot with lemon":"Mramornica na žaru s limunom","Wearing gloves, cut off all fins with venomous spines using scissors, then gut the fish.":"U rukavicama škarama odrežite sva peraja s otrovnim bodljama, pa očistite utrobu.","Fried spinefoot":"Pržena mramornica","Venomous spines on the dorsal, pelvic and anal fins: handle with thick gloves. If stung, keep the wound in hot (40–45 °C) water and see a doctor if the pain is severe.":"Otrovne bodlje na leđnoj, trbušnim i analnoj peraji: uzimajte je debelim rukavicama. Kod uboda držite ranu u vrućoj (40–45 °C) vodi, a pri jakom bolu obratite se liječniku.","A pinkish schooling fish resembling the common pandora. It differs by a dark spot at the base of the pectoral fin and an orange mouth. It stays near the bottom and feeds on worms and small crustaceans. Usually 15–25 cm.":"Ružičasta jatna riba, slična arbunu. Razlikuje se po tamnoj mrlji u osnovi prsne peraje i narančastim ustima. Drži se dna i hrani se crvima i račićima. Obično 15–25 cm.","Grilled axillary seabream":"Batoglavac na žaru","Axillary seabream baked with lemon":"Batoglavac pečen s limunom","A large pink seabream with big eyes and a black spot at the start of the lateral line. It lives deep and grows slowly. Usually 30–50 cm. Highly prized, so the size limit is taken seriously.":"Velika ružičasta ljuskavka s krupnim očima i crnom mrljom na početku bočne linije. Živi duboko i sporo raste. Obično 30–50 cm. Vrlo je cijenjena, pa se veličina strogo poštuje.","Blackspot seabream baked with potatoes":"Okan pečen s krumpirom","Grilled blackspot seabream with lemon and oregano":"Okan na žaru s limunom i origanom","A powerful coastal predator with a wavy lateral line that chases mullet right along the shore and often enters river mouths. A spinning trophy that fights long and hard. Usually 3–10 kg, sometimes over 20 kg.":"Snažna priobalna grabljivica s vijugavom bočnom linijom, goni ciple uz samu obalu i često ulazi u ušća. Trofej za varaličarenje, dugo se i jako bori. Obično 3–10 kg, ponekad preko 20 kg.","Grilled leerfish steaks":"Odresci lice na žaru","Leerfish in tomato sauce (brodet)":"Brodet od lice","A large deep-water fish with a massive head that lives around rocks and wrecks. It grows slowly and lives long, which makes it vulnerable. Usually 5–30 kg, sometimes much more. Lifting it from great depth takes a seaworthy boat and strong gear.":"Velika dubinska riba s masivnom glavom, živi uz stijene i olupine. Sporo raste i dugo živi, pa je ranjiva. Obično 5–30 kg, ponekad mnogo više. Za izvlačenje s velike dubine trebaju pomorski sposoban čamac i jak pribor.","Wreckfish baked with potatoes":"Kernja glavulja pečena s krumpirom","Wreckfish in tomato sauce (brodet)":"Brodet od kernje glavulje","A small schooling fish with an elongated body and a dark spot on the side. A frequent catch from shore and boat, especially in Greece. Males turn colourful in spring. Usually 10–15 cm, up to 20 cm.":"Sitna jatna riba izduženog tijela s tamnom mrljom na boku. Čest ulov s obale i s plovila, posebno u Grčkoj. Mužjaci u proljeće postaju šareni. Obično 10–15 cm, do 20 cm.","Fried picarel":"Pržena gira","Picarel in vinegar marinade (savor)":"Gira na savor","small fish 800 g, flour, olive oil, wine vinegar 100 ml, water 100 ml, garlic, rosemary, raisins, salt":"sitna riba 800 g, brašno, maslinovo ulje, vinski ocat 100 ml, voda 100 ml, češnjak, ruzmarin, suho grožđe, sol","Clean and salt the fish, dust with flour and fry in oil until golden. Put it in a bowl.":"Očistite i posolite ribu, uvaljajte u brašno i pržite na ulju do korice. Stavite je u činiju.","In the same pan warm the garlic and rosemary, add 1 tsp flour, the vinegar, water and raisins and simmer for 3 minutes.":"U istoj tavi zagrijte češnjak i ruzmarin, dodajte 1 žličicu brašna, ocat, vodu i suho grožđe i kuhajte 3 minute.","Pour the hot sauce over the fish, let it cool and refrigerate for a few hours. Serve cold.":"Prelijte ribu vrelim umakom, ohladite i stavite u hladnjak na nekoliko sati. Poslužite hladno.","Banned for anglers: release it alive; report a dead fish to the port authority.":"Zabranjeno: živu pustiti, a uginulu prijaviti lučkoj kapetaniji.","Banned for anglers, except trophy fishing under a special permit. Otherwise release it.":"Zabranjeno, osim trofejnog ribolova uz posebnu dozvolu. Inače pustiti.","Requires a daily big game permit and a vessel with AIS. Spearfishing for tuna is banned.":"Potrebna je dnevna big game dozvola i plovilo s AIS-om. Podvodni ribolov tune je zabranjen.","Recreational fishing for it is banned: release any accidental catch.":"Rekreativni ribolov je zabranjen: slučajan ulov pustiti.","Sharks and rays may not be kept: the limit is 0, release them alive.":"Morski psi i raže se ne smiju zadržati: limit je 0, pustite ih žive.","Special regime: a permit and quota are required. Without them, release it.":"Poseban režim: potrebne su dozvola i kvota. Bez njih pustiti.","Many sharks are protected: release them alive and check the status of the species.":"Mnogi morski psi su zaštićeni: pustite ih žive i provjerite status vrste.","The published order says 5 cm, which looks like a misprint. The size used in neighbouring rules is shown.":"U objavljenoj naredbi piše 5 cm, što nalikuje na tiskarsku pogrešku. Prikazana je veličina iz susjednih propisa.","No more than 2 per day.":"Najviše 2 dnevno.","Fishing with a light is banned from 1 March to 30 September.":"Ribolov sa svjetlom je zabranjen od 1. ožujka do 30. rujna.","The regulations checked give no minimum size for this species. That does not mean there are no limits: check locally.":"U provjerenim propisima minimalna veličina za ovu vrstu nije navedena. To ne znači da ograničenja nema: provjerite na licu mjesta.","The size in mm is carapace length. Release egg-bearing females at any size.":"Veličina u mm je dužina oklopa. Ženke s jajima pustiti bez obzira na veličinu.","Protected by law: release alive and record the accidental catch.":"Zaštićeno zakonom: žive pustiti, a slučajan ulov evidentirati.","No more than one grouper per day.":"Najviše jedna kirnja dnevno.","Special regime, a special licence is required. It may not be fished from recreational boats.":"Poseban režim, potrebna je posebna dozvola. Ne smije se loviti s rekreacijskih plovila.","Special regime: a nulla osta permit for the boat is required, valid for 3 years and not issued to foreign boats. Report the catch in RecFishing.":"Poseban režim: potrebna je dozvola nulla osta za plovilo na 3 godine, ne izdaje se stranim plovilima. Ulov prijaviti u RecFishing.","From a boat or when spearfishing, report the catch in RecFishing.":"S plovila i pri podvodnom ribolovu ulov prijaviti u RecFishing.","The regulations checked give no size. From a boat or when spearfishing, report the catch in RecFishing.":"U provjerenim propisima veličina nije navedena. S plovila i pri podvodnom ribolovu ulov prijaviti u RecFishing.","Spain":"Španjolska","Turkey":"Turska","Mediterranean Sea and Atlantic Ocean":"Sredozemno more i Atlantski ocean","Black, Marmara, Aegean and Mediterranean seas":"Crno, Mramorno, Egejsko i Sredozemno more","Catalonia":"Katalonija","Balearic Islands":"Balearski otoci","Valencia":"Valencija","Murcia":"Murcija","Andalusia (Mediterranean)":"Andaluzija (Sredozemlje)","Andalusia (Gulf of Cádiz)":"Andaluzija (Kadiški zaljev)","Galicia":"Galicija","Asturias":"Asturija","Cantabria":"Kantabrija","Basque Country":"Baskija","Put the cleaned fish on top with garlic and paprika and pour in the wine.":"Odozgo stavite očišćenu ribu s češnjakom i paprikom i ulijte vino.","fillets 600 g, flour 150 g, cold sparkling water 200 ml, oil for frying, lemon, salt":"fileti 600 g, brašno 150 g, hladna gazirana voda 200 ml, ulje za prženje, limun, sol","May – October; in Turkey closed 1 June – 31 August.":"Svibanj – listopad; u Turskoj zabrana 1. lipnja – 31. kolovoza.","Morning, evening and night.":"Jutro, večer i noć.","Sandy and gravel bottoms near the shore and river mouths; in the Black Sea at 20–70 m.":"Pjeskovito i šljunkovito dno uz obalu, ušća; u Crnom moru na 20–70 m.","Sandy and muddy bottoms with rocks at 20–200 m, in southern Spain and Turkey.":"Pjeskovito i muljevito dno sa stijenama na 20–200 m, na jugu Španjolske i Turske.","A large wrasse with thick lips and mottled colours from green to orange. It stays in one spot all its life, feeds on shellfish and crabs and dives into the rocks as soon as it bites. All fish are born female and big ones turn male. It grows slowly, so release small ones.":"Velika usnača debelih usana i šarene boje od zelene do riđe. Cijeli život živi na istom mjestu, hrani se školjkama i rakovima, a nakon zagriza odmah bježi u kamenje. Sve ribe rađaju se kao ženke, velike postaju mužjaci. Raste sporo, male je bolje pustiti.","No more than 7 per licence per day.":"Najviše 7 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Pollack in batter":"Pollack u tijestu","Murcia (Decreto 72/2016): shore licence (from 14, 3 years, unlimited after 65), boat licence (2 years, up to 5 people), spearfishing (from 18, medical certificate and insurance, 1 year). Foreigners without an NIE apply with a passport.":"Murcia (Decreto 72/2016): dozvola s obale (od 14 godina, 3 godine, nakon 65 trajna), za brod (2 godine, do 5 osoba), podvodna (od 18 godina, liječnička potvrda i osiguranje, 1 godina). Stranci bez NIE-a dobivaju je uz putovnicu.","Gear from a boat: rods, handlines, trolling, squid jigs; no more than 2 electric reels per boat with up to 300 W in total. Nets, longlines, traps, lights and any fish attractor other than groundbait are banned. Anglers may not take crustaceans, bivalves or sea snails.":"Alat s broda: štapovi, ručni povrazi, panula, poteze za glavonošce; najviše 2 električna vitla po brodu, ukupno do 300 W. Zabranjene su mreže, parangali, vrše, svjetlo i svaki mamac za privlačenje ribe osim primame. Rakove, školjkaše i puževe rekreativci ne smiju loviti.","No more than 15 per licence per day.":"Najviše 15 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","No more than 10 per licence per day.":"Najviše 10 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Crab, prawn, mussel, worm; small weedless soft lures.":"Rak, kozica, dagnja, crv; mali silikonski mamci bez zapinjanja.","Roll in flour and fry in hot oil for 3 minutes per side.":"Uvaljajte u brašno i pržite na vrućem ulju po 3 minute sa svake strane.","Important: this is a summary, not legal advice. The rules apply from 1 September 2024 to 31 August 2028 and are changed by amendments. Before fishing, check them with the agriculture directorate (il/ilçe müdürlüğü) or on the ministry website.":"Važno: ovo je sažetak, a ne pravni savjet. Pravila vrijede od 1. rujna 2024. do 31. kolovoza 2028. i mijenjaju se izmjenama. Prije ribolova provjerite ih u upravi za poljoprivredu (il/ilçe müdürlüğü) ili na stranici ministarstva.","Add the salted fish and cook covered for 15–20 minutes, then sprinkle with parsley.":"Stavite posoljenu ribu i dinstajte poklopljeno 15–20 minuta, pospite peršinom.","Night and dusk, murky water after rough seas.":"Noć i sumrak, mutna voda nakon valova.","No more than 3 a day. Closed season: Menorca May–June, Mallorca June–July, Ibiza and Formentera 15.07–15.10.":"Najviše 3 komada dnevno. Zabrana: Menorca svibanj–lipanj, Mallorca lipanj–srpanj, Ibiza i Formentera 15.07–15.10.","Catch: up to 5 kg per licence per day, the weight of one last fish does not count. From a boat with more than 5 licences, no more than 25 kg per boat. Many regions add their own per-species bag limits.":"Ulov: do 5 kg po dozvoli dnevno, težina jedne, posljednje ribe ne mora se brojati. S broda s više od 5 dozvola najviše 25 kg po brodu. Mnoge regije uvode vlastita ograničenja broja komada po vrsti.","Baked wrasse with potatoes":"Usnača iz pećnice s krumpirom","Spearfishing: daytime only, breath-hold, no torch or tanks, with a buoy marking your position. Since 1 January 2026 it requires a document from the agriculture directorate. Diving with a speargun is banned in ports and boat shelters.":"Podvodni ribolov: samo danju, na dah, bez svjetiljke i boca, s plutačom koja označava mjesto. Od 1. siječnja 2026. za njega je potreban dokument uprave za poljoprivredu. U lukama i skloništima za brodove ne smije se roniti s puškom.","fish 1 kg, potatoes 600 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, paprika, salt":"riba 1 kg, krumpir 600 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, paprika, sol","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. No more than 1 per person per day, 1 per boat.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Najviše 1 komad dnevno po osobi, 1 po brodu.","Spring and autumn; in Turkey closed 15 April – 15 June.":"Proljeće i jesen; u Turskoj zabrana 15. travnja – 15. lipnja.","Spearfishing: from age 16, breath-hold only (scuba and breathing apparatus on board are banned), daylight only, with a yellow buoy with a red diagonal flag marked “Υ.Δ.” visible from 300 m, stay within 50 m of the buoy or boat. Keep at least 200 m from swimmers, ports, vessels (including anchored ones) and nets. Do not take fish under 150 g or fish from other people's gear, load the gun out of the water, use underwater lights or nets, or fish in shipping passages.":"Podvodni ribolov: od 16 godina, samo na dah (ronilački i dišni aparati na brodu su zabranjeni), samo danju, sa žutom plutačom s crvenom dijagonalnom zastavicom i slovima «Υ.Δ.», vidljivom s 300 m, držati se unutar 50 m od plutače ili broda. Najmanje 200 m od kupača, luka, brodova (i usidrenih) i mreža. Ne uzimati ribu lakšu od 150 g ni ribu iz tuđeg alata, ne puniti pušku izvan vode, ne koristiti podvodno svjetlo ni mreže, ne loviti u plovnim prolazima.","May – October.":"Svibanj – listopad.","In Catalonia sharks and rays are banned for anglers: release it.":"U Kataloniji su morski psi i raže zabranjeni rekreativcima: pustiti.","Catch: 5 kg plus one fish per person, at most 25 kg from a boat. Daily bag (per person / per boat): sea bass 1/1, gilthead 2/2, dentex 2/3, groupers 1/1, octopus 3 (from 1 kg), squid and cuttlefish up to 10. Valuable species must be marked by clipping the lower tail lobe. No crustaceans.":"Ulov: 5 kg plus jedna riba po osobi, s broda najviše 25 kg. Komada dnevno (po osobi / po brodu): lubin 1/1, orada 2/2, zubatac 2/3, kirnje 1/1, hobotnica 3 (od 1 kg), lignje i sipe do 10. Ribe vrijednih vrsta označiti rezom donjeg režnja repa. Rakove ne.","fish 1 kg, olive oil, lemon, garlic, rosemary, salt":"riba 1 kg, maslinovo ulje, limun, češnjak, ružmarin, sol","Grouper stewed with tomatoes":"Kirnja dinstana s rajčicama","Sandy and muddy bottoms at 10–100 m; in the Black Sea close to shore in winter.":"Pjeskovito i muljevito dno na 10–100 m; u Crnom moru zimi tik uz obalu.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h.","Pieces of fish or squid, prawn, worm; a feather rig.":"Komadići ribe ili lignje, kozica, crv; svićarica s šarenim perjem.","At the end add chopped garlic and parsley and squeeze over lemon juice.":"Na kraju dodajte sjeckani češnjak i peršin i prelijte limunovim sokom.","Sea bass: east of Santa Clara island (San Sebastián) from 44 cm and 1 a day, west of it from 42 cm within the 5 kg (Reg. EU 2019/1241, 2024/257, RD 664/2023).":"Lubin: istočno od otoka Santa Clara (San Sebastián) od 44 cm i 1 komad dnevno, zapadno od 42 cm u okviru 5 kg (Reg. EU 2019/1241, 2024/257, RD 664/2023).","Up to 6 hooks or 2 squid jigs per licence, 2 rods from the shore. Octopus only with a separate temporary authorisation, 1 a day; spearfishers may not take cephalopods. Boat: 200 m from fishing vessels, 300 m during trawling and purse seining, 500 m during tuna fishing. Spearfishing: 100 m from beaches, 250 m from May to October.":"Do 6 udica ili 2 poteze po dozvoli, s obale 2 štapa. Hobotnica samo uz posebnu privremenu dozvolu, 1 komad dnevno; podvodni ribolovci ne smiju uzimati glavonošce. Brod: 200 m od ribarskih brodova, 300 m pri koćarenju i lovu plivaricom, 500 m pri lovu tune. Podvodni ribolov: 100 m od plaža, od svibnja do listopada 250 m.","Where not: in ports and navigation channels, within 100 m of beaches with swimmers, in marine reserves without a separate permit. Keep a boat at least 200–300 m from fishing vessels and their gear.":"Gdje ne: u lukama i plovnim kanalima, bliže od 100 m plažama s kupačima, u morskim rezervatima (reservas marinas) bez posebne dozvole. Brod se drži najmanje 200–300 m od ribarskih brodova i njihova alata.","A horse mackerel with bony scutes along the whole lateral line; it differs from the Atlantic horse mackerel by a higher line of scutes. The main Black Sea fish for shore fishing with sabiki rigs. Usually 15–30 cm.":"Šarun s koštanim pločicama duž cijele bočne pruge; od atlantskog šaruna razlikuje se višim nizom pločica. Glavna riba za lov svićaricom s obale u Crnom moru. Obično 15–30 cm.","Cut the fillets into pieces and salt them.":"Narežite filete na komade i posolite.","Grilled mullet":"Cipal na žaru","Catch per licence per day: 10 kg of fish, 5 kg of cephalopods, 150 sea urchins. No crustaceans or bivalves. Sharks and rays are banned, bluefin tuna only catch and release. 2 rods from the shore; from a boat and spearfishing from sunrise to sunset, from the shore around the clock.":"Ulov po dozvoli dnevno: 10 kg ribe, 5 kg glavonožaca, 150 ježinaca. Rakove i školjkaše ne. Morski psi i raže su zabranjeni, plavoperajnu tunu samo uloviti i pustiti. S obale 2 štapa; s broda i podvodni ribolov od izlaska do zalaska sunca, s obale danonoćno.","Night and dusk, especially after a storm.":"Noć i sumrak, osobito nakon nevremena.","Dip the fish in the batter and fry in hot oil for 4–5 minutes until golden. Serve with lemon.":"Umočite ribu u tijesto i pržite na vrućem ulju 4–5 minuta dok ne porumeni. Poslužite s limunom.","Mix the salt with the egg whites, spread a layer on a tray, lay the fish on it and cover with the rest of the salt.":"Pomiješajte sol s bjelanjcima, stavite sloj na lim, na njega ribu i prekrijte ostatkom soli.","Squid and cuttlefish together: no more than 10 a day.":"Lignje i sipe zajedno: najviše 10 dnevno.","the Spanish Ministry of Agriculture, Fisheries and Food (MAPA) and the regional governments":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede, ribarstva i hrane Španjolske (MAPA) i vlade autonomnih zajednica","Live or fresh small fish (sprat, whiting, sand eel), squid strips on a bottom rig.":"Živa ili svježa sitna riba (papalina, pišmolj, hujica), trake lignje na pridnenom priboru.","Closed season: Girona and Tarragona 01.07–31.08, Barcelona 01.08–30.09.":"Zabrana: Girona i Tarragona 01.07–31.08, Barcelona 01.08–30.09.","Live bait: no more than 30 fish up to 12 cm long, only from the list (sprat, blenny, bleak, horse mackerel, picarel, sand smelt, sardine and others), with a bait net or a rod.":"Živi mamac: najviše 30 riba duljine do 12 cm, samo s popisa (papalina, slingurica, uklija, šarun, gira, gavun, srdela i dr.), mrežicom za mamac ili štapom.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. No more than 1 per licence per day, up to 4 per boat.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Najviše 1 komad dnevno po dozvoli, do 4 po brodu.","Harbours, breakwaters, river mouths, lagoons, near outfalls and fish farms.":"Luke, lukobrani, ušća, lagune, kod ispusta i ribogojilišta.","fish 1.5 kg, cornmeal 100 g, oil for frying, lemon, rocket, salt":"riba 1,5 kg, kukuruzno brašno 100 g, ulje za prženje, limun, rikola, sol","Bluefin tuna: only with a MAPA boat authorisation, mostly catch and release; report catches and releases in the app. Without an authorisation, release it.":"Plavoperajna tuna: samo uz MAPA dozvolu za brod, uglavnom «ulovi i pusti»; ulov i puštanje prijaviti u aplikaciji. Bez dozvole pustiti.","No more than 6 per licence per day.":"Najviše 6 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","No more than 1 per day. Length is measured to the fork of the tail.":"Najviše 1 komad dnevno. Duljina se mjeri do račve repa.","Daytime, best on the flood tide.":"Danju, najbolje za plime.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): bluefin tuna, albacore, bigeye, swordfish, marlins, spearfish, sailfish, hake, blackspot seabream, sea bass, cod, pollack, sole, dolphinfish. To keep them on board in outer waters you need a boat authorisation in the MAPA app. Catches and releases of these species must be reported in it within 24 hours wherever they are caught (RD 214/2026).":"Poseban režim (prilog II RD 347/2011): plavoperajna tuna, dugoperajna tuna, tuna okan, iglan, marlini, igličani, jedrilica, oslić, okan, lubin, bakalar, pollack, list, lampuga. Da biste ih zadržali na brodu na otvorenom moru, potrebna je dozvola za brod u aplikaciji MAPA. Ulov i puštanje tih vrsta prijavljuju se u njoj u roku od 24 sata, gdje god su ulovljene (RD 214/2026).","No more than 2 per licence per day.":"Najviše 2 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Steamed shi drum with vegetables":"Grb na pari s povrćem","A large silvery drum with a golden mouth. When spawning it drums loudly with its swim bladder. It enters river mouths and comes close to beaches, reaching 20–50 kg. It fights hard and long.":"Velika srebrnasta sjenka sa zlatnim ustima. Za mrijesta glasno «kruli» plivaćim mjehurom. Ulazi u ušća i prilazi plažama, naraste do 20–50 kg. Bori se snažno i dugo.","Salt and pepper the steaks.":"Posolite i popaprite odreske.","April – October.":"Travanj – listopad.","Morning and daytime in calm weather.":"Jutro i dan po mirnom vremenu.","Morning, evening and night under lights.":"Jutro, večer i noć pod svjetlima.","Always banned: dusky grouper (orfoz), blue shark, spiny dogfish, tope, many other sharks and rays, eel, Black Sea trout, sturgeons, sea turtles, seahorses, noble pen shell, red coral, spider crab (Maja), monk seal, dolphins. White grouper (lagos) from 50 cm and any other groupers: no more than 1, closed from 1 June to 31 August.":"Uvijek zabranjeno: kirnja (orfoz), modrulj, kostelj, pas butor, mnogi drugi morski psi i raže, jegulja, crnomorska pastrva, jesetre, morske kornjače, morski konjici, plemenita periska, crveni koralj, rakovica (Maja), sredozemna medvjedica, dupini. Bijela kirnja (lagos) od 50 cm i sve druge kirnje: najviše 1 komad, zabrana od 1. lipnja do 31. kolovoza.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. Up to 5 per licence per day (albacore, bigeye and hake together), up to 20 per boat.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Do 5 komada dnevno po dozvoli (dugoperajna tuna, okan i oslić zajedno), do 20 po brodu.","A large flatfish with its eyes on the left side and bony tubercles on the skin instead of scales. It lies buried in sand and grabs passing fish. Can reach 10–15 kg; one of the most prized fish in the kitchen.":"Velika plosnatica s očima na lijevoj strani i koštanim kvržicama na koži umjesto ljusaka. Leži zakopana u pijesku i hvata ribu koja prolazi. Naraste do 10–15 kg; jedna od najcjenjenijih riba u kuhinji.","Scrape off the tubercles and cut the fish across into 3 cm pieces.":"Očistite ribu od kvržica i narežite je poprečno na komade od 3 cm.","Grill for 8–10 minutes per side and squeeze over lemon.":"Pecite na žaru po 8–10 minuta sa svake strane i prelijte limunom.","All year, best autumn and winter.":"Cijele godine, najbolje jesen i zima.","Balearic Islands (Decret 34/2014, DG Pesca resolution of 05.02.2025): individual licence (shore, kayak; from 14) for 3 years, spearfishing (from 16) for a year, boat licence. Free over 65. Licences of other regions are valid.":"Baleari (Decret 34/2014, Resolució DG Pesca 05.02.2025): pojedinačna dozvola (obala, kajak; od 14 godina) na 3 godine, podvodna (od 16 godina) na godinu, za brod. Nakon 65 godina besplatno. Dozvole drugih regija vrijede.","Bread, dough, cheese, small worm; bread groundbait.":"Kruh, tijesto, sir, sitni crv; primama od kruha.","the Turkish Ministry of Agriculture and Forestry":"Ministarstvo poljoprivrede i šumarstva Turske","In Andalusia anglers may only take fish: release it.":"U Andaluziji rekreativci smiju loviti samo ribu: pustiti.","Fried whiting":"Prženi pišmolj","Sabiki (çapari) rigs, pieces of fish and prawn, small spoons.":"Svićarica (çapari), komadići ribe i kozice, male varalice.","June – November.":"Lipanj – studeni.","Bake for 25–30 minutes at 200 °C, crack the crust and peel off the skin.":"Pecite 25–30 minuta na 200 °C, razbijte koru i skinite kožu.","A close relative of the sea bass, but smaller and with dark spots on the back and flanks. It likes the brackish water of river mouths and lagoons. Usually 0.3–1 kg.":"Bliski srodnik lubina, ali manji i s tamnim pjegicama na leđima i bokovima. Voli bočatu vodu ušća i laguna. Obično 0,3–1 kg.","Sandy beaches, river mouths, lagoons and breakwaters, murky water.":"Pješčane plaže, ušća, lagune i lukobrani, mutna voda.","Cut the vegetables into sticks and steam for 8 minutes.":"Narežite povrće na štapiće i kuhajte na pari 8 minuta.","Sources: RD 347/2011 (as amended by RD 214/2026), Orders of 26.02.1999 and 24.07.2000 (catch limits), RD 560/1995 (as amended by RD 936/2025), (EU) 2019/1241 (that regulation does not apply all its articles to anglers, so its sizes serve here as a safe minimum); regional laws are named in their rules. The rules of Valencia and Asturias have not been checked against official texts: their websites did not open, so the general Spanish rules are shown for them.":"Izvori: RD 347/2011 (izmjena RD 214/2026), Orden 26.02.1999 i 24.07.2000 (ograničenja ulova), RD 560/1995 (izmjena RD 936/2025), (EU) 2019/1241 (ta uredba ne primjenjuje sve članke na rekreativce, pa njezine mjere ovdje služe kao siguran minimum); zakoni regija navedeni su u njihovim pravilima. Pravila Valencije i Asturije nisu provjerena prema službenim tekstovima: njihove stranice se nisu otvarale, pa su za njih prikazana opća španjolska pravila.","Boat: 200 m from fishing vessels and gear, 150 m from beaches, divers' buoys and shore anglers, 30 m from other boats. Spearfishing: 150 m from gear, boats and beaches, daytime only, not on artificial reefs.":"Brod: 200 m od ribarskih brodova i alata, 150 m od plaža, plutača ronilaca i ribolovaca na obali, 30 m od drugih brodova. Podvodni ribolov: 150 m od alata, brodova i plaža, samo danju, ne na umjetnim grebenima.","Dress with oil and lemon and season with pepper.":"Prelijte uljem i limunom, popaprite.","Soft shads, jigs, plugs, live sand eel.":"Silikonske ribice, jigovi, wobbleri, živa hujica.","A drum with a short barbel on the chin and oblique golden-grey stripes. It digs in the sand for worms and crabs, especially in the surf at night. Usually 1–3 kg, up to 10 kg.":"Grb s kratkom brčicom na bradi i kosim zlatnosivim prugama. Rije po pijesku tražeći crve i rakove, osobito noću u valovima. Obično 1–3 kg, do 10 kg.","steaks 1 kg, 4 garlic cloves, parsley, olive oil, lemon, salt, pepper":"odresci 1 kg, 4 češnja češnjaka, peršin, maslinovo ulje, limun, sol, papar","Where you may not fish: in buoyed swimming areas within 200 m of the shore from 1 April to 15 November; within 100 m of fish farm cages and 200 m of shore-based farms; in military zones; near monk seal caves; in the shipping separation zones of the Bosphorus and the Dardanelles. There are closed areas at Kaş, Kemer (Üç Adalar), Fethiye, Hisarönü, Gökova, the Gulf of İzmir, Gökçeada, Anamur and Erdemli in Mersin, Yalova, Samsun and elsewhere. Maps are in the annexes to the tebliğ.":"Gdje ne: u kupalištima ograđenim plutačama do 200 m od obale od 1. travnja do 15. studenoga; bliže od 100 m kavezima ribogojilišta i 200 m kopnenim farmama; u vojnim zonama; kod spilja sredozemne medvjedice; u zonama odvojenog prometa u Bosporu i Dardanelima. Zatvoreni dijelovi postoje kod Kaşa, Kemera (Üç Adalar), Fethiyea, Hisarönüa, Gökove, u Izmirskom zaljevu, kod Gökçeade, Anamura i Erdemlija u Mersinu, Yalove, Samsuna i drugdje. Karte su u prilozima tebliğa.","Octopus: closed 01.04–30.06 and 01.09–31.10 for all recreational fishing (Order of 08.09.2025).":"Hobotnica: zabrana 01.04–30.06 i 01.09–31.10 za svaki rekreacijski ribolov (Orden 08.09.2025).","Fried turbot, Black Sea style":"Prženi oblić na crnomorski način","From 1 September 2027 recreational boats used for fishing need an Amatör Balıkçı Gemisi Ruhsat Tezkeresi certificate.":"Od 1. rujna 2027. rekreacijskim brodovima s kojih se lovi potrebna je potvrda Amatör Balıkçı Gemisi Ruhsat Tezkeresi.","Live fish, squid, octopus; big jigs.":"Živa riba, lignja, hobotnica; veliki jigovi.","No more than 2 per person per day, 3 per boat.":"Najviše 2 komada dnevno po osobi, 3 po brodu.","Salt and roll in cornmeal.":"Posolite i uvaljajte u kukuruzno brašno.","All year, best April – November.":"Cijele godine, najbolje travanj – studeni.","Slice the potatoes and onion, lay them in a dish, salt and drizzle with oil.":"Narežite krumpir na kolute, luk na polukolute, složite u posudu, posolite i prelijte uljem.","No more than 1 per licence per day.":"Najviše 1 komad dnevno po dozvoli.","Rocks, stony banks and wrecks in the Atlantic, from the shore down to 100 m.":"Stijene, kamenite pličine i olupine Atlantika, od obale do 100 m.","Mix the flour with the cold water until thick like sour cream.":"Pomiješajte brašno s hladnom vodom do gustoće kiselog vrhnja.","Sources: Tebliğ 6/2 on recreational fishing (Resmî Gazete 32629, 11.08.2024), amendments 2025/12 and 2026/26 (Resmî Gazete 33372, 16.09.2026).":"Izvori: Tebliğ 6/2 o rekreacijskom ribolovu (Resmî Gazete 32629, 11.08.2024), izmjene 2025/12 i 2026/26 (Resmî Gazete 33372, 16.09.2026).","Gear: up to 4 rods or handlines with up to 6 hooks each (a lure counts as one hook), plus one çapari rig with up to 15 hooks. A cast net (serpme) up to 3 m high with mesh from 28 mm and a bait net up to 5 m are allowed. Banned: snagging rigs with a treble hook (çarpma), unattended lines, longlines (parakete), traps, other nets, tırıvırı, fishing with lights (boat and shore lighting up to 50 W is fine), pitchforks, explosives and poisons. No time-of-day limits.":"Alat: do 4 štapa ili ručna povraza, na svakom do 6 udica (varalica se broji kao jedna udica), plus jedna svićarica (çapari) do 15 udica. Dopuštene su bacačica (serpme) visine do 3 m s okom od 28 mm i mreža za mamac do 5 m. Zabranjeni su: trzajni pribor s trokukom (çarpma), ostavljeni povrazi, parangali (parakete), vrše, druge mreže, tırıvırı, lov na svjetlo (rasvjeta broda i obale do 50 W je dopuštena), ostve, eksplozivi i otrovi. Doba dana nije ograničeno.","No more than 3 per licence per day.":"Najviše 3 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Gut the fish and trim off the scutes along the lateral line.":"Očistite ribu i odrežite pločice duž bočne pruge.","Sizes: national ones under RD 560/1995 (separate tables for the Mediterranean and the Atlantic) and EU rules; regions set their own, usually stricter. Octopus from 1 kg throughout Spain (RD 936/2025), except the Balearic Islands. In the Cantabrian Sea and the north-west sea bass from 42 cm (RD 347/2011, art. 4 bis).":"Mjere: državne prema RD 560/1995 (posebne tablice za Sredozemlje i Atlantik) i pravila EU; regije propisuju svoje, obično strože. Hobotnica u cijeloj Španjolskoj od 1 kg (RD 936/2025), osim na Balearima. U Kantabrijskom moru i na sjeverozapadu lubin od 42 cm (RD 347/2011, čl. 4 bis).","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. East of Santa Clara island (San Sebastián): from 44 cm and 1 a day.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Istočno od otoka Santa Clara (San Sebastián): od 44 cm i 1 komad dnevno.","Fry in well-heated oil for 4–5 minutes per side. Serve with lemon and rocket.":"Pržite na dobro zagrijanom ulju po 4–5 minuta sa svake strane. Poslužite s limunom i rikolom.","No more than 1 per day.":"Najviše 1 komad dnevno.","Turkish citizens need no document. A foreign tourist may fish the sea from the shore without a permit. To fish from a boat you need an avlanma fişi slip from the provincial or district agriculture directorate (il/ilçe müdürlüğü), or go out with an operator holding a recreational fishing tourism licence. Foreigners living in Turkey get a Misafir Amatör Balıkçı Belgesi card valid for 2 years. Selling the catch is banned.":"Turskim državljanima dokument nije potreban. Strani turist lovi u moru s obale bez dozvole. Za ribolov s broda potreban je listić avlanma fişi od pokrajinske ili okružne uprave za poljoprivredu (il/ilçe müdürlüğü) ili izlazak s operaterom koji ima dozvolu za rekreacijski ribolovni turizam. Stranci koji žive u Turskoj dobivaju iskaznicu Misafir Amatör Balıkçı Belgesi na 2 godine. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena.","fillets 700 g, courgette, carrot, celery, olive oil, lemon, salt, pepper":"fileti 700 g, tikvica, mrkva, celer, maslinovo ulje, limun, sol, papar","Asturias (Ley 2/1993, Decreto 25/2006): licences for shore, boat and spearfishing; national licences and those of other regions are valid. 5 kg per licence, the largest fish does not count. Octopus seasons and limits are set every year. The official texts could not be checked: see pesca.asturias.es.":"Asturija (Ley 2/1993, Decreto 25/2006): dozvole s obale, s broda i za podvodni ribolov; državne dozvole i dozvole drugih regija vrijede. 5 kg po dozvoli, najveća riba se ne broji. Rokovi i ograničenja za hobotnicu određuju se svake godine. Službene tekstove nije bilo moguće provjeriti: provjerite na pesca.asturias.es.","A separate temporary authorisation is needed, no more than 1 a day.":"Potrebna je posebna privremena dozvola, najviše 1 komad dnevno.","Catalonia (Decret 109/1995, resolutions ARP/3253/2024 north, ARP/3311/2025 centre, ARP/3310/2025 south): licence for 1–2 days, 15 days or 1–4 years, online; free under 18 and over 65. Licences of other Spanish Mediterranean regions are valid, Atlantic ones and those of other EU countries are not.":"Katalonija (Decret 109/1995, rezolucije ARP/3253/2024 sjever, ARP/3311/2025 središte, ARP/3310/2025 jug): dozvola na 1–2 dana, 15 dana ili 1–4 godine, online; do 18 i nakon 65 godina besplatno. Vrijede dozvole drugih sredozemnih regija Španjolske, atlantskih i drugih zemalja EU ne.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. No more than 3 per licence per day.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Najviše 3 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","fish 800 g, flour, oil for frying, lemon, onion, salt":"riba 800 g, brašno, ulje za prženje, limun, luk, sol","Cantabria (Decreto 45/2002): 1st class licence (shore and boat, 5 years, from 16, or from 14 with parental consent) and 2nd class for spearfishing (1 year, from 16, medical certificate and insurance).":"Kantabrija (Decreto 45/2002): dozvola 1. razreda (obala i brod, 5 godina, od 16 godina ili od 14 uz pristanak roditelja) i 2. razreda za podvodni ribolov (1 godina, od 16 godina, liječnička potvrda i osiguranje).","fish 800 g, flour, oil for frying, lemon, salt":"riba 800 g, brašno, ulje za prženje, limun, sol","A predator of the cod family with a jutting lower jaw and a dark curved lateral line. It holds by rocks and wrecks, hits a lure hard and dives straight back into the rocks. Usually 1–5 kg.":"Grabežljivac iz porodice bakalara s istaknutom donjom čeljusti i tamnom zakrivljenom bočnom prugom. Drži se stijena i olupina, naglo napada mamac i odmah bježi u kamenje. Obično 1–5 kg.","Shoals by piers, breakwaters and over banks; in the Black Sea all along the shore.":"Jata uz mulove, lukobrane i iznad pličina; u Crnom moru posvuda uz obalu.","River mouths, lagoons, beaches and breakwaters in southern Spain and the Aegean.":"Ušća, lagune, plaže i lukobrani na jugu Španjolske i u Egejskom moru.","Fry for 3–4 minutes per side and serve with lemon.":"Pržite po 3–4 minute sa svake strane, poslužite s limunom.","Special regime (Annex II of RD 347/2011): a boat in outer waters needs an authorisation in the MAPA app; report catches and releases in it within 24 h. No more than 5 per licence per day.":"Poseban režim (pril. II RD 347/2011): za brod u vanjskim vodama potrebna je dozvola u aplikaciji MAPA, ulov i puštanje prijaviti u njoj u roku od 24 h. Najviše 5 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Night, morning, murky water after a storm.":"Noć, jutro, mutna voda nakon nevremena.","Valencian Community (Ley 5/2017, Decreto 41/2013): a licence is needed from the shore, from a boat and for spearfishing. A new decree is being prepared. The official texts could not be checked, so the general Spanish rules apply here; check with the Conselleria de Agricultura.":"Valencijska zajednica (Ley 5/2017, Decreto 41/2013): dozvola je potrebna s obale, s broda i za podvodni ribolov. Priprema se nova uredba. Službene tekstove nije bilo moguće provjeriti, pa ovdje vrijede opća španjolska pravila; raspitajte se u Conselleria de Agricultura.","Catch per person: up to 5 kg of fish in total. One fish over 5 kg is allowed, and if the last fish takes you over the limit, the catch without the largest fish must not exceed 4 kg. For species with a numeric limit weight does not count, but no more than 3 such fish in total. This is the total you may take away, however many days you fish. A 5 % tolerance for undersized fish applies.":"Ulov po osobi: ukupno do 5 kg ribe. Jedna riba teža od 5 kg je dopuštena, a ako je granicu premašila posljednja riba, ulov bez najveće ribe ne smije biti veći od 4 kg. Za vrste s ograničenjem komada težina se ne broji, ali takvih riba ukupno najviše 3. To je ukupna količina koju smijete odnijeti, koliko god dana lovili. Po veličini dopušteno je 5 % premalih riba.","Salt and roll in flour.":"Posolite i uvaljajte u brašno.","No more than 2 per person per day, 2 per boat.":"Najviše 2 komada dnevno po osobi, 2 po brodu.","Prawn, worm, small plugs and soft lures.":"Kozica, crv, mali wobbleri i silikonci.","No more than 5 per licence per day.":"Najviše 5 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Anglers may not take crustaceans: release it.":"Rakove rekreativci ne smiju loviti: pustiti.","Serve with lemon and onion.":"Poslužite s limunom i lukom.","Basque Country (Decreto 198/2000): surface and spearfishing licences. 5 kg per licence or one larger fish; from a boat with 5 or more licences 25 kg; spearfishing 5 kg. Swordfish and bluefin tuna are banned.":"Baskija (Decreto 198/2000): dozvole za površinski i podvodni ribolov. 5 kg po dozvoli ili jedna veća riba; s broda s 5 i više dozvola 25 kg; podvodni ribolov 5 kg. Iglan i plavoperajna tuna su zabranjeni.","No more than 3 per day.":"Najviše 3 komada dnevno.","fish 1 kg (unscaled), coarse salt 1.5 kg, 2 egg whites, lemon, thyme":"riba 1 kg (ne čistiti od ljusaka), krupna sol 1,5 kg, 2 bjelanjka, limun, timijan","Gut the fish without scaling it and put lemon and thyme inside.":"Očistite ribu bez skidanja ljusaka i stavite unutra limun i timijan.","Meagre steaks with garlic":"Odresci hame s češnjakom","Sea bass baked in salt":"Lubin u soli","Spearfishing: daytime only, breath-hold, with a gun that uses no gas or explosive, with a buoy and no more than 25 m from it. Scuba gear and scooters must not be on board together with the gun; do not load the gun out of the water. A separate licence is needed, usually with a medical certificate and insurance.":"Podvodni ribolov: samo danju, na dah, s puškom bez plina i eksploziva, s plutačom i ne dalje od 25 m od nje. Ronilački aparati i podvodni skuteri ne smiju biti na brodu zajedno s puškom, pušku ne puniti izvan vode. Potrebna je posebna dozvola, obično uz liječničku potvrdu i osiguranje.","You need a recreational fishing licence (pesca marítima de recreo): from the shore, from a boat and for spearfishing. It is issued by the autonomous region where you fish (for a boat, the region of its home port), usually online; foreigners apply with a passport. A licence from one region is not valid everywhere else, see the regional rules below. Selling the catch is banned.":"Potrebna je dozvola za rekreacijski ribolov (pesca marítima de recreo): s obale, s broda i za podvodni ribolov. Izdaje je autonomna zajednica u kojoj lovite (za brod zajednica matične luke), obično online; strancima uz putovnicu. Dozvola jedne regije ne vrijedi posvuda u drugima, pogledajte pravila regije ispod. Prodaja ulova je zabranjena.","Andalusia (Decreto 361/2003): licences for shore, boat, collective boat and spearfishing; shore and boat from age 14, for 3 years, unlimited after 65. Shore and boat licences of other regions, national ones and EU ones are valid.":"Andaluzija (Decreto 361/2003): dozvole s obale, s broda, skupna za brod i za podvodni ribolov; s obale i s broda od 14 godina, na 3 godine, nakon 65 trajne. Dozvole s obale i s broda drugih regija, državne i zemalja EU vrijede.","Fish and cephalopods may be taken, except eel. 5 kg per licence plus one fish; octopus 2 a day. From a boat with more than 3 licences at most 16 kg. You may collect bait: up to 50 worms, 40 crabs, 200 g of sandhoppers, 100 g of shrimps. No fishing at river mouths during the salmon and sea trout run.":"Smije se loviti riba i glavonošci, osim jegulje. 5 kg po dozvoli plus jedna riba; hobotnica 2 komada dnevno. S broda s više od 3 dozvole najviše 16 kg. Mamac se smije skupljati: do 50 crva, 40 rakova, 200 g morskih buha, 100 g kozica. Za vrijeme migracije lososa i pastrve na ušćima rijeka ne smije se loviti.","From the shore up to 2 rods with 3 hooks each or 1 squid jig; from a boat 2 rigs per person with 3 hooks each. No live fish on the hook and no live fish as groundbait. Not within 200 m of professional gear and fish farms, no fishing in the Estacio channel (La Manga). Spearfishing not within 250 m of beaches.":"S obale do 2 štapa s po 3 udice ili 1 poteza; s broda 2 pribora po osobi s po 3 udice. Ne smije se živa riba na udici ni živi mamac za primamu. Ne bliže od 200 m profesionalnom alatu i ribogojilištima, u kanalu Estacio (La Manga) lov je zabranjen. Podvodni ribolov ne bliže od 250 m plažama.","Salt the fillets, lay them on the vegetables and steam for 8–10 more minutes.":"Posolite filete, stavite ih na povrće i kuhajte na pari još 8–10 minuta.","Only fish may be taken: no cephalopods, crustaceans or shellfish, squid jigs are banned. 5 kg per licence plus one fish. Up to 6 hooks per licence (a lure counts as a hook), no more than 2 rods from the shore, no electric reels.":"Smije se loviti samo riba: glavonošce, rakove i školjke ne, poteze su zabranjene. 5 kg po dozvoli plus jedna riba. Do 6 udica po dozvoli (varalica se broji kao udica), s obale najviše 2 štapa, bez električnih vitla.","Dawn, dusk and night.":"Svitanje, sumrak i noć.","fish 1 kg in pieces, tomatoes 500 g, onion, garlic, white wine 100 ml, olive oil, parsley, salt":"riba 1 kg u komadima, rajčice 500 g, luk, češnjak, bijelo vino 100 ml, maslinovo ulje, peršin, sol","Worm, prawn, crab, squid on a bottom rig.":"Crv, kozica, rak, lignja na pridnenom priboru.","Species sizes and bag limits are for the centre and south (Barcelona, Tarragona). In the north (Girona) some rules differ: see resolution ARP/3253/2024.":"Mjere i ograničenja komada po vrstama dana su za središte i jug (Barcelona, Tarragona). Na sjeveru (Girona) dio pravila je drukčiji: pogledajte rezoluciju ARP/3253/2024.","Morning, evening and the turn of the tide.":"Jutro, večer i promjena plime.","Galicia (Decreto 211/1999, Order of 17.09.2009): surface licence (shore and boat) or spearfishing licence, for 1 year, via Sipmar. National licences and those of other regions and EU countries are valid.":"Galicija (Decreto 211/1999, Orden 17.09.2009): dozvola za površinski ribolov (obala i brod) ili podvodni, na 1 godinu, preko Sipmara. Dozvole države, drugih regija i zemalja EU vrijede.","No more than 4 per licence per day.":"Najviše 4 komada dnevno po dozvoli.","Bake for 35–40 minutes at 200 °C.":"Pecite 35–40 minuta na 200 °C.","Only with an e-BCD document from the provincial or district agriculture directorate, within the recreational quota. No more than 1 fish, length to the fork of the tail. Without the document, release it.":"Samo uz dokument e-BCD od uprave za poljoprivredu (il/ilçe müdürlüğü), u okviru kvote za rekreativce. Najviše 1 komad, duljina do račve repa. Bez dokumenta pustiti.","A paler grouper than the dusky one, with two or three light oblique stripes on the cheek. It keeps deeper over sand and rocks. It grows slowly and all fish are born female; big ones are rare. Usually 2–10 kg.":"Kirnja svjetlija od obične, s dvije-tri svijetle kose pruge na obrazu. Drži se dublje uz pijesak i kamenje. Raste sporo, sve ribe rađaju se kao ženke; veliki primjerci su rijetki. Obično 2–10 kg.","Whole fried horse mackerel":"Šarun pržen u cijelosti","Clean the fish, remove the head and guts and salt it.":"Očistite ribu, uklonite glavu i utrobu, posolite.","Live mullet or horse mackerel, squid, prawn, big plugs and soft lures.":"Živi cipal ili šarun, lignja, kozica, veliki wobbleri i silikonci.","May – November.":"Svibanj – studeni.","Sandy beaches, surf, river mouths and rocks next to sand.":"Pješčane plaže, valovi, ušća rijeka i stijene uz pijesak.","A mullet with a thick, warty upper lip. Wary, it shoals near the surface and takes bread on a float rig well. It tolerates cold water and so feeds in winter. Usually 0.5–2 kg.":"Cipal s debelom bradavičastom gornjom usnom. Oprezan, drži se u jatima blizu površine i dobro uzima kruh na plovak. Podnosi hladnu vodu pa je aktivan i zimi. Obično 0,5–2 kg.","Fry in a pan with oil for 4 minutes per side.":"Pržite na tavi s uljem po 4 minute sa svake strane.","A small fish of the cod family with a dark spot at the base of the pectoral fin. It shoals near the bottom and is one of the main winter catches from the shore and boats in the Black Sea. Usually 20–30 cm, with tender flesh.":"Mala riba iz porodice bakalara s tamnom mrljom u dnu prsne peraje. Kreće se u jatima pri dnu, u Crnom moru jedan je od glavnih zimskih ulova s obale i broda. Obično 20–30 cm, nježnog mesa.","Rub with salt, put garlic and rosemary inside and brush with oil.":"Natrljajte solju, stavite unutra češnjak i ružmarin i premažite uljem.","Octopus closed season: Menorca May–June, Mallorca June–July, Ibiza and Formentera 15.07–15.10. Up to 2 rods per person from a boat, up to 2 rods with one lure each from the shore. No fishing on beaches from 1 May to 30 September between 7:00 and 22:00, nor within 250 m of professional gear.":"Zabrana za hobotnicu: Menorca svibanj–lipanj, Mallorca lipanj–srpanj, Ibiza i Formentera 15.07–15.10. S broda do 2 štapa po osobi, s obale do 2 štapa s jednim mamcem na svakom. Na plažama od 1. svibnja do 30. rujna od 7 do 22 h ne smije se loviti, ni bliže od 250 m profesionalnom alatu.","Clean the fish, rinse the belly well and remove the dark lining.":"Očistite ribu i dobro isperite trbušnu šupljinu, uklonite tamnu opnu.","November – April.":"Studeni – travanj.","No more than 1 per person per day, 1 per boat.":"Najviše 1 komad dnevno po osobi, 1 po brodu.","Rocks, kelp and reefs right along the Atlantic shore, 1–20 m.":"Stijene, alge i podvodne hridi tik uz atlantsku obalu, 1–20 m.","Privacy policy":"Pravila privatnosti"};
